<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NUM" style="id">- Kwere Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Peta</para>
  <para style="toc1">Peta</para>
  <para style="toc2">Peta</para>
  <para style="toc3">Pet</para>
  <para style="mt">Peta</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Hisabu choloonga cholonga mbuli ya miyanza malongo mane ya wana wa Isilaili kufosela kwiichuwala, viwakalile wang'hali hawanakwingila muna iisi ya lagano, yani isi ya Kanaani. Chitabu chenyewo chotangigwa Peta kwaviya china hanhu haidi holava peta ya walume watowang'hondo wakalile muna chila kabila da Isilaili (sula 1 na 26). Kimahokelo, wasomi wa mbuli za Chibiblia wohuwila kuwa chitabu cha Peta na vitabu vimwenga va malagilizi (Mwanduso na Kulawa na Walawi na Kumbukumbu da Malagilizo), vandikigwa na mulotezi Musa. Ukweli uno ulongigwa chidogo na chitabu chanyewo kwa kulonga Mndewa Mulungu kalonga na Musa (Peta 1:1). Yodahika Musa kandika hanhu hakulu ha chitabu chenyewo, na wandikaji wamwenga wongezela chidogo muna imiyaka isondelele hamwande. Mfano, Vidala kugesa kuwa Musa yahadahile kuwa kandika aya fana ya Peta 12:3, hanhu haja unyendanyenda wake mwenyewo utogoligwa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Muna umwanza wawo wa kwiichuwala, wana wa Isilaili walongelela na kumuleka Mulungu miyanza mingi. Kwa sang'hano zawo izo watagusigwa. Mfano wa mbuli ino ni lusita Waisilaili viwadumbile na kulongelela kuwa Wakanaani wakala na nguvu ng'hani kufosa wawo (Peta 14:1-4). Kwa sang'hano ino, Mulungu kalonga wawo wose wokala lusita luwo wahadanganike ing'hali Waisilaili hawanakwingila muna iisi ya chilagano. Ifika mbaka Musa mwenyewo kaleka kumtegeleza Mulungu, na kwa ichimu chino hata yeye hadahile kwingila muna iisi ya chilagano. Ingawa wanhu wamuleka Mulungu, yeye kagendelela kuwakaliza. Wehi wa Waisilaili viwamgoneke mulotezi wa chimhazi yatangigwe Balaamu yalave duwilo kusonhela Waisilaili, Mulungu kamuleka yalonge kutemeligwa mate muhala kumwao (Peta 22-24).</para>
  <para style="iot">Mbuli zilimuno</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Sula 1 mbaka 10:11 zolonga mbuli ya kupetigwa kwa Waisilaili, iviya mpangilio wa malago yawo viuwile na sang'hano za wakulu wa nhambiko na nhambiko ziduganyigwe kulawa chila kabila lusita lupango vivikigwe hakwe.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Maabaho chitabu cha Peta cholonga kusonhela mwanza wa Waisilaili kufosela kwiichuwala muna isula ya 10:12 mbaka sula ya 25.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Sula ya 26 mbaka 36 zolonga kusonhela kupetigwa mwanza wekaidi kwa Waisilaili na mbuli zimwenga. Yolonga mazina ya hanhu Waisilaili howekile malago yawo viwakalile muna umwanza kuhita kuna iisi ya chilagano, na viya isi iyo viilondeke kugoligwa hagati ya makabila yose vonda wengile muna iisi yawo.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NUM 1" />
  <para style="s">Watowang'hondo wa Isilaili wopetigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 1:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa kuna ichuwala cha Sinai, muna dihema da Mulungu, siku ya mwanduso ya mwezi wekaidi wa mwaka wekaidi viwamalile kulawa muna iisi ya Misili. Kalonga, <verse eid="NUM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 1:2" />“Wapeteni Waisilaili, kwa kusondelela ng'holo zawo na kaye zawo, peteni kwa kusondelela mazina ya walume, imwe imwe, <verse eid="NUM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 1:3" />waja wodaha kuitowa kuna ing'hondo, kwandusila weli na miyaka malongo maidi na kugendelela, weye na Haluni mwizayandika mazina yawo. <verse eid="NUM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 1:4" />Na mulume imwe kulawa chila kabila kezakuwa hamwe na mweye, chila munhu yeli mulangulizi wa kaye ya tati yake. <verse eid="NUM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 1:5" />Yano yayo mazina ya walume wondawakutaze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 1:5">kulawa kabila da Lubeni, Elisuli mwana wa Shedueli,<verse eid="NUM 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 1:6" />kulawa kabila da Simeoni, Shelumieli mwana wa Sulishadai,<verse eid="NUM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 1:7" />kulawa kabila da Yuda, Nashoni mwana wa Aminadabu,<verse eid="NUM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 1:8" />kulawa kabila da Isakali, Nasanaeli mwana wa Suali,<verse eid="NUM 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 1:9" />kulawa kabila da Zabuloni, Eliabu mwana wa Heloni,<verse eid="NUM 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 1:10" />kulawa muna yamakabila ya wana wa Yosefu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 1:10">kabila da Efulaimu, Elishama mwana wa Amihudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 1:10">kabila da Manase, Gamalieli mwana wa Pedasuli,<verse eid="NUM 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 1:11" />kulawa kabila da Benjamini, Abidani mwana wa Gidioni,<verse eid="NUM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 1:12" />kulawa kabila da Dani, Ahiezeli mwana Amishadai,<verse eid="NUM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 1:13" />kulawa kabila da Asheli, Pagieli mwana wa Okilani,<verse eid="NUM 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 1:14" />kulawa kabila da Gadi, Eliasafu mwana wa Deueli,<verse eid="NUM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 1:15" />kulawa kabila da Nafutali, Ahila mwana wa Enani.”<verse eid="NUM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 1:16" />Wawo niiyo wasaguligwe kulawa hana umting'hano, walangulizi wa makabila ya tati zawo, walangulizi wa ng'holo za Waisilaili.<verse eid="NUM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 1:17" />Musa na Haluni wawasola walume wano wowatambuligwe mazina yawo, <verse eid="NUM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 1:18" />na wawatanga hamwe wanhu wose, siku ya mwanduso ya mwezi wekaidi, nawo walume wapetigwa kulawa muna zing'holo za wasaho zawo, kwa kaye za tati zawo, fana viili peta ya mazina, kwandusila weli na miyaka malongo maidi na kugendelela, imwe imwe, <verse eid="NUM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 1:19" />fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize Musa. Ivo kawapeta kuna ichuwala cha Sinai.<verse eid="NUM 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 1:20" />Wanhu wa kabila da Lubeni mwana wa udele wa Isilaili, walume wose weli na miyaka malongo maidi na kugendelela wowadahile kuhita kuitowa kuna ing'hondo, wapetigwa kwa mazina, imwe imwe, kwa kusondelela ng'holo zawo na kaye zawo. <verse eid="NUM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 1:21" />Waja wa kabila da Lubeni wapetigwe wakala 46,500.<verse eid="NUM 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 1:22" />Wanhu wa kabila da Simeoni, walume wose weli na miyaka malongo maidi na kugendelela wowadahile kuitowa kuna ing'hondo, wapetigwa kwa mazina, imwe imwe, kwa kusondelela ng'holo zawo na kaye zawo. <verse eid="NUM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 1:23" />Waja wa kabila da Simeoni wapetigwe wakala 59,300.<verse eid="NUM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 1:24" />Wanhu wa kabila da Gadi, walume wose weli na miyaka malongo maidi na kugendelela wowadahile kuitowa kuna ing'hondo, wapetigwa kwa mazina, kwa kusondelela ng'holo zawo na kaye zawo. <verse eid="NUM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 1:25" />Waja wa kabila da Gadi wapetigwe wakala 45,650.<verse eid="NUM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 1:26" />Wanhu wa kabila da Yuda, walume wose weli na miyaka malongo maidi na kugendelela wowadahile kuitowa kuna ing'hondo, wapetigwa kwa mazina, kwa kusondelela ng'holo zawo na kaye zawo. <verse eid="NUM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 1:27" />Waja wa kabila da Yuda wapetigwe wakala 74,600.<verse eid="NUM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 1:28" />Wanhu wa kabila da Isakali, walume wose weli na miyaka malongo maidi na kugendelela wowadahile kuitowa kuna ing'hondo, wapetigwa kwa mazina, kwa kusondelela ng'holo zawo na kaye zawo. <verse eid="NUM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 1:29" />Waja wa kabila da Isakali wapetigwe wakala 54,400.<verse eid="NUM 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 1:30" />Wanhu wa kabila da Zabuloni, walume wose weli na miyaka malongo maidi na kugendelela wowadahile kuitowa kuna ing'hondo, wapetigwa kwa mazina, kwa kusondelela ng'holo zawo na kaye zawo. <verse eid="NUM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 1:31" />Waja wa kabila da Zabuloni wapetigwe wakala 57,400.<verse eid="NUM 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 1:32" />Wanhu wa kabila da Efulaimu, mwana wa Yosefu, walume wose weli na miyaka malongo maidi na kugendelela wowadahile kuitowa kuna ing'hondo, wapetigwa kwa mazina, kwa kusondelela ng'holo zawo na kaye zawo. <verse eid="NUM 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 1:33" />Waja wa kabila da Efulaimu wapetigwe wakala 40,500.<verse eid="NUM 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 1:34" />Wanhu wa kabila da Manase, mwana wa Yosefu, walume wose weli na miyaka malongo maidi na kugendelela wowadahile kuitowa kuna ing'hondo, wapetigwa kwa mazina, kwa kusondelela ng'holo zawo na kaye zawo. <verse eid="NUM 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 1:35" />Waja wa kabila da Manase wapetigwe wakala 32,200.<verse eid="NUM 1:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 1:36" />Wanhu wa kabila da Benjamini, walume wose weli na miyaka malongo maidi na kugendelela wowadahile kuitowa kuna ing'hondo, wapetigwa kwa mazina, kwa kusondelela ng'holo zawo na kaye zawo. <verse eid="NUM 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 1:37" />Waja wa kabila da Benjamini wapetigwe wakala 35,400.<verse eid="NUM 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 1:38" />Wanhu wa kabila da Dani, walume wose weli na miyaka malongo maidi na kugendelela wowadahile kuitowa kuna ing'hondo, wapetigwa kwa mazina, kwa kusondelela ng'holo zawo na kaye zawo. <verse eid="NUM 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 1:39" />Waja wa kabila da Dani wapetigwe wakala 62,700.<verse eid="NUM 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 1:40" />Wanhu wa kabila da Asheli, walume wose weli na miyaka malongo maidi na kugendelela wowadahile kuitowa kuna ing'hondo, wapetigwa kwa mazina, kwa kusondelela ng'holo zawo na kaye zawo. <verse eid="NUM 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 1:41" />Waja wa kabila da Asheli wapetigwe wakala 41,500.<verse eid="NUM 1:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 1:42" />Wanhu wa kabila da Nafutali, walume wose weli na miyaka malongo maidi na kugendelela wowadahile kuitowa kuna ing'hondo, wapetigwa kwa mazina, kwa kusondelela ng'holo zawo na kaye zawo. <verse eid="NUM 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 1:43" />Waja wa kabila da Nafutali wapetigwe wakala 53,400.<verse eid="NUM 1:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 1:44" />Wawo niiyo walume wapetigwe, waja Musa na Haluni wawapeta kwa kutazigwa na waja walangulizi wa Isilaili longo na waidi, chila imwe kwa ichimu cha kaye ya tati yake. <verse eid="NUM 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 1:45" />Ivo walume wose wa Isilaili wapetigwa, weli na miyaka malongo maidi na kugendelela wowadahile kuitowa kuna ing'hondo, kwa kusondelela ng'holo zawo na kaye zawo. <verse eid="NUM 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 1:46" />Walume wose wapetigwe wakala 603,550.<verse eid="NUM 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 1:47" />Mbali Walawi hawapetigwe hamwe na yaja yamakabila yamwenga, <verse eid="NUM 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 1:48" />kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 1:49" />“Leka kabila da Lawi, sekeuwapete hamwe na Waisilaili. <verse eid="NUM 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 1:50" />Mbali uwasagule Walawi wawe ndolezi wa hema da Mulungu da ukalangama na via vake vose na chila chinhu chili umo, wezadipapa hamwe na via vake vose. Wezasang'hana umo na kwika malago yawo kwa kudizunguluka hema ijo. <verse eid="NUM 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 1:51" />Hema vondadisegezigwe, Walawi wezadisegeza, vondadisimikigwe, Walawi wezadisimika. Munhu yoyose yeli siyo Mulawi yahadikwenhukila kezakomigwa. <verse eid="NUM 1:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 1:52" />Waisilaili wamwenga wose wezakwika malago yawo kwa mabumbila mabumbila, chila munhu muna dibumbila jake na hasi ya bendela yake. <verse eid="NUM 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 1:53" />Mbali Walawi wezakwika malago yawo kudizunguluka hema da Mulungu da ukalangama banzi zose, muladi sekekuwe na ludoko kwa Waisilaili, maabaho Walawi wasang'hanile muna dihema da Mulungu da ukalangama.”<verse eid="NUM 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 1:54" />Vino niivo viwatendile Waisilaili. Watenda chila chinhu fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 1:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NUM 2" />
  <para style="s">Malago ya makabila yopangigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 2:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kawalongela Musa na Haluni, <verse eid="NUM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 2:2" />“Waisilaili wezakwika malago yawo, chila munhu hana ibendela yake, hana ichilaguso cha kaye ya tati yake. Wezakwika malago yawo kudizunguluka dihema da Mulungu.<verse eid="NUM 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 2:3" />“Wanhu wondaweke malago yawo ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zuwa wezakuwa hana ibendela ya Yuda. Mulangulizi wawo kakala Nashoni mwana wa Aminadabu, <verse eid="NUM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 2:4" />Peta ya bumbila jake wakala walume 74,600. <verse eid="NUM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 2:5" />Kabila da Isakali wezakwika lago habehi na kabila da Yuda, mulangulizi wawo kakala Nasanaeli mwana wa Suali. <verse eid="NUM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 2:6" />Peta ya bumbila jake wakala walume 54,400. <verse eid="NUM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 2:7" />Maabaho kabila da Zebuloni, mulangulizi wa kabila da Zabuloni kakala Eliabu mwana wa Heloni. <verse eid="NUM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 2:8" />Peta ya bumbila jake wakala walume 57,400. <verse eid="NUM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 2:9" />Wanhu wose wakalile muna dilago da kabila da Yuda kwa kusondelela mabumbila yawo wakala walume 186,400. Wawo niiwawo wondawalongole.<verse eid="NUM 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 2:10" />“Ubanzi wa kusi kwizakuwa na lago da wanhu wa kabila da Lubeni kwa kusondelela mabumbila yawo. Mulangulizi wawo kakala Elisuli mwana wa Shedueli. <verse eid="NUM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 2:11" />Peta yawo wakala walume 46,500. <verse eid="NUM 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 2:12" />Na wanhu wondaweke lago habehi nayo ni kabila da Simeoni. Mulangulizi wa kabila da Simeoni kakala Shelumieli mwana wa Sulishadai, <verse eid="NUM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 2:13" />Peta yawo wakala walume 59,300. <verse eid="NUM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 2:14" />Kabila da Gadi wezasondelela. Mulangulizi wa kabila da Gadi kakala Eliasafu mwana wa Leueli. <verse eid="NUM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 2:15" />Peta yawo wakala walume 45,650. <verse eid="NUM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 2:16" />Walume wose wapetigwe muna dilago da Lubeni wakala 151,450. Wano wawo wondawawe muna dibumbila dekaidi.<verse eid="NUM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 2:17" />“Maabaho hema da Mulungu dizasegela hamwe na lago da Walawi hagati ya malago yose, fana viwopanga malago. Wezahita ivo ivo, chila bumbila hanhu hake heli na bendela zake.<verse eid="NUM 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 2:18" />“Ubanzi wa uswelo wa zuwa kwizakuwa na bendela ya lago da wanhu wa kabila da Efulaimu. Mulangulizi wa kabila da Efulaimu kakala Elishama mwana wa Amihudi. <verse eid="NUM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 2:19" />Peta ya bumbila jake wakala walume 40,500. <verse eid="NUM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 2:20" />Kabila da Manase dizasondelela, mulangulizi wa kabila da Manase kakala Gamalieli mwana wa Pedasuli. <verse eid="NUM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 2:21" />Peta yawo wakala walume 32,200. <verse eid="NUM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 2:22" />Maabaho kabila da Benjamini dizasondelela, mulangulizi wa kabila da Benjamini kakala Abidani mwana wa Gideoni. <verse eid="NUM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 2:23" />Peta yawo wakala walume 35,400. <verse eid="NUM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 2:24" />Wanhu wose wakalile muna dilago da wanhu wa Efulaimu kwa kusondelela mabumbila yawo wakala 108,100. Bumbila dino da wanhu wa Efulaimu dizakuwa deketatu kusegela.<verse eid="NUM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 2:25" />“Ubanzi wa kasikazi kwizakuwa na bendela ya kabila da Dani, wezakwika malago yawo muna yamabumbila yawo hasi ya bendela. Mulangulizi wa kabila da Dani kakala Ahiezeli mwana wa Amishadai. <verse eid="NUM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 2:26" />Peta yawo wakala walume 62,700. <verse eid="NUM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 2:27" />Kabila da Asheli dizasondelela. Mulangulizi wa kabila da Asheli kakala Pagieli mwana wa Okilani. <verse eid="NUM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 2:28" />Peta yawo wakala walume 41,500. <verse eid="NUM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 2:29" />Maabaho dizasondelela kabila da Nafutali. Mulangulizi wa kabila da Nafutali kakala Ahila mwana wa Enani. <verse eid="NUM 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 2:30" />Peta yawo wakala walume 53,400. <verse eid="NUM 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 2:31" />Walume wose wapetigwe muna dilago da Dani wakala 157,600. Wawo wezakomeleza kusegela kwa kusondelela bendela yawo.”<verse eid="NUM 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 2:32" />Wawo niiwawo Waisilaili wapetigwe kwa kusondelela kaye za tati zawo muna yamalago kwa mabumbila yawo, wose wakala walume 603,550. <verse eid="NUM 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 2:33" />Mbali Walawi hawapetigwe mwa Waisilaili fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 2:34" />Ivo Waisilaili watenda chila chinhu fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize Musa. Niivo viwekile malago yawo kwa kusondelela bendela zawo, na niivo viwasegele chila munhu kwa kusondelela lukolo lwake, fana viili kaye ya tati yake.<verse eid="NUM 2:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NUM 3" />
  <para style="s">Wana wa Haluni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 3:1" />Wano ni welesi wa Haluni na Musa chipindi Mndewa Mulungu viyalongile na Musa kuna umulima wa Sinai. <verse eid="NUM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 3:2" />Yano ni mazina ya wana wa chilume wa Haluni. Nadabu chaudele na Abihu, na Eleazali na Isamali. <verse eid="NUM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 3:3" />Yayo ni mazina ya wana wa chilume wa Haluni, wakulu wa nhambiko wowahakigwe mavuta na wowekigwe kwa sang'hano yelile muladi wasang'hane sang'hano ya ukulu wa nhambiko. <verse eid="NUM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 3:4" />Mbali Nadabu na Abihu wadanganika haulongozi ha Mndewa Mulungu, viwamulavile Mndewa Mulungu nhambiko ya moto haulondeka kuna ichuwala cha Sinai. Wawo hawawile na wana, ivo Eleazali na Isamali wasang'hana fana wakulu wa nhambiko chipindi cha ugima wa Haluni tati yawo.<verse eid="NUM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sang'hano ya Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 3:5" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 3:6" />“Wakwenhuse habehi wanhu wa kabila da Lawi na uweke haulongozi ha mkulu wa nhambiko Haluni muladi wamsang'hanile. <verse eid="NUM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 3:7" />Wezawasang'hanila Haluni na mting'hano wose muna dihema da Mulungu kwa kusang'hana sang'hano za hanhu helile. <verse eid="NUM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 3:8" />Wezavikaliza via vose vili muna dihema da Mulungu na kuwataza Waisilaili kwa kusang'hana sang'hano ya hanhu helile. <verse eid="NUM 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 3:9" />Haluni na wanage wezakwing'higwa Walawi, wawo walavigwa mwa Waisilaili muladi wawasang'hanile. <verse eid="NUM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 3:10" />Uweke Haluni na wanage wa chilume kusang'hana fana wakulu wa nhambiko, munhu imwenga yoyose yahageza kusang'hana sang'hano ya ukulu wa nhambiko, kezakomigwa.”<verse eid="NUM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 3:11" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 3:12" />“Lola sambi niwasagula Walawi mwa Waisilaili wose, badala ya chila mwana wa udele wa chilume wa chila lukolo lwa Isilaili. Walawi ni wangu, <verse eid="NUM 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 3:13" />mana wana wa udele wose ni wangu. Viniwakomile wana wa udele kuna iisi ya Misili, nika hakwe chila mwana wa udele muna iisi ya Isilaili. Chila mwana wa udele wa munhu hebu wa mnyama, wawo wezakuwa wangu. Niye niiyo Mndewa Mulungu.”<verse eid="NUM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 3:14" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa kuna ichuwala cha Sinai, <verse eid="NUM 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 3:15" />“Wapete Walawi kwa kusondelela ng'holo zawo na kaye zawo. Wapete walume wose kwandusila wana weli na mwezi umwe na kugendelela.” <verse eid="NUM 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 3:16" />Ivo Musa kawapeta, fana viyalagilizigwe na mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="NUM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 3:17" />Yano yakala mazina ya wana wa chilume wa Lawi, Gelishoni na Kohasi na Melali. <verse eid="NUM 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 3:18" />Yano yakala mazina ya wana wa chilume wa Gelishoni kwa kusondelela ng'holo zawo, Libini na Shimei. <verse eid="NUM 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 3:19" />Wana wa chilume wa Kohasi kwa kusondelela ng'holo zawo, Amilamu na Ishali na Hebuloni na Uzieli. <verse eid="NUM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 3:20" />Na wana wa chilume wa Melali kwa kusondelela ng'holo zawo, Mali na Mushi. Wano wakala welesi wa Lawi kwa kusondelela ng'holo zawo.<verse eid="NUM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 3:21" />Ng'holo za Walibini na Washimei zilawa kwa Gelishoni. <verse eid="NUM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 3:22" />Peta ya walume wose kwandusila wana weli na mwezi umwe na kugendelela wakala 7,500. <verse eid="NUM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 3:23" />Ng'holo za Wagelishoni weka lago jawo ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zuwa wa hema da Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 3:24" />Mulangulizi wa ng'holo za Wagelishoni kakala Eliasafu mwana wa Laeli. <verse eid="NUM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 3:25" />Sang'hano ya Wagelishoni ikala kukaliza hema da Mulungu na ngubiko yake na panzia da hanhu ha kwingilila muna dihema da Mulungu, <verse eid="NUM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 3:26" />na mapanzia ya luwa luzunguluka hema da Mulungu na lupango, na panzia da hanhu ha kwingilila muna uluwa na nzabi zake. Sang'hano zawo zikala zosonhela vinhu ivo vose. <verse eid="NUM 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 3:27" />Ng'holo za Kohasi zikala Waamulami na Waishali na Wahebuloni na Wauzieli. <verse eid="NUM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 3:28" />Peta ya walume wose kwandusila wana weli na mwezi umwe na kugendelela wakala 8,600. Wano wakala wokaliza hanhu helile. <verse eid="NUM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 3:29" />Ng'holo za Kohasi walondeka kwika lago jawo ubanzi wa kusi wa hema da Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 3:30" />Mulangulizi wa ng'holo za Kohasi kakala Elisafani mwana wa Uzieli. <verse eid="NUM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 3:31" />Wakala wodilola goya sanduku da lagano na meza na chinala cha chitasa na malupango na via viwosang'hanila wakulu wa nhambiko hana ihanhu helile na panzia, na via vose va kusang'hanila. <verse eid="NUM 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 3:32" />Eleazali mwana wa Haluni yeli mkulu wa nhambiko kakala mulangulizi wa walangulizi wa Walawi, ndolezi wa wasang'hani wose wa hanhu helile.<verse eid="NUM 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 3:33" />Ng'holo mbili za Melali zikala Wamahili na Wamushi. <verse eid="NUM 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 3:34" />Peta ya walume wowandikigwe kwandusila wana weli na mwezi umwe na kugendelela wakala 6,200. <verse eid="NUM 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 3:35" />Mulangulizi wa ng'holo za Melali kakala Sulieli mwana wa Abihaili, wano walondeka kwika lago jawo ubanzi wa kasikazi wa hema da Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 3:36" />Wamelali wasaguligwa kulola goya mibiki ya hema na mhanda zake na vikalilo vake na via vake vose na sang'hano yoyose kusonhela vinhu ivo, <verse eid="NUM 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 3:37" />na mhanda zizunguluke uluwa na vikalilo vake na vigingi vake na nzabi zake. <verse eid="NUM 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 3:38" />Musa na Haluni na wana wawo wa chilume walondeka kwika lago jawo kuulongozi wa hema da Mulungu ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zuwa. Sang'hano yawo ikala kusang'hana sang'hano ya ukulu wa nhambiko muna dihema da Mulungu kwa ichimu cha Waisilaili. Munhu imwenga yoyose yahadikwenhukila dihema da Mulungu kolondeka yakomigwe. <verse eid="NUM 3:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 3:39" />Walawi wose wapetigwe, walume wose kwandusila wana weli na mwezi umwe na kugendelela, waja Musa na Haluni wawapeta fana viyalagilize Mndewa Mulungu, wakala 22,000.<verse eid="NUM 3:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walawi wosola hanhu ha wana wa udele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 3:40" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Wapete wana wa udele wa chilume wose wa Waisilaili, kwandusila wana weli na mwezi umwe na kugendelela, wapete kwa mazina yawo. <verse eid="NUM 3:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 3:41" />Kwizaweka hakwe Walawi kwa ichimu changu niye Mndewa Mulungu badala ya wana wa udele wa Waisilaili, iviya kwizaweka hakwe wanyama wose wa Walawi kwa ichimu changu badala ya wanyama wa udele wose wa Waisilaili.” <verse eid="NUM 3:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 3:42" />Ivo Musa kawapeta wana wa udele wose wa Waisilaili, fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize. <verse eid="NUM 3:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 3:43" />Wana wa udele wose wa chilume fana viili peta ya mazina yawo, kwandusila wana weli na mwezi umwe na kugendelela wakala 22,273.<verse eid="NUM 3:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 3:44" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 3:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 3:45" />“Wabagule Walawi wose kuwa wangu badala ya wana wa udele wa Waisilaili. Iviya wabagule ng'ombe wa Walawi wose badala ya wana wa udele wa ng'ombe wa Waisilaili. Walawi ni wangu. Niye niiyo Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 3:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 3:46" />Kwa ichimu cha kuwakombola wana wa udele wa chilume wa Waisilaili 273, wongezeke muna ipeta ya walume wa Walawi. <verse eid="NUM 3:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 3:47" />Hokela shekeli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Shekeli imwe sawa na gilamu longo na imwe na nusu.</char></note> tano ya hela kulawa kwa waudele wa Waisilaili wowongezeke kulawa kwa peta ya walume wa Walawi, fana viili ningo ya hanhu helile, <verse eid="NUM 3:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 3:48" />mwing'he Haluni na wanage hela ya ukombola kwa ichimu cha Waisilaili wongezeke muna ipeta.” <verse eid="NUM 3:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 3:49" />Musa kasola hela izo za ukombola wawo wongezeke wakomboligwe na Walawi. <verse eid="NUM 3:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 3:50" />Kulawa kwa wana wa udele wa Waisilaili kapata shekeli 1,365 ya hela, fana viili ningo ya hanhu helile. <verse eid="NUM 3:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 3:51" />Musa kaweng'ha Haluni na wanage hela izo za ukombola, fana mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu voimulagilize.<verse eid="NUM 3:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NUM 4" />
  <para style="s">Sang'hano ya Wakohasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 4:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kawalongela Musa na Haluni, <verse eid="NUM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 4:2" />“Wapete welesi wa Kohasi, kulawa kabila da Walawi, kwa kusondelela ng'holo zawo na kaye za tati zawo. <verse eid="NUM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 4:3" />Kwandusila walume weli na miyaka malongo matatu mbaka malongo matano, wowodaha kwingila muna isang'hano muladi wasang'hane hana dihema da Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 4:4" />Sang'hano ya Wakohasi ikala kupapa via velile va hema da Mulungu.”<verse eid="NUM 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 4:5" />“Lusita lwa kusegeza dilago, Haluni na wanage wa chilume wezakwingila mgati na kudihulumusa dipanzia dili haulongozi wa sanduku da lagano na kudigubika sanduku da lagano kwa panzia ijo. <verse eid="NUM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 4:6" />Uchanyha yake wezakwika mbende ya mnyama wa mwiibahali, wezakwika chitambala cha langi ya buluu. Maabaho wezakwingiza mibiki ya kupapila sanduku da lagano.<verse eid="NUM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 4:7" />“Uchanyha ya meza ya kulavila magate yelile yoyokwikigwa haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu, wezakwanzanza chitambala cha langi ya buluu chiya uchanyha yake wezakwika vyano na vitanda va ubani na nhungo, kwa ichimu cha kulavila nhambiko za ving'waji. Uchanyha ya meza kwizakuwa na magate siku zose. <verse eid="NUM 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 4:8" />Wezagubika vinhu ivo vose kwa chitambala chidung'hu, na uchanyha yake wezagubika kwa mbende ya mnyama wa mwiibahali na kuiguma ija imibiki yake.<verse eid="NUM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 4:9" />“Wezasola chitambala cha langi ya buluu na kugubika chinala cha vitasa na vitasa vake na mibato yake na vyano vake na via vake vovisang'haniligwa kwikila mavuta. <verse eid="NUM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 4:10" />Wezachiguma na via vake vose mgati ya mbende ya mnyama wa mwiibahali na kuchika uchanyha ya mibiki ya kupapila.<verse eid="NUM 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 4:11" />“Uchanyha ya lupango lwa zahabu wezagubika chitambala cha langi ya buluu na kugubika kwa mbende ya mnyama wa mwiibahali. Wezaguma mibiki yake ya kupapila. <verse eid="NUM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 4:12" />Maabaho wezavisola via vose vovisang'haniligwa muna ikaye yelile, na kuviguma muna ichitambala cha langi ya buluu na kugubika kwa mbende ya mnyama wa mwiibahali na kuvika mchanyha ya mibiki ya kupapila. <verse eid="NUM 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 4:13" />Wezasegeza maivu hana ulupango lwa kutimbulila nhambiko na kulugubika kwa chitambala cha langi ya zambalau. <verse eid="NUM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 4:14" />Wezavika mchanyha yake via vose vovisang'haniligwa hana ulupango, hamwe na vyano va kuhalila moto na mibatilo na magembe na vizae. Maabaho uchanyha yake wezakwika ngubiko ya mbende ya mnyama wa mwiibahali na kuiguma mibiki yake ya kupapila. <verse eid="NUM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 4:15" />Haluni na wanage wahakomeleza kuhagubika hanhu helile hamwe na via vake vose, wahawa waisasala kwandusa mwanza, wanhu wa lukolo lwa Kohasi wezakwiza na kuvipapa. Wawo hawalondeka kwamha via ivo velile, buleivo wezadanganika. Iyo niiyo sang'hano ya wanhu wa lukolo lwa Kohasi chila lusita hema da Mulungu vidihamizigwa.<verse eid="NUM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 4:16" />“Eleazali mwana wa mkulu wa nhambiko Haluni kezayeka goya mavuta ya vitasa na ubani unogile na nhosa za usage za chila siku na mavuta ya kuboboda. Iviya kezakaliza hema da Mulungu na vinhu vose vili mgati yake na hanhu helile na via vake.”<verse eid="NUM 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 4:17" />Mndewa Mulungu kawalongela Musa na Haluni, <verse eid="NUM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 4:18" />“Sekemuwaleke wanhu wa lukolo lwa Kohasi mwa Walawi wadanganizigwe, <verse eid="NUM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 4:19" />mbali watendeleni vino muladi vondawavikwenhukile vinhu velile ng'hani wawe wagima na sekewadanganike. Haluni na wanage wezakwingila mgati na kumsagula chila munhu na sang'hano yake na mbahasha yake. <verse eid="NUM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 4:20" />Mbali sekewengile hanhu haja kulola vinhu velile lusita wakulu wa nhambiko wovisasala, buleivo wezadanganika.”<verse eid="NUM 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sang'hano ya Wagelishoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 4:21" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 4:22" />“Wapete welesi wa Gelishoni kwa kusondelela ng'holo zawo na kaye za tati zawo. <verse eid="NUM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 4:23" />Wapete walume kwandusila weli na miyaka malongo matatu mbaka weli na miyaka malongo matano wowodaha kusang'hana sang'hano muna dihema da Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 4:24" />Sang'hano ya Wagelishoni ni kupapa mbahasha. <verse eid="NUM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 4:25" />Wezasola mapanzia na hema da Mulungu hamwe na ngubiko yake na ngubiko ya mbende ya mnyama wa mwiibahali uchanyha yake na mapanzia ya hanhu ha kwingilila muna dihema da Mulungu, <verse eid="NUM 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 4:26" />na mapanzia ya luwa luzunguluke hanhu helile na lupango, na panzia da hanhu ha kwingilila muna dihema da Mulungu na nzabi zake na vinhu vose va usang'hano wawo. Wawo wezasang'hanila mbuli zose zozisonhela vinhu vino. <verse eid="NUM 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 4:27" />Sang'hano yose ya wana wa chilume wa Wagelishoni kwa kupapa mbahasha na sang'hano yawo yose izakuwa kwa kulangulizigwa na Haluni na wanage. Wezawapangila vinhu vose vowolongeligwa kuvipapa. <verse eid="NUM 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 4:28" />Ino iyo sang'hano ya Wagelishoni hana dihema da Mulungu. Wezasang'hana kwa kulangulizigwa na Isamali mwana wa mkulu wa nhambiko Haluni.<verse eid="NUM 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sang'hano ya Wamelali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 4:29" />“Wapete welesi wa Melali kwa kusondelela ng'holo zawo na kaye za tati zawo. <verse eid="NUM 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 4:30" />Wapete walume wose kwandusila weli na miyaka malongo matatu mbaka weli na miyaka malongo matano, wowodaha kusang'hana usang'hano hana dihema da Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 4:31" />Wezalondeka kupapa mibiki, mhanda na vikalilo va hema da Mulungu.<verse eid="NUM 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 4:32" />“Iviya na mhanda za luwa kuzunguluka banzi zose za hanhu helile na vikalilo na vigingi na nzabi zake hamwe na vinhu vake vose na via vake vimwenga vose. Kwizawapangila kwa kusondelela mazina yawo vinhu vowolondeka kupapa. <verse eid="NUM 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 4:33" />Ino iyo yondaiwe sang'hano ya Wamelali hana dihema da Mulungu, wezalangulizigwa na Isamali mwana wa mkulu wa nhambiko Haluni.”<verse eid="NUM 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walawi wopetigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 4:34" />Musa na Haluni na walangulizi wa mting'hano wose wawapeta welesi wa Kohasi, kwa kusondelela ng'holo zawo na kaye za tati zawo. <verse eid="NUM 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 4:35" />Walume wose kwandusila weli na miyaka malongo matatu mbaka weli na miyaka malongo matano, wowodaha kusang'hana muna dihema da Mulungu, <verse eid="NUM 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 4:36" />wowapetigwe kwa kusondelela ng'holo zawo wakala 2,750. <verse eid="NUM 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 4:37" />Ino ikala peta ya welesi wa Wakohasi wowasang'hane usang'hano muna dihema da Mulungu. Musa na Haluni wawapeta fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 4:38" />Wagelishoni wapetigwa kwa kusondelela ng'holo zawo na kaye za tati zawo. <verse eid="NUM 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 4:39" />Walume wose kwandusila weli na miyaka malongo matatu mbaka weli na miyaka malongo matano, wowodaha kusang'hana usang'hano muna dihema da Mulungu, <verse eid="NUM 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 4:40" />wowapetigwe kwa kusondelela ng'holo zawo na kaye za tati zawo wakala 2,630.<verse eid="NUM 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 4:41" />Ino ikala peta ya welesi wa Wagelishoni wowasang'hane usang'hano muna dihema da Mulungu, waja Musa na Haluni wawapeta fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 4:42" />Wamelali wapetigwa kwa kusondelela ng'holo zawo na kaye za tati zawo. <verse eid="NUM 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 4:43" />Walume wose kwandusila weli na miyaka malongo matatu mbaka weli na miyaka malongo matano, wowodaha kusang'hana usang'hano muna dihema da Mulungu, <verse eid="NUM 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 4:44" />wapetigwa kwa kusondelela ng'holo zawo na kaye za tati zawo, wakala 3,200. <verse eid="NUM 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 4:45" />Ino ikala peta ya welesi wa Wamelali, waja Musa na Haluni wawapeta fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 4:46" />Ivo Musa na Haluni na walangulizi wa Isilaili wawapeta Walawi wose kwa kusondelela ng'holo zawo na kaye za tati zawo. <verse eid="NUM 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 4:47" />Walume wose kwandusila weli na miyaka malongo matatu mbaka weli na miyaka malongo matano, wowodaha kusang'hana usang'hano muna dihema da Mulungu, <verse eid="NUM 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 4:48" />wapetigwe wakala 8,580. <verse eid="NUM 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 4:49" />Kwa lagilizo da Mndewa Mulungu kufosela Musa, wapetigwa, chila munhu kwa sang'hano yake na fana voili mbahasha yake, niivo viwapetigwe fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 4:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NUM 5" />
  <para style="s">Wanhu wambule mwiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 5:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 5:2" />“Walagilize Waisilaili wamulave kunze ya lago chila munhu yeli na utamu wa mbende, chila munhu yolawigwa na ufila na chila munhu yambule mwiko kwa kudalisa mtufi. <verse eid="NUM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 5:3" />Walaveni kunze ya lago wanhu wawo wose, wawe walume hebu wanaake, muladi sekewaditende lago jangu donikala hagati yawo jambule mwiko.”<verse eid="NUM 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 5:4" />Waisilaili watenda ivo, wawalava kunze ya lago. Watenda fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maliho ya kutenda uhasanyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 5:5" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 5:6" />“Walongele Waisilaili, ‘One munhu yoyose, mulume hebu muke yahamuhasanya miyage kwa vovose na ivo kuleka kuwa mwaminika kwa Mndewa Mulungu, munhu iyo kabananga, <verse eid="NUM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 5:7" />baho kolondeka yalonge kwa mulomo uhasanyi wake uyatendile. Kolondeka yalihe kwa ubananzi wake kwa kongeza hanhu ha tano na kumwing'ha ija yamuhasanye. <verse eid="NUM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 5:8" />Mbali one munhu yahasanyigwe kadanganika na kabule ndugu wa habehi yoyodaha kuhokela chinhu icho, basi maliho kwa ubananzi yezalavigwa kwa Mndewa Mulungu kwa ichimu cha wakulu wa nhambiko. Maliho yayo yezalavigwa hamwe na bebelu da ng'hondolo da kuilumba dondadisang'haniligwe kutendeligwa kuilumba kwa ichimu cha uhasanyi wake. <verse eid="NUM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 5:9" />Chila nhosa ya vinhu velile va Waisilaili vowomulavila mkulu wa nhambiko, vizakuwa va mkulu wa nhambiko iyo, <verse eid="NUM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 5:10" />na chila chinhu chelile cha kugaligwa kwa mkulu wa nhambiko, chizakuwa chake.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhaguso za wanaake hawaminika kwa walume zawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 5:11" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 5:12" />“Walongele Waisilaili, ‘One muke wa munhu yoyose yahaga na kuleka kwaminika kwa mulumake, <verse eid="NUM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 5:13" />kwa kugona na mulume imwenga bila mulumake kuvimanya, kambula mwiko hata one habule munhu yawonile chiyatendile kwaviya hagwiligwe ugoni. <verse eid="NUM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 5:14" />Mulumake yahengiligwa na migongo na kumuwonela migongo muke wake yambule mwiko, hebu one yahamuwonela migongo muke wake hata one muke iyo hambule mwiko, <verse eid="NUM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 5:15" />baho mulume kezamgala muke wake kwa mkulu wa nhambiko, na kulava nhosa yoilondeka, chilo imwe ya usage wa shayili, mbali bila kuguma mavuta na ubani, kwaviya ni nhosa ya usage ya migongo, nhosa yoilavigwa kwa kulagusa ubananzi.<verse eid="NUM 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 5:16" />“ ‘Mkulu wa nhambiko kezamgala imwanamke habehi na kumwimiza haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 5:17" />Mkulu wa nhambiko kezasola mazi yelile muna ichia cha ulongo, maabaho kezasola timbwisi dili hasi ya hema da Mulungu na kudiguma muna yamazi yayo. <verse eid="NUM 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 5:18" />Maabaho mkulu wa nhambiko kezamwika mwanamke iyo haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu na kumgubula nyele zake na kumwing'ha nhosa iyo yoilavigwa kwa kulagusa ubananzi ili nhosa ya usage ya migongo. Mkulu wa nhambiko mwenyewo kezakwamhilila chia chiya chili na mazi yeli usungu yoyogala duwilo. <verse eid="NUM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 5:19" />Maabaho mkulu wa nhambiko kezamulahiza mwanamke iyo na kumulongela “One hugonile na mulume imwenga na kuitenda wambule mwiko kuno kuna mulumako, hwizapatigwa na duwilo dodigaligwa na mazi yano yeli usungu. <verse eid="NUM 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 5:20" />Mbali fana kwaga kugona na mulume imwenga na kwambula mwiko kwa kugona na mulume imwenga yeli siyo mulumako, <verse eid="NUM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 5:21" />Mndewa Mulungu yakutende uwe duwilo chilaho kwa wanhu wako, sekeulele na munda wako umeme. <verse eid="NUM 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 5:22" />Mazi yano yoyogala uduwilo yengile mmunda wako na kukutenda sekeulele na munda wako umeme.” Mwanamke iyo kezakwidikila, “Ivo.”<verse eid="NUM 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 5:23" />“ ‘Maabaho mkulu wa nhambiko kezakwandika maduwilo yano muna ichibende na kuyasunha muna yamazi yeli usungu, <verse eid="NUM 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 5:24" />nayo kezamng'wiza mwanamke iyo mazi yayo yeli usungu yoyogala duwilo, nayo yezakwingila mgati yake na kumgalila mawine makulu ng'hani. <verse eid="NUM 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 5:25" />Maabaho mkulu wa nhambiko kezasola nhosa ija ya usage ya migongo muna yamakono ya mwanamke ija na kwinula uchanyha kwa kumulavila Mndewa Mulungu, na kuigala hana ulupango. <verse eid="NUM 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 5:26" />Maabaho kezasola ganza dimwe da nhosa ya mhule kwa lukumbuso lwa kuitimbula hana ulupango. Kezamng'wiza mwanamke mazi yayo. <verse eid="NUM 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 5:27" />Yahakomeleza kung'wa mazi, one yahambula mwiko na kuleka kwaminika kwa mulumake, mazi yayo yoyogala duwilo yezamgalila mawine makulu ng'hani, munda wawe wizamema na hezalela. Mwanamke iyo kezakuwa duwilo mwa wanhu wake. <verse eid="NUM 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 5:28" />Mbali one hambule mwiko kwa kugonile na mulume imwenga na kela, basi kailegeha na kezadaha kupata wana.<verse eid="NUM 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 5:29" />“ ‘Ino iyo ndagilizi kusonhela migongo ihawa mwanamke, ingawa kolangulizigwa na mulumake, kezakwaga na kuitenda yambule mwiko, <verse eid="NUM 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 5:30" />hebu mulume yahengiligwa na migongo na kumuwonela migongo muke wake, kezamwika muke iyo haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu, na mkulu wa nhambiko kezatenda fana viili ndagilizi iyo. <verse eid="NUM 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 5:31" />Mulumake kezakuwa kabule ubananzi wowose, mbali mwanamke kezatagusigwa kwa ubananzi wake.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NUM 6" />
  <para style="s">Malagilizo kusonhela Mnazili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 6:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 6:2" />“Walongele Waisilaili, ‘One mulume hebu muke kokwika chilaho malumu, chilaho cha kuwa Mnazili<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Munhu yoyose yoika hakwe kwa ichimu cha Mndewa Mulungu, kwa chiebulaniya kotangigwa Mnazili.</char></note> na kuika hakwe kwa ichimu cha Mndewa Mulungu, <verse eid="NUM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 6:3" />kolondeka sekeyang'we divai hebu upele, sekeyang'we ching'waji chochose chitendigwe kwa zabibu, sekeyang'we mazi ya zabibu hebu sekeyaje zabibu zivile hebu zinyalile. <verse eid="NUM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 6:4" />Siku zose za kuika hakwe kwake kolondeka sekeyaje chinhu chochose chitendigwe kwa mzabibu, mbeyu hebu makang'ha yake.<verse eid="NUM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 6:5" />“ ‘Siku zose za chilaho chino cha kuika hakwe, sekeyawegule nyele zake mbaka siku zake za kuika hakwe kwa ichimu cha Mndewa Mulungu vondazifike, kezakuwa kela na kezazileka nyele zake zikule. <verse eid="NUM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 6:6" />Siku zose zoyoika hakwe kwa ichimu cha Mndewa Mulungu, munhu iyo sekeyakwenhukile mtufi. <verse eid="NUM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 6:7" />Hata one uhawa mtufi wa tati yake hebu mami yake hebu lumbu hebu mwali wake, muladi sekeyambule mwiko kwaviya kaika hakwe kwa ichimu cha Mulungu kwa chilaho. <verse eid="NUM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 6:8" />Siku zose za kuika hakwe kwake kezakuwa kela kwa Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="NUM 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 6:9" />“ ‘One munhu yoyose yahadanganika bila kuugula habehi yake, ija kezakwambula mwiko, maabaho siku yesaba vondayasafyigwe kezawegula ditwi jake. <verse eid="NUM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 6:10" />Siku yenane kezamgalila mkulu wa nhambiko huwa waidi hebu makinda ya nziwa maidi haulongozi wa hanhu ha kwingilila muna dihema da Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 6:11" />Mkulu wa nhambiko kezalava imwe kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya uhasanyi na imwenga kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya kutimbula muladi kumtendela kuilumba kwaviya katenda uhasanyi kwa mtufi. Siku iyo kezaditenda ditwi jake jele. <verse eid="NUM 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 6:12" />Kezaika hakwe kaidi kwa ichimu cha Mndewa Mulungu. Siku za mwanduso hazizapetigwa kwaviya kambula mwiko muna zisiku zake za kuika hakwe. Kezalava mwanang'hondolo mulume wa mwaka umwe kuwa nhambiko ya ubananzi.<verse eid="NUM 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 6:13" />“ ‘Dino ni lagilizo kwa Mnazili. Vondazikomelezeke siku za kuika hakwe kwake, kezagaligwa hanhu ha kwingilila muna dihema da Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 6:14" />Kezalava nhambiko yake kwa Mndewa Mulungu, mwanang'hondolo mulume wa mwaka umwe yelibule chilema kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya kutimbula, zike da mwanang'hondolo dilibule chilema kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya uhasanyi, bebelu da ng'hondolo dilibule chilema kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya kugala tindiwalo, <verse eid="NUM 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 6:15" />na chisege cha magate hayagumigwe lusu na maandazi ya usage unogile uhanganyigwe na mavuta, na magate masisili hayagumigwe lusu yabobodigwe mavuta hamwe na nhosa za usage na ching'waji.<verse eid="NUM 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 6:16" />“ ‘Mkulu wa nhambiko kezavigala vinhu ivo haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu na kulava nhambiko ya uhasanyi na nhambiko ya kutimbula. <verse eid="NUM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 6:17" />Kezamgalila Mndewa Mulungu chisege cha magate hayagumigwe lusu, hamwe na mwanang'hondolo wa nhambiko ya kugala tindiwalo na nhosa za usage na nhosa za ching'waji. <verse eid="NUM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 6:18" />Hana ihanhu ha kwingilila muna dihema da Mulungu, Mnazili iyo kezawegula nyele zake na kuziguma muna umoto uli hasi ya nhambiko ya kugala tindiwalo.<verse eid="NUM 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 6:19" />“ ‘Maabaho mkulu wa nhambiko kezasola yega da bebelu da ng'hondolo ijo dikimusigwe. Kezasola gate dilibule lusu muna ichisege na andazi, kezamwing'ha Mnazili ija, yahakomeleza kuwegula nyele ziyakalile nazo lusita lwa kuika hakwe kwake. <verse eid="NUM 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 6:20" />Maabaho mkulu wa nhambiko kezavinula uchanyha vinhu ivo fana nhambiko ya kwinuligwa uchanyha haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu. Vinhu vino vose vela kwa mkulu wa nhambiko, hamwe na chidali chochinuligwe uchanyha na chima chochilavigwe nhambiko. Yahakomelezeka yayo yose, Mnazili kodaha kung'wa divai.<verse eid="NUM 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 6:21" />“ ‘Ino ni ndagilizi kwa Mnazili, fana vichili chilaho chake. Mbali yahadaha kulava vinhu vimwenga, kolondeka kuzindilila ndagilizi ya Mnazili.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wakulu wa nhambiko wowatemela mate wanhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 6:22" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 6:23" />“Mulongele Haluni na wanage wa chilume wawatemele mate Waisilaili kwa mbuli zino,<verse eid="NUM 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 6:24" />‘Mndewa Mulungu yamtemeleni mate na kumkalizani,<verse eid="NUM 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 6:25" />Mndewa Mulungu yamuloleni kwa unovu na kumtendelani yanogile,<verse eid="NUM 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 6:26" />Mndewa Mulungu yamuwoneleni ubazi na kumwing'hani tindiwalo.’<verse eid="NUM 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 6:27" />“Ivo wezaditambula zina jangu kwa Waisilaili, na nizawatemela mate.”<verse eid="NUM 6:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NUM 7" />
  <para style="s">Nhambiko ya walangulizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 7:1" />Musa viyakomeleze kusimika dihema da Mulungu, kadiboboda mavuta na kudika kwa sang'hano yelile hamwe na via vake vose. Iviya ulupango kaluboboda mavuta na kulwika kwa sang'hano yelile hamwe na via vake vose. <verse eid="NUM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 7:2" />Maabaho walangulizi wa Isilaili na wakulu wa kaye za tati zawo na walangulizi wa makabila, wowawemilize wanhu wapetigwe, <verse eid="NUM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 7:3" />wamgalila Mndewa Mulungu nhosa zawo, mituka sita na ng'ombe walume longo na waidi, tololi dimwe kwa chila walangulizi waidi na ng'ombe lume dimwe kwa chila mulangulizi. Wavigala vinhu ivo haulongozi wa hema da Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 7:4" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 7:5" />“Hokela nhambiko izo muladi zisang'haniligwe muna isang'hano yondaisang'hanigwe kwa ichimu cha hema da Mulungu. Uweng'he Walawi chila imwe fana viili sang'hano yake.”<verse eid="NUM 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 7:6" />Ivo Musa kasola mituka na ng'ombe walume kaweng'ha Walawi. <verse eid="NUM 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 7:7" />Wagelishoni kaweng'ha mituka midi na ng'ombe walume wane, kwa viili sang'hano yawo ya kupapa via va hema da Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 7:8" />Na kaweng'ha Wamelali mituka mine na ng'ombe walume wanane, kwa viili sang'hano yawo ya kupapa via va hema da Mulungu kwa kulangulizigwa na Isamali mwana wa mkulu wa nhambiko Haluni. <verse eid="NUM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 7:9" />Mbali Wakohasi haweng'hile chochose, kwaviya sang'hano yawo ikala kupapa vinhu va hema da Mulungu muna yamayega yawo.<verse eid="NUM 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 7:10" />Walangulizi walava nhambiko kwa ichimu cha kulwika ulupango kwa sang'hano yelile na siku iyo vilubobodigwe mavuta, na walangulizi walava nhambiko zawo haulongozi wa ulupango. <verse eid="NUM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 7:11" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Chila siku mulangulizi imwe kezalava nhambiko yake kwa ichimu cha kulwika ulupango kwa sang'hano yelile.”<verse eid="NUM 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 7:12" />Munhu yalavile nhambiko yake siku ya mwanduso kakala Nashoni mwana wa Aminadabu wa kabila da Yuda.<verse eid="NUM 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 7:13" />Nhambiko yake ikala vino, chano ya hela ili na nzamo ya chilo imwe na nusu na buyu da hela dili na nzamo ya gilamu magana manane kuilinga na ningo za hema da Mulungu. Ivo vose vimemezigwa usage unogile uhanganyigwe na mavuta kwa ichimu cha nhosa ya usage. <verse eid="NUM 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 7:14" />Iviya kagala ziga da zahabu dili na nzamo ya gilamu gana na longo, dimemile ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 7:15" />na dang'ang'a lume na bebelu da ng'hondolo na mwanang'hondolo mulume wa mwaka umwe, kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya kutimbula, <verse eid="NUM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 7:16" />na bebelu da luti kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya uhasanyi, <verse eid="NUM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 7:17" />na ng'ombe walume waidi na mabebelu ya ng'hondolo matano na mabebelu ya luti matano na wanang'hondolo walume watano wa mwaka umwe kwa ichimu cha nhambiko za kugala tindiwalo. Iyo ikala nhambiko ya Nashoni mwana wa Aminadabu.<verse eid="NUM 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 7:18" />Siku yekaidi Nasanaeli mwana wa Suali, mulangulizi wa kabila da Isakali kalava nhambiko. <verse eid="NUM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 7:19" />Nhambiko yake ikala vino, chano ya hela ili na nzamo ya chilo imwe na nusu na buyu da hela dili na nzamo ya gilamu magana manane kuilinga na ningo za hema da Mulungu. Ivo vose vimemezigwa usage unogile uhanganyigwe na mavuta kwa ichimu cha nhosa ya usage. <verse eid="NUM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 7:20" />Iviya kagala ziga da zahabu dili na nzamo ya gilamu gana na longo, dimemile ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 7:21" />na dang'ang'a lume na bebelu da ng'hondolo na mwanang'hondolo mulume wa mwaka umwe, kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya kutimbula, <verse eid="NUM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 7:22" />na bebelu da luti kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya uhasanyi, <verse eid="NUM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 7:23" />na ng'ombe walume waidi na mabebelu ya ng'hondolo matano na mabebelu ya luti matano na wanang'hondolo walume watano wa mwaka umwe kwa ichimu cha nhambiko za kugala tindiwalo. Iyo ikala nhambiko ya Nasanaeli mwana wa Suali.<verse eid="NUM 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 7:24" />Siku yetatu Eliabu mwana wa Heloni, mulangulizi wa kabila da Zabuloni kalava nhambiko. <verse eid="NUM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 7:25" />Nhambiko yake ikala vino, chano ya hela ili na nzamo ya chilo imwe na nusu na buyu da hela dili na nzamo ya gilamu magana manane kuilinga na ningo za hema da Mulungu. Ivo vose vimemezigwa usage unogile uhanganyigwe na mavuta kwa ichimu cha nhosa ya usage. <verse eid="NUM 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 7:26" />Iviya kagala ziga da zahabu dili na nzamo ya gilamu gana na longo, dimemile ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 7:27" />na dang'ang'a lume na bebelu da ng'hondolo na mwanang'hondolo mulume wa mwaka umwe, kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya kutimbula, <verse eid="NUM 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 7:28" />na bebelu da luti kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya uhasanyi, <verse eid="NUM 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 7:29" />na ng'ombe walume waidi na mabebelu ya ng'hondolo matano na mabebelu ya luti matano na wanang'hondolo walume watano wa mwaka umwe kwa ichimu cha nhambiko za kugala tindiwalo. Iyo ikala nhambiko ya Eliabu mwana wa Heloni.<verse eid="NUM 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 7:30" />Siku yekane Elisuli mwana wa Shedueli, mulangulizi wa kabila da Lubeni kalava nhambiko. <verse eid="NUM 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 7:31" />Nhambiko yake ikala vino, chano ya hela ili na nzamo ya chilo imwe na nusu na buyu da hela dili na nzamo ya gilamu magana manane kuilinga na ningo za hema da Mulungu. Ivo vose vimemezigwa usage unogile uhanganyigwe na mavuta kwa ichimu cha nhosa ya usage. <verse eid="NUM 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 7:32" />Iviya kagala ziga da zahabu dili na nzamo ya gilamu gana na longo, dimemile ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 7:33" />na dang'ang'a lume na bebelu da ng'hondolo na mwanang'hondolo mulume wa mwaka umwe, kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya kutimbula, <verse eid="NUM 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 7:34" />na bebelu da luti kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya uhasanyi, <verse eid="NUM 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 7:35" />na ng'ombe walume waidi na mabebelu ya ng'hondolo matano na mabebelu ya luti matano na wanang'hondolo walume watano wa mwaka umwe kwa ichimu cha nhambiko za kugala tindiwalo. Iyo ikala nhambiko ya Elisuli mwana wa Shedueli.<verse eid="NUM 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 7:36" />Siku yetano Shelumieli mwana wa Sulishadai, mulangulizi wa kabila da Simeoni kalava nhambiko yake. <verse eid="NUM 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 7:37" />Nhambiko yake ikala vino, chano ya hela ili na nzamo ya chilo imwe na nusu na buyu da hela dili na nzamo ya gilamu magana manane kuilinga na ningo za hema da Mulungu. Ivo vose vimemezigwa usage unogile uhanganyigwe na mavuta kwa ichimu cha nhosa ya usage. <verse eid="NUM 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 7:38" />Iviya kagala ziga da zahabu dili na nzamo ya gilamu gana na longo, dimemile ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 7:39" />na dang'ang'a lume na bebelu da ng'hondolo na mwanang'hondolo mulume wa mwaka umwe, kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya kutimbula, <verse eid="NUM 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 7:40" />na bebelu da luti kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya uhasanyi, <verse eid="NUM 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 7:41" />na ng'ombe walume waidi na mabebelu ya ng'hondolo matano na mabebelu ya luti matano na wanang'hondolo walume watano wa mwaka umwe kwa ichimu cha nhambiko za kugala tindiwalo. Iyo ikala nhambiko ya Shelumieli mwana wa Sulishadai.<verse eid="NUM 7:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 7:42" />Siku yesita Eliasafu mwana wa Deueli, mulangulizi wa kabila da Gadi kalava nhambiko yake. <verse eid="NUM 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 7:43" />Nhambiko yake ikala vino, chano ya hela ili na nzamo ya chilo imwe na nusu na buyu da hela dili na nzamo ya gilamu magana manane kuilinga na ningo za hema da Mulungu. Ivo vose vimemezigwa usage unogile uhanganyigwe na mavuta kwa ichimu cha nhosa ya usage. <verse eid="NUM 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 7:44" />Iviya kagala ziga da zahabu dili na nzamo ya gilamu gana na longo, dimemile ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 7:45" />na dang'ang'a lume na bebelu da ng'hondolo na mwanang'hondolo mulume wa mwaka umwe, kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya kutimbula, <verse eid="NUM 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 7:46" />na bebelu da luti kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya uhasanyi, <verse eid="NUM 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 7:47" />na ng'ombe walume waidi na mabebelu ya ng'hondolo matano na mabebelu ya luti matano na wanang'hondolo walume watano wa mwaka umwe kwa ichimu cha nhambiko za kugala tindiwalo. Iyo ikala nhambiko ya Eliasafu mwana wa Deueli.<verse eid="NUM 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 7:48" />Siku yesaba Elishama mwana wa Amihudi, mulangulizi wa kabila da Efulaimu kalava nhambiko yake. <verse eid="NUM 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 7:49" />Nhambiko yake ikala vino, chano ya hela ili na nzamo ya chilo imwe na nusu na buyu da hela dili na nzamo ya gilamu magana manane kuilinga na ningo za hema da Mulungu. Ivo vose vimemezigwa usage unogile uhanganyigwe na mavuta kwa ichimu cha nhosa ya usage. <verse eid="NUM 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 7:50" />Iviya kagala ziga da zahabu dili na nzamo ya gilamu gana na longo, dimemile ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 7:51" />na dang'ang'a lume na bebelu da ng'hondolo na mwanang'hondolo mulume wa mwaka umwe, kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya kutimbula, <verse eid="NUM 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 7:52" />na bebelu da luti kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya uhasanyi, <verse eid="NUM 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 7:53" />na ng'ombe walume waidi na mabebelu ya ng'hondolo matano na mabebelu ya luti matano na wanang'hondolo walume watano wa mwaka umwe kwa ichimu cha nhambiko za kugala tindiwalo. Iyo ikala nhambiko ya Elishama mwana wa Amihudi.<verse eid="NUM 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 7:54" />Siku yenane Gamalieli mwana wa Pedasuli, mulangulizi wa kabila da Manase kalava nhambiko yake. <verse eid="NUM 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 7:55" />Nhambiko yake ikala vino, chano ya hela ili na nzamo ya chilo imwe na nusu na buyu da hela dili na nzamo ya gilamu magana manane kuilinga na ningo za hema da Mulungu. Ivo vose vimemezigwa usage unogile uhanganyigwe na mavuta kwa ichimu cha nhosa ya usage. <verse eid="NUM 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 7:56" />Iviya kagala ziga da zahabu dili na nzamo ya gilamu gana na longo, dimemile ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 7:57" />na dang'ang'a lume na bebelu da ng'hondolo na mwanang'hondolo mulume imwe wa mwaka umwe, kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya kutimbula, <verse eid="NUM 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 7:58" />na bebelu da luti kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya uhasanyi, <verse eid="NUM 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 7:59" />na ng'ombe walume waidi na mabebelu ya ng'hondolo matano na mabebelu ya luti matano na wanang'hondolo walume watano wa mwaka umwe kwa ichimu cha nhambiko za kugala tindiwalo. Iyo ikala nhambiko ya Gamalieli mwana wa Pedasuli.<verse eid="NUM 7:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 7:60" />Siku ya kenda Abidani mwana wa Gidioni, mulangulizi wa kabila da Benjamini kalava nhambiko yake. <verse eid="NUM 7:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 7:61" />Nhambiko yake ikala vino, chano ya hela ili na nzamo ya chilo imwe na nusu na buyu da hela dili na nzamo ya gilamu magana manane kuilinga na ningo za hema da Mulungu. Ivo vose vimemezigwa usage unogile uhanganyigwe na mavuta kwa ichimu cha nhosa ya usage. <verse eid="NUM 7:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 7:62" />Iviya kagala ziga da zahabu dili na nzamo ya gilamu gana na longo, dimemile ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 7:63" />na dang'ang'a lume na bebelu da ng'hondolo na mwanang'hondolo mulume wa mwaka umwe, kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya kutimbula, <verse eid="NUM 7:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 7:64" />na bebelu da luti kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya uhasanyi, <verse eid="NUM 7:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 7:65" />na ng'ombe walume waidi na mabebelu ya ng'hondolo matano na mabebelu ya luti matano na wanang'hondolo walume watano wa mwaka umwe kwa ichimu cha nhambiko za kugala tindiwalo. Iyo ikala nhambiko ya Abidani mwana wa Gidioni.<verse eid="NUM 7:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="NUM 7:66" />Siku ya longo Ahiezeli mwana wa Amishadai, mulangulizi wa wanhu wa Dani kalava nhambiko yake. <verse eid="NUM 7:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="NUM 7:67" />Nhambiko yake ikala vino, chano ya hela ili na nzamo ya chilo imwe na nusu na buyu da hela dili na nzamo ya gilamu magana manane kuilinga na ningo za hema da Mulungu. Ivo vose vimemezigwa usage unogile uhanganyigwe na mavuta kwa ichimu cha nhosa ya usage. <verse eid="NUM 7:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="NUM 7:68" />Iviya kagala ziga da zahabu dili na nzamo ya gilamu gana na longo, dimemile ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="NUM 7:69" />na dang'ang'a lume na bebelu da ng'hondolo na mwanang'hondolo mulume wa mwaka umwe, kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya kutimbula, <verse eid="NUM 7:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="NUM 7:70" />na bebelu da luti kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya uhasanyi, <verse eid="NUM 7:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="NUM 7:71" />na ng'ombe walume waidi na mabebelu ya ng'hondolo watano na mabebelu ya luti matano na wanang'hondolo watano wa mwaka umwe kwa ichimu cha nhambiko za kugala tindiwalo. Iyo ikala nhambiko ya Ahiezeli mwana wa Amishadai.<verse eid="NUM 7:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="NUM 7:72" />Siku ya longo na imwe Pagieli mwana wa Okilani, mulangulizi wa kabila da Asheli kalava nhambiko yake. <verse eid="NUM 7:72" /><verse number="73" style="v" sid="NUM 7:73" />Nhambiko yake ikala vino, chano ya hela ili na nzamo ya chilo imwe na nusu na buyu da hela dili na nzamo ya gilamu magana manane kuilinga na ningo za hema da Mulungu. Ivo vose vimemezigwa usage unogile uhanganyigwe na mavuta kwa ichimu cha nhosa ya usage. <verse eid="NUM 7:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="NUM 7:74" />Iviya kagala ziga da zahabu dili na nzamo ya gilamu gana na longo, dimemile ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="NUM 7:75" />na dang'ang'a lume na bebelu da ng'hondolo na mwanang'hondolo mulume wa mwaka umwe, kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya kutimbula, <verse eid="NUM 7:75" /><verse number="76" style="v" sid="NUM 7:76" />na bebelu da luti kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya uhasanyi, <verse eid="NUM 7:76" /><verse number="77" style="v" sid="NUM 7:77" />na ng'ombe walume waidi na mabebelu ya ng'hondolo watano na mabebelu ya luti matano na wanang'hondolo watano wa mwaka umwe kwa ichimu cha nhambiko za kugala tindiwalo. Ino ikala nhambiko ya Pagieli mwana wa Okilani.<verse eid="NUM 7:77" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="NUM 7:78" />Siku ya longo na mbili Ahila mwana wa Enani, mulangulizi wa kabila da Nafutali kalava nhambiko yake. <verse eid="NUM 7:78" /><verse number="79" style="v" sid="NUM 7:79" />Nhambiko yake ikala vino, chano ya hela ili na nzamo ya chilo imwe na nusu na buyu da hela dili na nzamo ya gilamu magana manane kuilinga na ningo za hema da Mulungu. Ivo vose vimemezigwa usage unogile uhanganyigwe na mavuta kwa ichimu cha nhosa ya usage. <verse eid="NUM 7:79" /><verse number="80" style="v" sid="NUM 7:80" />Iviya kagala ziga da zahabu dili na nzamo ya gilamu gana na longo, dimemile ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:80" /><verse number="81" style="v" sid="NUM 7:81" />na dang'ang'a lume na bebelu da ng'hondolo na mwanang'hondolo mulume wa mwaka umwe, kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya kutimbula, <verse eid="NUM 7:81" /><verse number="82" style="v" sid="NUM 7:82" />na bebelu da luti kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya uhasanyi, <verse eid="NUM 7:82" /><verse number="83" style="v" sid="NUM 7:83" />na ng'ombe walume waidi na mabebelu ya ng'hondolo watano na mabebelu ya luti matano na wanang'hondolo watano wa mwaka umwe. Iyo ikala nhambiko ya Ahila mwana wa Enani.<verse eid="NUM 7:83" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="84" style="v" sid="NUM 7:84" />Izo zikala nhambiko za walangulizi wa Isilaili kwa ichimu cha kulwika ulupango kwa sang'hano yelile, siku ija vilubobodigwe mavuta, vyano va hela longo na vidi, mabuyu ya hela longo na maidi na maziga ya zahabu longo na maidi.<verse eid="NUM 7:84" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="85" style="v" sid="NUM 7:85" />Chila chano ya hela ikala na nzamo ya chilo imwe na nusu, na chila buyu dikala na nzamo ya gilamu magana manane. Nzamo ya via ivo vose va hela ikala gilamu 2,400, kuilinga na ningo ya hema da Mulungu.<verse eid="NUM 7:85" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="86" style="v" sid="NUM 7:86" />Maziga longo na maidi ya zahabu yamemile ubani, chila dimwe dina nzamo ya gilamu gana na longo, kuilinga na ningo ya hema da Mulungu. Zahabu yose ya maziga yaja ikala chilo imwe na chidogo. <verse eid="NUM 7:86" /><verse number="87" style="v" sid="NUM 7:87" />Peta yose ya wanyama wa nhambiko ya kutimbula ikala ng'ombe walume malongo maidi, mabebelu ya ng'hondolo malongo maidi na wanang'hondolo walume wa mwaka umwe malongo maidi, hamwe na nhosa zawo za usage na wanaluti longo na mbili kwa nhambiko ya uhasanyi <verse eid="NUM 7:87" /><verse number="88" style="v" sid="NUM 7:88" />na wanyama wose wa nhambiko ya kugala tindiwalo wakala ng'ombe walume malongo maidi na wane na mabebelu ya ng'hondolo malongo sita na mabebelu ya luti malongo sita na wanang'hondolo walume wa mwaka umwe malongo sita. Zino izo nhambiko zilavigwe kwa ichimu cha kulwika ulupango kwa sang'hano yelile, lupango vilumalile kubobodigwa mavuta.<verse eid="NUM 7:88" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="89" style="v" sid="NUM 7:89" />Musa viyengile muna dihema da Mulungu kulonga na Mndewa Mulungu, kahulika dizi dolonga na yeye kulawa hagati ya vilumbe waidi walingile fana wasenga wa kuulanga, uchanyha ya ngubiko ya kuilumba hana disanduku da lagano, na kalonga nayo.<verse eid="NUM 7:89" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NUM 8" />
  <para style="s">Vitasa saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 8:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 8:2" />“Mulongele Haluni, ‘Uheka vitasa saba, vizamwemwesa kuulongozi wa ichinala cha chitasa.’ ” <verse eid="NUM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 8:3" />Haluni katogola na keka vitasa ivo muladi vimwemwese ubanzi wa kuulongozi wa chinala fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize Musa. <verse eid="NUM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 8:4" />Chinala icho cha chitasa chikala chitendigwe kwa ufundi mkulu kwa zahabu yoihondigwe kulawa hana ichikalilo mbaka maluwa fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walawi wokwikigwa hakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 8:5" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 8:6" />“Weke hakwe Walawi kulawa mwa Waisilaili na uwatende wele. <verse eid="NUM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 8:7" />Tenda vino muladi kuwasafya, miza uchanyha yawo mazi ya kuwasafya, maabaho uwalongele waiwegule nyele lukuli lose na wafuwe viwalo vawo muladi kuisafya. <verse eid="NUM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 8:8" />Maabaho wezasola dang'ang'a lume hamwe na nhosa yake ya usage, usage unogile uhanganyigwe na mavuta, weye kwizasola dang'ang'a lume dimwenga kuwa nhambiko ya uhasanyi. <verse eid="NUM 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 8:9" />Wagale Walawi kuulongozi wa hema da Mulungu na uwaduganye Waisilaili wose. <verse eid="NUM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 8:10" />Vondauwagale Walawi kuulongozi wa hema da Mulungu, Waisilaili wezawekila makono Walawi, <verse eid="NUM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 8:11" />nayo Haluni kezawagala Walawi haulongozi wangu niye Mndewa Mulungu, wawe fana nhambiko ya kwinula uchanyha kwa chilaguso muladi wanisang'hanile. <verse eid="NUM 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 8:12" />Walawi wezakwika makono yawo mchanyha ya matwi ya ng'ombe wawo. Imwe kwizamulava kuwa nhambiko ya uhasanyi na imwenga kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya kutimbula muladi kuwatendela kuilumba Walawi.<verse eid="NUM 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 8:13" />“Maabaho kwizawemiza Walawi haulongozi wa Haluni na wanage na kwika haulongozi wangu niye Mndewa Mulungu, wawe nhambiko ya kwinuligwa uchanyha kwa chilaguso. <verse eid="NUM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 8:14" />Vino niivo vondauweke hakwe Walawi kulawa mwa Waisilaili. Walawi wezakuwa wangu. <verse eid="NUM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 8:15" />Uhakomeleza kuwasafya Walawi na kuwalava fana nhambiko ya kwinula uchanyha kwa chilaguso, wezasang'hana muna dihema da Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 8:16" />Wawo niwasola wawe wangu ng'hani, niwasola wawo badala ya wana wa udele wa Waisilaili. <verse eid="NUM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 8:17" />Chila mwana wa udele yawe munhu hebu mnyama muna iisi ya Isilaili ni wangu. Viniwakomile wana wa udele wose muna iisi ya Misili, niweka hakwe kwa ichimu changu. <verse eid="NUM 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 8:18" />Niwasola Walawi badala ya wana wa udele wose wa Waisilaili. <verse eid="NUM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 8:19" />Walawi wamwenga niweng'ha Haluni na wanage, kulawa kwa Waisilaili muladi wawasang'hanile Waisilaili muna dihema da Mulungu, watende kuilumba kwa ichimu cha Waisilaili, muladi sekekuwe na matamu kwa Waisilaili, vondawakwenhukile hanhu helile.”<verse eid="NUM 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 8:20" />Ivo Musa na Haluni na mting'hano wose wa Waisilaili wawatendela Walawi fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize Musa. <verse eid="NUM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 8:21" />Walawi waisafya uhasanyi wawo na wafuwa viwalo vawo. Maabaho Haluni kawalava nhambiko ya kwinula uchanyha kwa chilaguso haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu na kuwatendela kuilumba muladi kuwasafya. <verse eid="NUM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 8:22" />Ivo Walawi wasang'hana usang'hano wawo muna dihema da Mulungu haulongozi ha Haluni na wanage. Wawatendela Walawi fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize Musa. <verse eid="NUM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 8:23" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 8:24" />“Mbuli zowolondeka Walawi ni zino, walume wose weli na miyaka malongo maidi na mitano na kugendelela wolondeka wengile kusang'hanila muna dihema da Mulungu, <verse eid="NUM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 8:25" />mbali walume weli na miyaka malongo matano wezaleka kusang'hanila muna dihema da Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 8:26" />Wezawataza ndugu zawo wosang'hana muna dihema da Mulungu kwa kuwakaliza, mbali wawo wenyewo sekewasang'hane usang'hano. Vino niivo vondauwalagilize Walawi sang'hano zawo.”<verse eid="NUM 8:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NUM 9" />
  <para style="s">Pasaka yekaidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 9:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kalonga na Musa kuna ichuwala cha Sinai, mwezi wa mwanduso muna umwaka wekaidi, viwalawile muna iisi ya Misili. Kamulongela, <verse eid="NUM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 9:2" />“Waisilaili watende Dugila da Pasaka kwa lusita lupangigwe.<verse eid="NUM 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 9:3" />“Siku ya longo na nne ya mwezi uno ichigulogulo nguku zikwingila, mwizaitenda ivo kwa kusondelela malagilizo na ndagilizi zose.” <verse eid="NUM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 9:4" />Ivo Musa kawalongela Waisilaili watende Dugila da Pasaka.<verse eid="NUM 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 9:5" />Watenda ivo ichigulogulo nguku zikwingila muna isiku ya longo na nne ya mwezi kuna ichuwala cha Sinai. Waisilaili watenda chila chinhu fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 9:6" />Mbali kukala na walume wamwenga wambula mwiko kwa kudalisa mtufi wa munhu, ivo hawadahile kudeng'helele Dugila da Pasaka muna isiku iyo. Wahita kuulongozi wa Musa na Haluni muna isiku iyo.<verse eid="NUM 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 9:7" />Wamulongela Musa, “Cheye chambula mwiko kwaviya chidalisa mtufi wa munhu, habali sekechimulavile Mndewa Mulungu nhambiko na Waisilaili wamwenga kwa lusita lupangigwe?”<verse eid="NUM 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 9:8" />Musa kawedika, “Gozeleni mbaka vondanihulike Mndewa Mulungu chiyolagiliza kusonhela mweye.”<verse eid="NUM 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 9:9" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 9:10" />“Walongele Waisilaili, ‘Munhu wa kumwenu hebu wa nyelesi zenu, munhu yoyose yondayawe kambula mwiko kwa kudalisa mtufi, hebu yahawa kutali muna umwanza, kozindilila Pasaka ya Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 9:11" />Mwezi umwe hamwande, siku ya longo na nne ya mwezi, ichigulogulo nguku zikwingila, wezaizindilila. Wezakuja hamwe na magate hayagumigwe lusu na mboga zili usungu. <verse eid="NUM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 9:12" />Sekewasigaze chinhu chochose mbaka imitondo, hebu sekewabene vuha jojose da mnyama wa Pasaka. Wezatenda fana vizili ndagilizi za Dugila da Pasaka. <verse eid="NUM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 9:13" />Mbali munhu yoyose yelile hebu heli muna umwanza, nayo hajamhile Dugila da Pasaka, munhu iyo kezabaguligwa na wanhu wake, kwaviya hamulavile Mndewa Mulungu nhambiko kwa lusita lupangigwe. Munhu iyo kezatagusigwa kwa uhasanyi wake.<verse eid="NUM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 9:14" />“ ‘Mgeni yahakala na mweye na kolonda kudeng'helela Dugila da Pasaka da Mndewa Mulungu, kolondeka yatende fana viili ndagilizi na lagilizo da Dugila da Pasaka. Mwizakuwa na lagilizo dimwe kwa iyo yeli mgeni na kwa ija yelekigwe muna iisi.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wingu uchanyha ya hema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 40:34-38">Kulawa 40:34-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 9:15" />Muna isiku ija vidisimikigwe hema da Mulungu wingu dihulumuka na kugubika hema ijo. Kwandusila ichigulogulo mbaka imitondo wingu diwa uchanyha ya hema da Mulungu diwoneka fana moto. <verse eid="NUM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 9:16" />Ivo niivo viiwile chila siku, wingu digubika hema imisi, na ichilo diwoneka fana moto. <verse eid="NUM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 9:17" />Chila lusita wingu diya vidinuligwe uchanyha ya hema da Mulungu, baho Waisilaili wandusa mwanza, na hanhu hadikalile wingu diya ni baho Waisilaili hawekile lago. <verse eid="NUM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 9:18" />Kwa lagilizo da Mndewa Mulungu Waisilaili wandusa mwanza, na kwa lagilizo da Mndewa Mulungu wazenga lago, lusita diwingu diya vidikalile uchanyha ya hema da Mulungu wakala muna dilago jawo. <verse eid="NUM 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 9:19" />Wingu diya vidikalame uchanyha ya hema da Mulungu siku nyingi, Waisilaili wamuhulika Mndewa Mulungu, hawasegele. <verse eid="NUM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 9:20" />Miyanza imwenga wingu dikala uchanyha kwa siku ndodo, kwa lagilizo diya da Mndewa Mulungu wakala muna dilago jawo, na kwa lagilizo da Mndewa Mulungu wandusa mwanza. <verse eid="NUM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 9:21" />Miyanza imwenga wingu dikala uchanyha ya hema da Mulungu kulawa ichigulogulo mbaka imitondo. Wingu diya vidinuligwe imitondo, wandusa mwanza, hata one dikala uchanyha imisi na ichilo, wingu vidinuligwe wandusa mwanza. <verse eid="NUM 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 9:22" />Ihawa wingu dikala uchanyha ya hema da Mulungu siku mbili hebu mwezi hebu mwaka, Waisilaili wakala muna dilago jawo, mbali vidinuligwe uchanyha wandusa mwanza. <verse eid="NUM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 9:23" />Kwa lagilizo da Mndewa Mulungu weka lago jawo, na kwa lagilizo da Mndewa Mulungu wandusa mwanza. Wazindilila malagilizo ya Mndewa Mulungu yoyamulagilize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 9:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NUM 10" />
  <para style="s">Mhalati za hela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 10:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 10:2" />“Tenda mhalati mbili za hela zihondigwe, kwizazisang'hanila mhalati izo lusita lwa kuwatanga wanhu na lusita lwa kubomola malago. <verse eid="NUM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 10:3" />Mhalati zose zihatowigwa, wanhu wose wezaiting'hana haulongozi wako, haulongozi wa hanhu ha kwingilila muna dihema da Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 10:4" />One ihatowigwa mhalati imwe muhala, walangulizi wa ng'holo za Isilaili wezaiting'hana haulongozi wako. <verse eid="NUM 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 10:5" />Muhatowa ulo kwa ulo, malago yeli ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zuwa yezasegela. <verse eid="NUM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 10:6" />Muhatowa ulo kwa ulo mwanza wekaidi, wanhu wa ubanzi wa kusi wezasegela. Chilaguso icho cha mhalati chizatendigwa chila lusita lwa kwandusa mwanza. <verse eid="NUM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 10:7" />Mbali kuwaduganya wanhu hamwe, mwizatowa mhalati, mbali mutowe dimwe kwa dimwe. <verse eid="NUM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 10:8" />Wana wa chilume wa mkulu wa nhambiko Haluni wezatowa mhalati izo. Lagilizo dino dizakuwa da siku zose kumwenu na kwa nyelesi zikwiza.<verse eid="NUM 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 10:9" />“Vondamuhite kuitowa ng'hondo na wehi wenu womuwonelani kuna iisi yenu, baho mwizatowa mhalati ulo kwa ulo. Mwizakumbukigwa haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wenu na mwizakomboligwa kulawa kwa wehi wenu. <verse eid="NUM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 10:10" />Muna zisiku zenu za kudeng'helela na muna yamadugila yenu yapangigwe, na kwima kwa chila mwezi, mwizatowa mhalati izo lusita lwa kulava nhambiko zenu za kutimbula na nhambiko zenu za tindiwalo, nazo kumwenu zizakuwa lukumbuso haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu. Niye niiyo Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wenu.”<verse eid="NUM 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waisilaili wosegela Sinai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 10:11" />Siku ya malongo maidi ya mwezi wekaidi, mwaka wekaidi kwandusila Waisilaili viwasegele Misili, wingu dikalile uchanyha ya hema da Mulungu dinuligwa. <verse eid="NUM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 10:12" />Waisilaili wasegela chuwala cha Sinai, wingu dihumuluka kuna ichuwala cha Palani. <verse eid="NUM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 10:13" />Wandusa kusegela fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize Musa. <verse eid="NUM 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 10:14" />Yuda na makabila yazengile habehi nayo yandusa mwanza hana ibendela yawo. Nashoni mwana wa Aminadabu niiyo yakalile mulangulizi wa kabila da Yuda. <verse eid="NUM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 10:15" />Nasanaeli mwana wa Suali kakala mulangulizi wa kabila da Isakali, <verse eid="NUM 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 10:16" />na Eliabu mwana wa Heloni kakala mulangulizi wa kabila da Zabuloni. <verse eid="NUM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 10:17" />Maabaho hema da Mulungu dihulumusigwa hasi, wanhu wa ng'holo za Gelishoni na Melali wowapapile hema ijo, wandusa kusegela.<verse eid="NUM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 10:18" />Maabaho wanhu wakalile hana ibendela ya kabila da Lubeni, wasondelela bumbila dimwe dimwe. Mulangulizi wawo kakala Elisuli mwana wa Shedueli. <verse eid="NUM 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 10:19" />Shelumieli mwana wa Sulishadai kakala mulangulizi wa kabila da Simeoni. <verse eid="NUM 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 10:20" />Maabaho Eliasafu mwana wa Deueli kalanguliza kabila da Gadi.<verse eid="NUM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 10:21" />Wowawasondelele wakala Wakohasi, wasola vinhu velile, na hema dizengigwa wang'hali wawo hawanafika. <verse eid="NUM 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 10:22" />Wowawasondelele wakala waja weli hana ibendela ya kabila da Efulaimu, bumbila dimwe dimwe. Mulangulizi wawo kakala Elishama mwana wa Amihudi. <verse eid="NUM 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 10:23" />Gamalieli mwana wa Pedasuli kakala mulangulizi wa kabila da Manase. <verse eid="NUM 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 10:24" />Na mulangulizi wa kabila da Benjamini kakala Abidani mwana wa Gideoni.<verse eid="NUM 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 10:25" />Kuuhelelo wose wakalile hana ibendela ya kabila da Dani wakalile walolezi kwa Waisilaili muladi sekewatowigwe kwa kuchisogo, wandusa mwanza, bumbila dimwe dimwe. Wano walangulizigwa na Ahiezeli mwana wa Amishadai. <verse eid="NUM 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 10:26" />Pagieli mwana wa Okilani kakala mulangulizi wa kabila da Asheli, <verse eid="NUM 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 10:27" />na Ahila mwana wa Enani kakala mulangulizi wa kabila da Nafutali. <verse eid="NUM 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 10:28" />Vino niivo ikalile miyanza ya Waisilaili kwa makabila yawo, dimwe dimwe, viwanduse mwanza. <verse eid="NUM 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 10:29" />Musa kamulongela Hobabu mwana wa Leueli Mmidiani, mkoi wake, “Cheye chokwandusa mwanza kuhita hanhu haja Mndewa Mulungu hoyalongile, ‘Nizamwing'hani hanhu baho.’ Wize hamwe na cheye, chizakutendela yanogile kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kalonga yanogile kusonhela Waisilaili.” <verse eid="NUM 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 10:30" />Hobabu kedika, “Sizahita, nobwela kuna iisi yangu na wanhu wangu.”<verse eid="NUM 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 10:31" />Mbali Musa kalonga, “Sekeuchileke, mana weye kuhamanya hanhu hochilondeka kwika lago kuichuwala, kodaha kuchilongoza nzila. <verse eid="NUM 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 10:32" />One uhahita hamwe na cheye, yanogile yose yondayachitendele Mndewa Mulungu, na weye chizakutendela ivo ivo.”<verse eid="NUM 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 10:33" />Wasegela kulawa kuna mulima wa Mndewa Mulungu na wagenda siku nhatu. Sanduku da lagano da Mndewa Mulungu diwalongolela muladi kuwazahilila hanhu ha kuhumula. <verse eid="NUM 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 10:34" />Wingu da Mndewa Mulungu dikala uchanyha yawo imisi viwakalile wohita kuna dilago. <verse eid="NUM 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 10:35" />Sanduku vidihitile, Musa kalonga, “Inuka weye Mndewa Mulungu! Wehi wako wapwililike na wanhu wokwihila wakimbile na kuhumigwa.” <verse eid="NUM 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 10:36" />Wingu vidimile, Musa kalonga, “Weye Mndewa Mulungu wabwelele wano Waisilaili maelufu na maelufu.”<verse eid="NUM 10:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NUM 11" />
  <para style="s">Kulongelela kuchuwala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 11:1" />Wanhu wandusa kulongelela kwa Mndewa Mulungu kwa manhesa yawo. Mndewa Mulungu viyahulike, kehilwa na kawagalila moto. Moto uwo waka hagati yawo na utimbula ubanzi umwe wa lago. <verse eid="NUM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 11:2" />Wanhu wamulilila Musa, nayo Musa kampula Mndewa Mulungu, na moto uja ufa. <verse eid="NUM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 11:3" />Ivo hanhu baho hatangigwa Tabela, kwaviya moto wa Mndewa Mulungu waka hagati yawo.<verse eid="NUM 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa kosagula walangulizi malongo saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 11:4" />Hagati ya Waisilaili kukala na bumbila dimwenga dikala na hamu ng'hulu. Waisilaili walila kaidi, walonga, “Muhavu chipate nyama imwenga ya kuja! <verse eid="NUM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 11:5" />Chokumbuka somba wochidile Misili bila kuliha, na yaja matanga na matikiti na vitunguu va mayani na vitunguu na vitunguu saumu. <verse eid="NUM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 11:6" />Mbali sambi chabule hamu ya kuja, habule chinhu chimwenga cha kuja ila mana muhala.” <verse eid="NUM 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 11:7" />Mana iyo ilinga fana mhule za ng'halasi, iwoneka fana nzelu chidogo. <verse eid="NUM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 11:8" />Wanhu wazunguluka na kuiduganya, maabaho waidunda kwa mabwe ya kudundila, hebu kuitwanga muna yamatuli, maabaho kuitogosa muna zinongo na kusasala magate, umulile wake ulinga fana maandazi yambikigwe na mavuta. <verse eid="NUM 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 11:9" />Nhungwe viilagale uchanyha ya lago ichilo, mana ilagala na nhungwe iyo. <verse eid="NUM 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 11:10" />Musa kawahulika wanhu wolila muna zing'holo zawo zose, chila munhu hana ihanhu ha kwingilila muna dihema jake, Mndewa Mulungu kawona ludoko ng'hani, Musa nayo kawona viha. <verse eid="NUM 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 11:11" />Musa kamulongela Mndewa Mulungu, “Habali kunitendela vihile niye msang'hani wako? Habali hunogelwe na niye mbaka kuning'ha mbahasha ya wanhu wano wose? <verse eid="NUM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 11:12" />Vino niye niweng'ha zinda wanhu wano wose? Vino niye niiyo niweleke? Habali kulonga niweke hachaha yangu fana mama viyokong'heza ching'hele, na kuwagala mbaka kuna iisi iuwalahile kuweng'ha wasaho zawo? <verse eid="NUM 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 11:13" />Kulihi kondanipate nyama ya kuweng'ha wanhu wano wose? Mana wanililila, walonga, ‘Ching'he nyama chije!’ <verse eid="NUM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 11:14" />Sidaha kuwapapa wanhu wano wose niidumwe, kwaviya mbahasha iyo izama ng'hani kumwangu. <verse eid="NUM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 11:15" />One wahanitenda vino, muhavu unikome sambi. One uhanitogolela, sekeunileke muna yamagayo yangu.”<verse eid="NUM 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 11:16" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Niduganyile walume malongo saba kulawa mwa walangulizi wa Isilaili, waja weye kuwamanya kuwa niiwawo walangulizi wa wanhu wawo, uwagale hana dihema da Mulungu, weme hamwe na weye. <verse eid="NUM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 11:17" />Niye nizahulumuka na kulonga na weye uko, nizasola hanhu ha muhe unikwing'hile, nizaweng'ha wanhu wawo. Nawo wezakutaza kupapa mbahasha za wanhu wano muladi sekeupape wiidumwe. <verse eid="NUM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 11:18" />Walongele wanhu, ‘Muisafye kwaviya igolo mwizakuja nyama, kwaviya mumulilila Mndewa Mulungu, mulonga, “Yelihi yondayaching'he nyama chije? Mana kuja Misili chikala na muhavu.” Ivo kwa ichimu icho Mndewa Mulungu kezamwing'hani nyama muje. <verse eid="NUM 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 11:19" />Hamwizakuja siku dimwe hebu siku mbili hebu siku tano hebu siku longo hebu siku malongo maidi, <verse eid="NUM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 11:20" />mbali mwizakuja mwezi mgima mbaka nyama iyo vondailawe muna zimhula zenu. Mwizating'hwa, kwaviya mumulema Mndewa Mulungu yeli hagati yenu na mulila haulongozi wake, mulonga, “Habali chisegela Misili?” ’ ”<verse eid="NUM 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 11:21" />Mbali Musa kalonga, “Wanhu wano nili hagati yawo ni wanhu 600,000 wowogenda kwa migulu, weye kulonga, ‘Nizaweng'ha nyama waje mwezi mgima. <verse eid="NUM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 11:22" />Vino mabumbila ya ng'hondolo na ng'ombe yezachinjigwa kwa ichimu chawo? Vino somba wose muna ibahali wezavuwigwa kwa ichimu chawo?’ ”<verse eid="NUM 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 11:23" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Vino udahi wangu uhunguka? Lelo kwizawona fana mbuli yangu izalawilila kumwako hebu haizalawilila.”<verse eid="NUM 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 11:24" />Ivo Musa kalawa kunze na kuwalongela wanhu mbuli iyalongile Mndewa Mulungu. Maabaho kawaduganya walangulizi malongo saba na kawemiza kuzunguluka hema. <verse eid="NUM 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 11:25" />Mndewa Mulungu kahulumuka kulawa muna diwingu na kulonga nayo. Kasola hanhu ha muhe uli uchanyha yake na kauguma uchanyha ya walangulizi waja malongo saba. Muhe uwo viuwahulumukile, wandusa kulonga fana walotezi. Mbali watenda ivo mwanza umwe muhala.<verse eid="NUM 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 11:26" />Walangulizi waidi mwa waja walangulizi malongo saba wasigala muna dilago, imwe katangigwa Elidadi na imwenga Medadi. Muhe ukala uchanyha yawo, nawo wakala mwa waja wapetigwe. Kwaviya hawalawile kuhita kuna dihema, wandusa kulonga fana walotezi muna dilago.<verse eid="NUM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 11:27" />Mbwanga imwe kakimbila kahita kumulongela Musa, “Elidadi na Medadi walonga fana walotezi muna dilago.” <verse eid="NUM 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 11:28" />Maabaho Yoshua mwana wa Nuni yakalile msang'hani wa Musa kwandusila viyakalile mbwanga, kedika na kalonga, “Musa, mwenevale wangu, walemese!”<verse eid="NUM 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 11:29" />Mbali Musa kedika, “Weye kowona migongo kwa ichimu changu? Ihawile vinoga wanhu wose wa Mndewa Mulungu wahawile walotezi na one Mndewa Mulungu yahawagumile muhe wake!” <verse eid="NUM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 11:30" />Maabaho Musa na walangulizi wa Isilaili wabwela kuna dilago.<verse eid="NUM 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mndewa Mulungu kogala ng'hwale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 11:31" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kagala beho najo digala ng'hwale kulawa muibahali. Diwaleka walagalila habehi na lago, siku dimwe ubanzi uno na siku dimwenga ubanzi umwenga kuzunguluka lago. Wakala wotayaya mita imwe uchanyha ya isi. <verse eid="NUM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 11:32" />Wanhu wasegela imisi iyo yose na ichilo chose na igolo yake yose, waduganya ng'hwale. Yapatile wadodo ng'hani kapata chilo 1,000. Maabaho wawanika wose mumgwazo wa lago kuzunguluka banzi zose. <verse eid="NUM 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 11:33" />Mbali viwakalile hawanakomeleza kuja nyama, Mndewa Mulungu kawehila wanhu na kawagalila hulo kulu. <verse eid="NUM 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 11:34" />Hanhu haja hatangigwa Kibilosi Hataava, kwaviya baho wawawanda wanhu wamelo. <verse eid="NUM 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 11:35" />Kulawa Kibilosi Hataava wanhu wagenda mbaka Haselosi, wakala uko.<verse eid="NUM 11:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NUM 12" />
  <para style="s">Miliamu na Haluni womuwonela migongo Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 12:1" />Miliamu na Haluni wandusa kumulonga vihile Musa kwa ichimu cha imuke Mkushi iyamsolile. <verse eid="NUM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 12:2" />Walonga, “Vino Mndewa Mulungu kalonga kufosela Musa muhala? Halongile kufosela cheye iviya?” Mndewa Mulungu kahulika chiwalongile. <verse eid="NUM 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 12:3" />Musa kakala munhu yoinyendanyenda ng'hani kufosa wanhu wamwenga wose muna iisi. <verse eid="NUM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 12:4" />Kwa kusinhukila Mndewa Mulungu kawalongela Musa na Haluni na Miliamu, “Mweye wose watatu laweni na mwize hana dihema da Mulungu.” Ivo watatu wawo wahita muna dihema da Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 12:5" />Mndewa Mulungu kahulumuka muna diwingu dilingile fana mhanda na kema hana ihanhu ha kwingilila muna dihema da Mulungu na kawatanga Haluni na Miliamu. Wose wakwenhuka kuulongozi. <verse eid="NUM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 12:6" />Maabaho kawalongela, “Tegelezeni mbuli zangu, kuhawa na mulotezi hagati yenu, niye Mndewa Mulungu nizailagusa kumwake muna yamalaguso, nizalonga nayo muna zinzozi. <verse eid="NUM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 12:7" />Mbali kwa Musa msang'hani wangu haili ivo, yeye kokwaminika muna iwanhu wangu wose. <verse eid="NUM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 12:8" />Nolonga nayo chihanga kwa chihanga, funhufunhu siyo kwa chifiso, koniwona niye Mndewa Mulungu vinili. Habali mweye hamudumbile kumulonga vihile Musa msang'hani wangu?” <verse eid="NUM 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 12:9" />Mndewa Mulungu kawawonela ludoko na kasegela.<verse eid="NUM 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 12:10" />Maabaho wingu disegela uchanyha ya hema da Mulungu na Miliamu kawa na utamu wa mbende, mzelu fana pamba. Haluni kamulola Miliamu na kamuwona kana utamu wa mbende. <verse eid="NUM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 12:11" />Haluni kamulongela Musa, “Mwenevale wangu cholamba sekeuchigaze kwaviya chitenda mbuli za chibozi na chitenda uhasanyi. <verse eid="NUM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 12:12" />Sekeumtende yawe fana mwana yelekigwe yadanganike, yeli nusu ya lukuli lwake luwola.”<verse eid="NUM 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 12:13" />Musa kamulilila Mndewa Mulungu, kalonga, “Mulungu nokulamba umuhonye Miliamu!”<verse eid="NUM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 12:14" />Mndewa Mulungu kamwidika, “Hata one tati yake kambwajulila mate muna ichihanga, sigambeyawone chinyala kwa siku saba? Kolondeka yafungigwe kunze ya lago siku saba, maabaho kezabwelezigwa mgati kaidi.” <verse eid="NUM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 12:15" />Ivo Miliamu kakala kunze ya lago kwa siku saba na wanhu hawagendelele na umwanza mbaka Miliamu viyagaligwe mgati kaidi. <verse eid="NUM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 12:16" />Maabaho wanhu wasegela Haselosi na weka lago kuna ichuwala cha Palani.<verse eid="NUM 12:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NUM 13" />
  <para style="s">Wapelembaji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 1:19-33">Kumbukumbu 1:19-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 13:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 13:2" />“Tuma wanhu muladi wahite wakaipelembe isi ya Kanaani, yoniweng'ha Waisilaili. Kwizamtuma munhu imwe kulawa chila kabila da tati zawo yawe mulangulizi hagati yawo.” <verse eid="NUM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 13:3" />Ivo Musa kawatuma kulawa kuna ichuwala cha Palani fana viyalagilizigwe na Mndewa Mulungu. Wose wakala walangulizi wa Waisilaili. <verse eid="NUM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 13:4" />Yano ni mazina ya wanhu wawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 13:4">Kulawa kabila da Lubeni, kakala Shamua mwana wa Zakuli.<verse eid="NUM 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 13:5" />Kulawa kabila da Simeoni, kakala Shafati mwana wa Holi.<verse eid="NUM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 13:6" />Kulawa kabila da Yuda, kakala Kalebu mwana wa Yefune.<verse eid="NUM 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 13:7" />Kulawa kabila da Isakali, kakala Igali mwana wa Yosefu.<verse eid="NUM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 13:8" />Kulawa kabila da Efulaimu, kakala Hoshea mwana wa Nuni.<verse eid="NUM 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 13:9" />Kulawa kabila da Benjamini, kakala Paliti mwana wa Lafu.<verse eid="NUM 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 13:10" />Kulawa kabila da Zabuloni, kakala Gadieli mwana wa Sodi.<verse eid="NUM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 13:11" />Kulawa kabila da Manase dilawile kuna dikabila da Yosefu, kakala Gadi mwana wa Susi.<verse eid="NUM 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 13:12" />Kulawa kabila da Dani, kakala Amieli mwana wa Gemali.<verse eid="NUM 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 13:13" />Kulawa kabila da Asheli, kakala Sesuli mwana wa Mikaeli.<verse eid="NUM 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 13:14" />Kulawa kabila da Nafutali, kakala Nabi mwana wa Wofisi,<verse eid="NUM 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 13:15" />Kulawa kabila da Gadi, kakala Geueli mwana wa Maki.<verse eid="NUM 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 13:16" />Yayo ni mazina ya wanhu waja Musa woyawatumile wahite kuipelemba isi ya Kanaani. Iyo Hoshea mwana wa Nuni, Musa kamtanga zina jake Yoshua.<verse eid="NUM 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 13:17" />Musa viyawatumile wawo kuipelemba isi ya Kanaani, kalonga, “Kweleni kufosela ubanzi wa kusi na mukwele kuna imilima ya isi, <verse eid="NUM 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 13:18" />mukailole isi viili. Iviya mupelembe kuwa wanhu wokala umo wana nguvu hebu wanyondenyonde, wadodo hebu wengi. <verse eid="NUM 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 13:19" />Muipelembe isi yowokala fana inoga hebu iha, na wanhu wokala muna yamabululu yeli na mhongono hebu wokala muna yamalago. <verse eid="NUM 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 13:20" />Isi yake yavilihi? Ina ulongo unogile hebu wihile? Ina mibiki hebu yabule? Tendeni vimudaha mukagale matunda ya isi.” Icho chikala chipindi cha zabibu kwandusa kwiva.<verse eid="NUM 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 13:21" />Ivo wanhu wahita na waipelemba isi kulawa chuwala cha Sini mbaka Lehobu, habehi na hanhu ha kwingilila Hamasi. <verse eid="NUM 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 13:22" />Wahita kufosela ubanzi wa kusi na wafika bululu da Hebuloni, uko wawafika Waahimani na Waasheshai na Watalimai, welesi wa Anaki. Bululu da Hebuloni dizengigwe miyaka saba ing'hali kuzengigwa bululu da Soani dili Misili. <verse eid="NUM 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 13:23" />Viwafikile kuna dikolongo da Eshikoli, wakanha tambi dili na chipambo chimwe cha zabibu. Wanhu waidi wadipapa kwa mbiki hagati ya waidi wawo, iviya wagala makomamanga na nhini. <verse eid="NUM 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 13:24" />Hanhu haja hatangigwa Kolongo da Eshikoli kwaviya Waisilaili wakanha chipambo chiya hanhu baho. <verse eid="NUM 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 13:25" />Vizimalile siku malongo mane, wabwela kulawa kuipelemba isi.<verse eid="NUM 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wapelembaji wolonga mbuli zilawile uko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 13:26" />Wabwela kwa Musa na Haluni na Waisilaili wose wakalile Kadeshi muna ichuwala cha Palani, wawalongela wose mbuli ziwawonile uko na wawalagusa matunda ya isi. <verse eid="NUM 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 13:27" />Wamulongela Musa, “Chifika kuna iisi youchitumile, isi ina ulongo unogile ng'hani na yano ni matunda yake. <verse eid="NUM 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 13:28" />Mbali wanhu wokala muna iisi ija wana nguvu, mabululu yawo yanoga na makulu ng'hani na yana mhongono. Iviya uko chiwawona welesi wa Anaki weli watali ng'hani. <verse eid="NUM 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 13:29" />Waamaleki wokala isi ya ubanzi wa kusi, Wahiti na Wayebusi na Waamoli wokala kuna imilima, Wakanaani wokala habehi na bahali ya Meditelaniya na mwiingema ya Yoludani.”<verse eid="NUM 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 13:30" />Kalebu kawatenda wanhu wanyamale haulongozi wa Musa, kalonga, “Cholondeka chihite chikaisole isi, mana chodaha kuhuma.”<verse eid="NUM 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 13:31" />Mbali wanhu wahitile hamwe na Kalebu walonga, “Hachidaha kuitowa na wanhu wano, mana wana nguvu kufosa cheye.” <verse eid="NUM 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 13:32" />Ivo wawagalila Waisilaili mbuli zihile za isi ija yowaipelembe, walonga, “Wanhu wokala muna iisi ija wodanganika. Wanhu wose wochiwawonile umo ni watali ng'hani. <verse eid="NUM 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 13:33" />Uko chiwawona Wanefili<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wanefili ni wanhu watali ng'hani.</char></note>, welesi wa Anaki. Chiiwona wenyewo fana mbalangulu, nawo niivo vowachiwonile.”<verse eid="NUM 13:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="NUM 14" />
  <para style="s">Wanhu wolongelela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 14:1" />Wanhu wose walandula madizi yawo na walila ichilo icho. <verse eid="NUM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 14:2" />Waisilaili wose walongelela kwa Musa na Haluni, wanhu wose walonga, “Ihawile muhavu chihadanganikile muna iisi ya Misili, hebu ihawile muhavu chihadanganikile muna ichuwala chino! <verse eid="NUM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 14:3" />Habali Mndewa Mulungu kachigala muna iisi ino muladi chikomigwe kwa panga? Wake zetu na wanetu wezakuwa mateka. Vino siyo muhavu chibwele Misili?” <verse eid="NUM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 14:4" />Wailongela, “Chimsagule mulangulizi na chibwele Misili.”<verse eid="NUM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 14:5" />Maabaho Musa na Haluni watumbala mavindi na vihanga vawo vidalisa hasi haulongozi wa Waisilaili wose. <verse eid="NUM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 14:6" />Yoshua mwana wa Nuni na Kalebu mwana wa Yefune, wakalile wamwe wa wapelembaji, wadega viwalo vawo kwa usungu, <verse eid="NUM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 14:7" />na wawalongela Waisilaili wose, “Isi yochihitile kuipelemba inoga ng'hani. <verse eid="NUM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 14:8" />One Mndewa Mulungu yahanogelwa na cheye, kezachigala kuna iisi iyo na kuching'ha iwe yetu, isi ili na ulongo unogile ng'hani. <verse eid="NUM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 14:9" />Sekemumuleke Mndewa Mulungu hebu sekemuwadumbe wakaya wa isi iyo, mana wawo chizawahuma. Hawakalizigwa, mbali Mndewa Mulungu kahamwe na cheye, sekemuwadumbe.” <verse eid="NUM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 14:10" />Wanhu wose walonda kuwatowa na mabwe. Maabaho utunhizo wa Mndewa Mulungu uwalawilila Waisilaili wose hana dihema da Mulungu.<verse eid="NUM 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 14:11" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Wanhu wano wezanizeha mbaka zuwaki? Hawezanihuwila mbaka zuwaki, ingawa nitenda vilaguso ivo vose kumwawo? <verse eid="NUM 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 14:12" />Nizawagalila hulo da utamu na kuwaleka. Nizakwing'ha ng'holo nyingi zili na ludabwa kufosa wawo.”<verse eid="NUM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa kowapulila wanhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 14:13" />Mbali Musa kamulongela Mndewa Mulungu, “Wamisili wezahulika mbuli iyo, kuwa kuwagala wanhu wano kwa udahi wako hagati yawo, <verse eid="NUM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 14:14" />maabaho wezawalongela wakaya wa isi ino. Wahulika kuwa weye Mndewa Mulungu kwahagati ya wanhu wano, mana weye Mndewa Mulungu kowoneka chihanga kwa chihanga na wingu jako dokwima uchanyha yawo. Weye imisi kowalongolela muna diwingu dilingile fana mhanda, na ichilo kowalongolela muna umoto ulingile fana mhanda. <verse eid="NUM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 14:15" />Lelo one uhawakoma wanhu wano wose mwanza umwe, wanhu wa zisi zimwenga wahulike mbuli izo wezalonga, <verse eid="NUM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 14:16" />‘Mndewa Mulungu kapotigwa kuwagala wanhu wano muna iisi iyawalaganile kuweng'ha, ivo kawakoma kuichuwala.’ <verse eid="NUM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 14:17" />Nopula udahi wako weye Mndewa Mulungu uwe mkulu ng'hani fana viuchilaganile viulongile, <verse eid="NUM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 14:18" />‘Mndewa Mulungu kabule ludoko lwa hima hima na kamema ulondo wa kufunya umoyo na kolekelela ubananzi na uhasanyi. Mbali hezaleka kuwatagusa wana na wazukulu wa nyelesi yetatu na yekane kwa ubananzi wa tati zawo.’ <verse eid="NUM 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 14:19" />Nokulamba uwalekelele wanhu wano kwa kusondelela ulondo wako wa kufunya umoyo, fana viuwalekelele wanhu wano kwandusila viwalawile muna iisi ya Misili mbaka sambi.”<verse eid="NUM 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 14:20" />Mndewa Mulungu kamwidika, “Niwalekelela fana viupulile. <verse eid="NUM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 14:21" />Mbali fana vonili mgima na fana isi yose voimema utunhizo wangu, <verse eid="NUM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 14:22" />habule hata imwe yawonile utunhizo wangu na mauzauza yangu yonitendile Misili na kuchuwala maabaho kaiyoha kunigeza miyanza iyo yose bila kutegeleza dizi jangu, <verse eid="NUM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 14:23" />yondayawone isi yoniwalaganile tati zawo. Chila munhu yanizehile hezaiwona. <verse eid="NUM 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 14:24" />Mbali msang'hani wangu Kalebu kavingi, kanisondelela kwa moyo wose, nizamgala muna iisi iyahitile, na welesi wake wezaisola isi iyo. <verse eid="NUM 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 14:25" />Kwaviya Waamaleki na Wakanaani wokala muna dikolongo ijo, igolo hindukeni muhite kuchuwala kwa kufosela nzila yoihita Bahali ya Shamu.”<verse eid="NUM 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 14:26" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kawauza Musa na Haluni, <verse eid="NUM 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 14:27" />“Nizakala na mting'hano uno ulongelela mbaka zuwaki? Nilegela kuhulika kulongelela kwawo. <verse eid="NUM 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 14:28" />Walongeleni, ‘Noilaha fana vonili mgima, Nizamtendelani fana vimunilongele. <verse eid="NUM 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 14:29" />Mwizadanganika na mitufi yenu izakwasigwa muna ichuwala chino. Kwaviya mulongelela kumwangu, habule hata munhu imwe yapetigwe yeli na miyaka malongo maidi na kugendelela vimwili yondayengile muna iisi ija. <verse eid="NUM 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 14:30" />Niilaha kuwa nizamulekani mukale muna iisi iyo, mbali habule munhu yondayafike, ila Kalebu mwana wa Yefune na Yoshua mwana wa Nuni. <verse eid="NUM 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 14:31" />Mbali wanenu, womulongile kuwa wezakuwa mateka, nizawagala muna iisi iyo, nawo wezaimanya isi yomuilemile. <verse eid="NUM 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 14:32" />Mbali mweye mwizadanganikila muna ichuwala chino. <verse eid="NUM 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 14:33" />Wanenu wezakuwa wadimi muna ichuwala kwa miyaka malongo mane na wezagaya kwa ichimu cha kuleka kwaminika kwenu, chila imwe wenu kezadanganika kuchuwala. <verse eid="NUM 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 14:34" />Kwa peta ya siku zimpelembe isi, siku malongo mane, chila siku yopetigwa kuwa mwaka. Kwa ichimu cha uhasanyi wenu, mwizagaya kwa miyaka malongo mane na mwizavimanya kuwa nihilwa. <verse eid="NUM 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 14:35" />Niye Mndewa Mulungu nilonga. Kweli nizawatendela vino wanhu wano wehile wowaiduganye kwa kunilema, wezadanganika muna ichuwala chino.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 14:36" />Ivo wanhu waja Musa woyawatumile wakaipelembe isi ija, wowabwelile na kuwatenda wanhu wose walongelele kwa kugala mbuli zihile za isi iyo, <verse eid="NUM 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 14:37" />wadanganika kwa kugaliligwa hulo na Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 14:38" />Mbali Yoshua mwana wa Nuni na Kalebu mwana wa Yefune hawadanganike bule mwa waja wowahitile kuipelemba isi.<verse eid="NUM 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kugeza kuisola isi kwa mwanduso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 1:41-46">Kumbukumbu 1:41-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 14:39" />Musa kawalongela Waisilaili wose mbuli zino, nawo walila kwa usungu ng'hani. <verse eid="NUM 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 14:40" />Igolo yake imitotondo ng'hani walamka na wakwela kuna inhembeti ya isi ya mulima. Walonga, “Chitogola chitenda uhasanyi mbali chahano chohita hanhu haja Mndewa Mulungu hoyachilaganile.”<verse eid="NUM 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 14:41" />Mbali Musa kalonga, “Habali hamuzindilila malagilizo ya Mndewa Mulungu? Mbuli iyo haizadahika! <verse eid="NUM 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 14:42" />Sekemukwele kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu heli hamwe na mweye. Mwizahumigwa na wehi wenu. <verse eid="NUM 14:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 14:43" />Mana Waamaleki na Wakanaani wakuulongozi wenu. Mwizadanganika kwa upanga kwaviya hamumsondele Mndewa Mulungu, ivo hezakuwa hamwe na mweye.”<verse eid="NUM 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 14:44" />Mbali wageza kukwela kuinhembeti ya isi ya mulima, ingawa sanduku da lagano da Mndewa Mulungu hadilawile muna dilago hebu Musa halawile. <verse eid="NUM 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 14:45" />Maabaho Waamaleki na Wakanaani wowakalile kuna iisi ya mulima, wahulumuka na kuwatowa. Wawawinga mbaka wafika Holima.<verse eid="NUM 14:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="NUM 15" />
  <para style="s">Malagilizo kusonhela nhambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 15:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 15:2" />“Walongele Waisilaili, ‘Vondamufike muna iisi yondanimwing'heni mondamukale, <verse eid="NUM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 15:3" />muhanilavila niye Mndewa Mulungu nhambiko kulawa muna iwang'ombe wenu hebu ng'hondolo wenu, nhambiko ya kutimbula hebu nhambiko kwa moto, muladi kufikiza chilaho, hebu iwe nhambiko ya kulonda wenyewo, hebu muna zinhambiko za madugila yenu yapangigwe, muladi kumtendela Mndewa Mulungu mnung'ho unogile. <verse eid="NUM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 15:4" />Munhu yondayalave nhambiko yake, kolondeka yamulavile Mndewa Mulungu nhosa ya usage chilo imwe ya usage unogile uhanganyigwe na lita imwe ya mavuta. <verse eid="NUM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 15:5" />Sasala lita imwe ya divai fana nhosa ya ching'waji kwa ichimu cha chila mwanang'hondolo wa nhambiko ya kutimbula hebu nhambiko imwenga.<verse eid="NUM 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 15:6" />“ ‘Hebu kwa ichimu cha bebelu da ng'hondolo, kwizasasala nhosa ya usage chilo mbili uhanganyigwe na lita imwe na nusu ya mavuta zizalavigwa fana nhosa ya mhule, <verse eid="NUM 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 15:7" />kwa nhosa ya ching'waji kwizalava lita imwe na nusu ya divai, kuwa mnung'ho wa kumnogeza Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="NUM 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 15:8" />“ ‘Vondamusasale ng'ombe lume kwa nhambiko ya kutimbula hebu nhambiko imwenga kwa ichimu cha kufikiza chilaho hebu kwa nhambiko za kugala tindiwalo kwa Mndewa Mulungu, <verse eid="NUM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 15:9" />hamwe na ng'ombe lume munhu iyo kezalava nhosa ya usage chilo nhatu wouhanganyigwe na lita mbili za mavuta. <verse eid="NUM 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 15:10" />Kaidi kwizagala lita mbili za divai kwa nhambiko ya ching'waji yoilavigwe. Nhambiko yose ina mnung'ho wa kumnogeza Mndewa Mulungu kwa moto.<verse eid="NUM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 15:11" />“ ‘Kwizatenda fana vino kwa chila ng'ombe lume hebu bebelu da ng'hondolo hebu mwanang'hondolo hebu mwana luti. <verse eid="NUM 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 15:12" />Fana viili peta ya wanyama wondamuwasasale, niivo vondamumtendele chila mnyama.<verse eid="NUM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 15:13" />“ ‘Wanhu wose welekigwe Isilaili wolondeka watende yayo yose kwa kusondelela simwe ijo, kulava nhambiko kwa moto, ili na mnung'ho unogile wa kumnogeza Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 15:14" />One nyambenyambe yahakala kumwenu, hebu munhu yoyose yeli hagati yenu yahalonda kulava nhambiko kwa moto ili na mnung'ho unogile wa kumnogeza Mndewa Mulungu fana imutenda mweye, nayo kezatenda ivo ivo.<verse eid="NUM 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 15:15" />“ ‘Muna umting'hano kwizakuwa na lagilizo dimwe kumwenu mweye na kwa nyambenyambe yokala hamwe na mweye, ni lagilizo da siku zose muna zinyelesi zenu, fana mweye vimuli na nyambenyambe kezakuwa ivo ivo haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 15:16" />Mweye na nyambenyambe yokala hamwe na mweye mwizakuwa na lagilizo dimwe na ndagilizi imwe.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 15:17" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 15:18" />“Walongele Waisilaili, ‘Vondamwingile muna iisi yoniwagalani, <verse eid="NUM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 15:19" />na vondamuje ndiya ya isi, mwizamgalila Mndewa Mulungu nhambiko. <verse eid="NUM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 15:20" />Vondamoke magate ya mwanduso ya usage wa mhule zenu za mwanduso, wizalavigwa fana mhule ya hanhu ha kuhwagila mhule. <verse eid="NUM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 15:21" />Usage wenu wa mwanduso mwizamwing'ha Mndewa Mulungu nhosa muna zinyelesi zenu.<verse eid="NUM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 15:22" />“ ‘Mbali one muhabananga bila kuilunga na kuleka kuzindilila malagilizo yayo yose niye Mndewa Mulungu yonimwing'hile Musa, <verse eid="NUM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 15:23" />yayo yose Mndewa Mulungu yoyamulagilizeni kufosela Musa, kwandusila siku ija Mndewa Mulungu iyalavile malagilizo mbaka muna zinyelesi zenu, <verse eid="NUM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 15:24" />baho izakuwa fana ni ubananzi woutendigwe bila kuilunga, hebu mting'hano hawavimanyile, baho mting'hano wose wezagala ng'ombe lume kuwa nhambiko ya kutimbula ili na mnung'ho wa kumnogeza Mndewa Mulungu, hamwe na nhosa yake ya usage na nhosa yake ya ching'waji, fana lagilizo vidili, na bebelu da luti kuwa nhambiko ya uhasanyi. <verse eid="NUM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 15:25" />Mkulu wa nhambiko kezatenda kuilumba kwa ichimu cha mting'hano wose wa Waisilaili, nawo wezalekelelwa kwaviya uhasanyi utendigwa bila kuilunga, nawo wagala nhambiko zawo wamala, nhambiko kwa moto kwa Mndewa Mulungu na nhambiko zawo za uhasanyi haulongozi ha Mndewa Mulungu kwa ichimu cha ubananzi wawo. <verse eid="NUM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 15:26" />Waisilaili wose na nyambenyambe wokala kumwawo wezalekelelwa, kwaviya wanhu wose watenda mbuli iyo bila kuilunga.<verse eid="NUM 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 15:27" />“ ‘Mbali one munhu yahatenda uhasanyi bila kuilunga, kezagala luti zike dili na mwaka umwe kuwa nhambiko ya uhasanyi. <verse eid="NUM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 15:28" />Mkulu wa nhambiko kezatenda kuilumba haulongozi ha Mndewa Mulungu kwa ichimu cha munhu yatendile uhasanyi, vondayatende uhasanyi bila kuilunga haulongozi ha Mndewa Mulungu, muladi kumtendela kuilumba, nayo kezalekelelwa. <verse eid="NUM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 15:29" />Mwizakuwa na lagilizo dimwe kwa munhu yotenda mbuli bila kuilunga, yawe mkaya hebu nyambenyambe yokala kumwenu.<verse eid="NUM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 15:30" />“ ‘Mbali munhu yotenda uhasanyi giladi, iyo komuliga Mndewa Mulungu, yawe mkaya hebu nyambenyambe. Munhu iyo kezabaguligwa mwa wanhu wake. <verse eid="NUM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 15:31" />Kwaviya kaizeha mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu na kabena malagilizo yake, munhu iyo kolondeka yabaguligwe mwa wanhu wake, nayo kezatagusigwa kwa uhasanyi wake.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhaguso kwa kuitenda Siku ya Mhumulo yambule mwiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 15:32" />Waisilaili viwawile kuichuwala, wamuwona munhu imwe kodondola ngodi Siku ya Mhumulo. <verse eid="NUM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 15:33" />Vowamuwone kodondola ngodi wamgala kwa Musa na Haluni na mting'hano wose. <verse eid="NUM 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 15:34" />Nawo wamkaliza kwaviya hawavimanyile wamtende choni. <verse eid="NUM 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 15:35" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Munhu iyo kolondeka yakomigwe. Mting'hano wose wolondeka wamtowe na mabwe kunze ya lago.” <verse eid="NUM 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 15:36" />Ivo wanhu wose wamulava kunze ya lago, maabaho wamtowa na mabwe mbaka kadanganika, fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahambo muna iviwalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 15:37" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 15:38" />“Walongele Waisilaili kuwa waitendele mahambo muna zimhembe za mawalo yawo, muna zinyelesi zose, chila hambo da chila mhembe udigume nyuzi za langi ya buluu. <verse eid="NUM 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 15:39" />Mahambo yayo yezakuwa kumbukumbu kumwenu. Chila muhaviwona, mwizakumbuka malagilizo yangu yose na kuyazindilila, muladi sekemutende vimulonda kwa kusondelela meso yenu hebu mizoyo yenu, yoimulongozani kutenda uhasanyi. <verse eid="NUM 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 15:40" />Mahambo yano yezamkumbusani kuzindilila malagilizo yangu yose na mwizakuwa welile kumwangu niye Mulungu wenu. <verse eid="NUM 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 15:41" />Niye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wenu, yonimulavileni muna iisi ya Misili muladi niwe Mulungu wenu. Niye niiyo Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wenu.”<verse eid="NUM 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="NUM 16" />
  <para style="s">Kola na Dosani na Abilamu wolema kulangulizigwa na Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 16:1" />Kola mwana wa Ishali, mwana wa Kohasi, mwana wa Lawi, kasola wanhu, hamwe na wanhu watatu wa kabila da Lubeni, watatu wawo wakala Dasani na Abilamu wana wa Eliabu na Oni mwana wa Pelesi, <verse eid="NUM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 16:2" />wawo wose hamwe na Waisilaili wamwenga, wanhu magana maidi na malongo matano, walangulizi wakulu wowasaguligwe na wanhu, weli na nhogolwa, wenuka haulongozi wa Musa kwa ichimu cha kumulema. <verse eid="NUM 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 16:3" />Waiting'hana haulongozi wa Musa na Haluni na wawalongela, “Mweye muiyoha! Mting'hano wose wela, chila munhu kela na Mndewa Mulungu kahamwe na cheye wose. Mbona mweye moitenda wakulu wa wanhu wa Mndewa Mulungu?”<verse eid="NUM 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 16:4" />Musa viyahulike ivo, kaibwanha chingubingubi. <verse eid="NUM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 16:5" />Maabaho kamulongela Kola na bumbila jake, “Igolo imitondo Mndewa Mulungu kezalagusa welihi weli wake na welihi welile, na yelihi yondayamkwenhukile, mana yondayamsagule niiyo yondayamkwenhuse kumwake. <verse eid="NUM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 16:6" />Weye Kola na bumbila jako jose molondeka mutende vino. Soleni vetezo, <verse eid="NUM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 16:7" />igolo muvigume moto na ubani, maabaho muvigale haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu. Munhu yosaguligwa na Mndewa Mulungu kokuwa kela. Mweye Walawi yofaya!”<verse eid="NUM 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 16:8" />Musa kamulongela Kola, “Tegelezeni mweye wana wa Lawi! <verse eid="NUM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 16:9" />Vino mugesa kuwa mbuli ndodo kumwenu kuwa Mndewa Mulungu kambagulani mweye mwa Waisilaili wose muladi mumkwenhukile habehi na musang'hane hana dihema da Mulungu da Mndewa Mulungu na kwima haulongozi wa wanhu wose muladi kuwasang'hanila? <verse eid="NUM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 16:10" />Kamtendani mweye hamwe na Walawi wamwenga wose muwe habehi nayo. Lelo molonda kusola hata sang'hano ya wakulu wa nhambiko? <verse eid="NUM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 16:11" />Ivo weye na bumbila jako jose mumulema Mndewa Mulungu. Mweye mumulongelela Haluni, mbali ukweli momulongelela Mulungu.”<verse eid="NUM 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 16:12" />Maabaho Musa kalagiliza wakatangigwe Dasani na Abilamu, wana wa Eliabu, mbali wawo walonga, “Cheye hachizakwiza. <verse eid="NUM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 16:13" />Vino ni mbuli ndodo weye kuchigala kulawa Misili, isi ili na ulongo unogile muladi uchikomele kuichuwala? Iviya koitunhiza weye mwenyewo muladi uwe mkulu wetu? <verse eid="NUM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 16:14" />Huchigalile muna iisi ili na ulongo unogile, hebu huching'hile uhazi wa migunda, na migunda ya mizabibu, vino kolonda kuwatula yameso wanhu wano na kuwavwizila? Cheye hachizakwiza!”<verse eid="NUM 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 16:15" />Maabaho Musa kapata ludoko na kamulongela Mndewa Mulungu, “Sekeutogole nhambiko zawo. Niye sisolile hata chihongwe imwe kumwawo, hebu simulumize hata munhu imwe viweli.”<verse eid="NUM 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 16:16" />Musa kamulongela Kola, “Weye na bumbila jako jose, igolo mwize hano haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu, weye na wawo na Haluni. <verse eid="NUM 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 16:17" />Chila munhu muna dibumbila jake yasole chetezo chake na kuchiguma ubani, mugale vetezo magana maidi na malongo matano haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu. Iviya weye na Haluni muwe na vetezo.” <verse eid="NUM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 16:18" />Ivo chila munhu kasola chetezo chake na kachiguma moto na ubani, na kwima na Musa na Haluni hana ihanhu ha kwingilila muna dihema da Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 16:19" />Kola viyawaduganye Waisilaili wose muladi kuwalema Musa na Haluni hana ihanhu ha kwingilila muna dihema da Mulungu, utunhizo wa Mndewa Mulungu uwalawilila wanhu wose. <verse eid="NUM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 16:20" />Mndewa Mulungu kawalongela Musa na Haluni, <verse eid="NUM 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 16:21" />“Muibagule mwa wanhu wano, muladi niwadanganize sambi.”<verse eid="NUM 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 16:22" />Mbali Musa na Haluni waibwanha chingubingubi na walila, “Weye Mulungu, Mulungu uweng'hile ugima wanhu wose, vino munhu imwe yahabananga kowehila wanhu wose?”<verse eid="NUM 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 16:23" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 16:24" />“Walongele wanhu wasegele hana yamahema ya Kola na Dasani na Abilamu.”<verse eid="NUM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 16:25" />Musa kenuka na kahita kwa Dasani na Abilamu, walala wa Isilaili wamsondelela. <verse eid="NUM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 16:26" />Kawalongela wanhu wose, “Segeleni hana yamahema ya wanhu wano wehile! Sekemudalise chinhu chawo chochose, buleivo mwizadanganizigwa, mana wawo wose watenda uhasanyi.” <verse eid="NUM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 16:27" />Ivo wasegela hana yamahema ya Kola na Dasani na Abilamu. Dasani na Abilamu walawa kunze, wema hana ihanhu ha kwingilila muna yamahema yawo, hamwe na wake zawo na wana wawo wose mbaka wana wokong'ha.<verse eid="NUM 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 16:28" />Maabaho Musa kalonga, “Kwa mbuli ino mwizavimanya kuwa Mndewa Mulungu kanituma nitende mbuli zino zose, kuwa sitendelile kwa magesa yangu. <verse eid="NUM 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 16:29" />One wanhu wano wahadanganika fana viwodanganika wanhu wose bila kugazigwa na Mndewa Mulungu, baho Mndewa Mulungu hanitumile.<verse eid="NUM 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 16:30" />“Mbali one Mndewa Mulungu kalumba chinhu cha sambi na isi iyo igubuka na kuwamela hamwe na wose wowakalile nawo, nayo iwamela wang'hali wagima nawo wezahita kuzimu. Baho mwizavimanya kuwa wanhu wano wamzeha Mndewa Mulungu.”<verse eid="NUM 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 16:31" />Bahaja viyakomeleze kulonga mbuli izo zose, isi iyakalile Dasani na Abilamu igubuka. <verse eid="NUM 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 16:32" />Iwamela wanhu wawo na kaye zawo, hamwe na bumbila jose da Kola na vinhu vawo vose. <verse eid="NUM 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 16:33" />Ivo wawo na vinhu vawo vose wagidimila kuzimu. Isi iwagubika, wose wadanganika. <verse eid="NUM 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 16:34" />Waisilaili wamwenga wowakalile habehi viwahulike kuguta kwawo, wakimbila na walonga, “Chikimbile, isi yodaha kuchimela na cheye iviya!”<verse eid="NUM 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 16:35" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kagala moto na uwalunguza wanhu magana maidi na malongo matano wowafukize ubani.<verse eid="NUM 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 16:36" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 16:37" />“Mulongele Eleazali mwana wa mkulu wa nhambiko Haluni yakasegeze vetezo hana umoto, mana vetezo ivo vela. <verse eid="NUM 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 16:38" />Vela kwaviya wanhu wano wavigala hana ulupango lwa Mndewa Mulungu. Ivo visole vetezo va wanhu wawo wowakomigwe kwa ichimu cha uhasanyi wawo, vovihondigwe kuwa visisili muladi viwe ngubiko ya lupango. Dino dizakuwa lamulo kwa Waisilaili wose.”<verse eid="NUM 16:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 16:39" />Ivo Eleazali mkulu wa nhambiko kasola vetezo va shaba vovigaligwe na wanhu waja, vihondigwa kuwa ngubiko ya lupango. <verse eid="NUM 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 16:40" />Dino diwe kumbukumbu kwa Waisilaili kuwa munhu yoyose yeli siyo mkulu wa nhambiko, yani yeli siyo wa welesi wa Haluni, sekeyahite hana ulupango kumfukizila ubani Mndewa Mulungu. Buleivo kezadanganizigwa fana Kola na bumbila jake. Yano yose yatendeka fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize Eleazali kufosela Musa.<verse eid="NUM 16:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Haluni kowakombola wanhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 16:41" />Igolo yake Waisilaili wose wawalongelela Musa na Haluni. Walonga, “Muwakoma wanhu wa Mndewa Mulungu.”<verse eid="NUM 16:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 16:42" />Mbali mting'hano wose viwaiting'hane haulongozi wa Musa na Haluni muladi kulongelela, wahinduka kulola dihema da Mulungu, wawona wingu digubika hema da Mulungu na utunhizo wa Mndewa Mulungu ulawilila hanhu baho. <verse eid="NUM 16:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 16:43" />Musa na Haluni wahita kwima haulongozi wa hema da Mulungu, <verse eid="NUM 16:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 16:44" />na Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 16:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 16:45" />“Segeleni kwa wanhu wano, muladi niwadanganize sambi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 16:45">Mbali wawo waibwanha chingubingubi. <verse eid="NUM 16:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 16:46" />Musa kamulongela Haluni, “Sola chetezo chako uchigume moto woulawa hana ulupango, maabaho uchigume ubani uhite nacho kwa wanhu himahima ukawatendele kuilumba. Ludoko lwa Mndewa Mulungu luwafikila na hulo jandusa kuwapata.” <verse eid="NUM 16:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 16:47" />Haluni katenda fana Musa viyamulagilize. Kasola chetezo chake na kakimbila mbaka hagati ya wanhu wowaiduganye hamwe. Viyawone hulo jandusa, kaguma ubani muna ichetezo na kuwatendela wanhu kuilumba. <verse eid="NUM 16:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 16:48" />Viyatendile ivo, hulo ijo dileka, nayo kasigala hagati ya wanhu wadanganike na weli wagima. <verse eid="NUM 16:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 16:49" />Peta ya wanhu wowadanganike kwa hulo ijo wakala 14,700, bila kuwapeta waja wowadanganike kwa ichimu cha kuleka kwaminika kwa Kola. <verse eid="NUM 16:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 16:50" />Hulo vidikomelezeke, Haluni kabwela kwa Musa hana ihanhu ha kwingilila muna dihema da Mulungu.<verse eid="NUM 16:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="NUM 17" />
  <para style="s">Fimbo ya Haluni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 17:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 17:2" />“Walongele Waisilaili wakugalile fimbo longo na mbili, chila mulangulizi wa chila kabila fimbo imwe. Yandika zina da chila mulangulizi muna ifimbo yake, <verse eid="NUM 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 17:3" />na zina da Haluni jandikigwe muna ifimbo ya kabila da Lawi. Kwizakuwa na fimbo imwe kwa chila mulangulizi wa kabila. <verse eid="NUM 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 17:4" />Zigale fimbo izo hana dihema da Mulungu na kuzika haulongozi wa sanduku da lagano, hanhu honiiting'hana na weye. <verse eid="NUM 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 17:5" />Fimbo ya munhu yondanimsagule izasuka. Kwa kutenda vino nizawatenda Waisilaili waleke kumulongelelani.”<verse eid="NUM 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 17:6" />Ivo Musa kawalongela Waisilaili na walangulizi wawo wamwing'he fimbo, chila mulangulizi fimbo imwe kwa kusondelela makabila yawo. Zose zikala fimbo longo na mbili, fimbo ya Haluni ikala hamwe na fimbo izo. <verse eid="NUM 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 17:7" />Musa kazika fimbo izo haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu hana dihema da Mulungu.<verse eid="NUM 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 17:8" />Igolo yake Musa kengila muna dihema da Mulungu. Umo kaifika fimbo ya Haluni wa kabila da Lawi, isuka na kulava maluwa na kwima matunda yevile ya alimondi. <verse eid="NUM 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 17:9" />Maabaho Musa kazilava kunze zifimbo zikalile haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu na kawalagusila Waisilaili wose, nawo wawona chiya chilawilile. Chila mulangulizi kasola fimbo yake.<verse eid="NUM 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 17:10" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Bweleza fimbo ya Haluni haulongozi wa sanduku da lagano. Iyo izakwikigwa goya hanhu baho muladi iwe lamulo kwa Waisilaili wowomulema Musa, one hawalekile kunilongelelela wezadanganika.” <verse eid="NUM 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 17:11" />Musa katenda fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize.<verse eid="NUM 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 17:12" />Waisilaili wamulongela Musa, “Chizadanganika! Chikomelezeka! Chikomelezeka! <verse eid="NUM 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 17:13" />Munhu yoyose yondayakwenhuke habehi ya hanhu hema da Mulungu kezadanganika. Vino chizadanganika chose?”<verse eid="NUM 17:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="NUM 18" />
  <para style="s">Sang'hano za wakulu wa nhambiko na Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 18:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Haluni, “Ubananzi wose kusonhela hema da Mulungu, wizakuwa kumwako na wanago na lukolo lwako. Iviya ubananzi wa sang'hano yenu ya ukulu wa nhambiko mwizausola weye na wanago. <verse eid="NUM 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 18:2" />Na ndugu zako nawo, kabila da Lawi, kabila ya tati yako, uwagale habehi hamwe na weye, muladi wailumbe na weye na kukusang'hanila, mbali weye na wanago mwizakuwa haulongozi wa hema da Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 18:3" />Wawo wezasang'hana sang'hano zondauweng'he kusonhela hema, mbali hawalondeka kuvikwenhukila via va hema hebu kulukwenhukila ulupango, buleivo wezadanganika wawo na weye iviya. <verse eid="NUM 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 18:4" />Nawo wezailumba na weye na wezasang'hana sang'hano zose za muna dihema da Mulungu, habule munhu imwenga yoyose yondayakukwenhukile. <verse eid="NUM 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 18:5" />Mweye mwizasang'hana sang'hano muna dihema da Mulungu na lupango, muladi sekeniwawonele ludoko kaidi Waisilaili. <verse eid="NUM 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 18:6" />Niye niwasagula ndugu zenu Walawi mwa Waisilaili, kumwenu mweye wanhu wawo ni chitumetume choching'higwe na Mndewa Mulungu, muladi wasang'hanile sang'hano ya hema da Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 18:7" />Weye na wanago muhala mwizatenda sang'hano ya ukulu wa nhambiko, kwa ichimu cha lupango na chila chinhu chili kuchisogo ya panzia, iyo ni sang'hano yenu. Nomwing'hani chitumetume cha ukulu wa nhambiko. Munhu imwenga yoyose yondayavikwenhukile via va hema da Mulungu kezakomigwa.”<verse eid="NUM 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yombe da wakulu wa nhambiko na Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 18:8" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Haluni, “Lola nikwing'ha nhambiko zowaning'hile Waisilaili, vinhu velile vose vowaning'hile. Vinhu vose Waisilaili vowavikile kwa sang'hano yelile nokwing'ha weye na welesi wako, navo vizakuwa venu siku zose. <verse eid="NUM 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 18:9" />Vinhu vino vizakuwa vako muna ivinhu velile ng'hani, vili havitimbuligwa kwa moto, vino vizakuwa venu, nhosa za usage na nhambiko za uhasanyi na nhambiko za ubananzi. Chila chinhu chondawanilavile wanhu, chizakuwa chako weye na wanago. <verse eid="NUM 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 18:10" />Mwizakuja vinhu ivo fana vinhu velile ng'hani, chila mulume kodaha kuja kwaviya vela kumwenu.<verse eid="NUM 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 18:11" />“Vinhu vino iviya ni venu, nhosa ya vitumetume vawo, nhambiko zose za Waisilaili za kwinuligwa uchanyha kwa chilaguso, nikwing'ha weye na wanago wa chilume na wa chike, vizakuwa venu siku zose. Munhu yoyose muna ikaye yako yeli hambule mwiko kodaha kuja vinhu ivo.<verse eid="NUM 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 18:12" />“Nokwing'ha vinhu vose vinogile va mwanduso kugobola va Waisilaeli vowonilavila niye Mndewa Mulungu, mavuta yanogile na divai na mhule. <verse eid="NUM 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 18:13" />Matunda yose yevile ya vinhu va mwanduso muna imigunda yawo wezanigalila niye, yezakuwa yako. Chila munhu muna ulukolo lwako yeli hambule mwiko kodaha kuja.<verse eid="NUM 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 18:14" />“Chila chinhu chochikigwe hakwe kwa ichimu cha Mndewa Mulungu muna iisi ya Isilaili chizakuwa chenu.<verse eid="NUM 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 18:15" />“Chila mwana wa udele yondawanilavile Waisilaili, yawe wa munhu hebu mnyama, kezakuwa wako. Mbali kolondeka uwakombole wana wa udele wose wa wanhu, na chila mwana wa udele wa mnyama yambule mwiko kolondeka yakomboligwe. <verse eid="NUM 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 18:16" />Waudele wawo wezakomboligwa weli na mwezi umwe kwa kuliha shekeli tano ya hela, kuilinga na ningo za hema da Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 18:17" />Mbali chila mwana wa udele wa ng'ombe hebu ng'hondolo hebu luti sekewakomboligwe kwaviya wawo wela. Kwizalumizila ulupango damu zawo, mavuta yawo kwizayatimbula kuwa nhambiko yoilavigwa kwa moto ili mnung'ho unogile wa kumnogeza Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 18:18" />Modaha kuja nyama zawo, fana viya vimudaha kuja chidali chochinuligwe uchanyha kwa chilaguso na chima cha kulume.<verse eid="NUM 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 18:19" />“Vinhu vose Waisilaili vowonigalile niye Mndewa Mulungu, nokwing'ha weye na wanago wa chilume na wa chike. Dino ni lagano da siku zose na hadizabenigwa haulongozi wangu dili kwa ichimu chako na welesi wako.”<verse eid="NUM 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 18:20" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Haluni, “Weye kwizakuwa kwabule uhazi wowose muna iisi yawo, hebu kwizakuwa kwabule hanhu hohose kumwawo. Niye niiyo hanhu hako na uhazi wako mwa Waisilaili.<verse eid="NUM 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 18:21" />“Walawi niweng'ha zaka zose zowonigalila Waisilaili kuwa uhazi. Yano yezakuwa maliho yawo kwa sang'hano iwoitenda ya kukaliza hema da Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 18:22" />Kwandusila sambi Waisilaili sekewadikwenhukile hema da Mulungu, buleivo wezatagusigwa kwa uhasanyi wawo na kuigalila ifa. <verse eid="NUM 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 18:23" />Mbali Walawi muhala wezasang'hanila muna dihema da Mulungu, nawo wezausola wihi wake, dino dizakuwa lagilizo da siku zose muna zinyelesi zose, hawezakuwa na uhazi hagati ya Waisilaili. <verse eid="NUM 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 18:24" />Kwaviya zaka zowonilavila Waisilaili niweng'ha Walawi kuwa uhazi wawo. Lekamana nilonga kuwa wawo hawezakuwa na uhazi mwa Waisilaili.”<verse eid="NUM 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zaka ya Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 18:25" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 18:26" />“Walongele Walawi ndagilizi zino, ‘Vondamuhokele zaka yomwing'higwe na Mndewa Mulungu kulawa kwa Waisilaili iwe uhazi wenu, mwizanilavila niye Mndewa Mulungu hanhu hamwe ha longo ha zaka iyo. <verse eid="NUM 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 18:27" />Nhosa yenu ino izatogoleka kuwa fana mhule zenu za mwanduso hebu fana zabibu ziyonilavila mulimi. <verse eid="NUM 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 18:28" />Ivo niivo vondamunilavile niye Mndewa Mulungu zaka zondamuhokele kulawa kwa Waisilaili. Zaka iyo yondamunilavile niye Mndewa Mulungu mwizamwing'ha mkulu wa nhambiko Haluni. <verse eid="NUM 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 18:29" />Kwa zaka zose zondamuhokele, mwizamgalila Mndewa Mulungu hanhu hanogile kufosa zose.’ <verse eid="NUM 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 18:30" />Kwa ivo kwizawalongela, ‘Muhakomeleza kulava hanhu hanogile kufosa zose, hanhu hasigale hezakuwa henu, fana viili kwa mulimi yosola chisigale viyakomeleze kulava nhosa zake za mhule na zabibu. <verse eid="NUM 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 18:31" />Na mweye mwizakuja chochilavigwe mwahawa hanhu hohose hamwe na ng'holo zenu, kwaviya ni chitumetume chenu kwa sang'hano yenu muna dihema da Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 18:32" />Muhaja vinhu ivo hamwizakuwa na uhasanyi wowose, one mumulavila Mndewa Mulungu hanhu hanogile kufosa zose. Sekemuvilige vinhu velile va Waisilaili muladi sekemudanganike.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 18:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="NUM 19" />
  <para style="s">Maivu ya ng'ombe mdung'hu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 19:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kawalongela Musa na Haluni, kalonga, <verse eid="NUM 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 19:2" />“Dino ni lagilizo doyalagilize Mndewa Mulungu. Walongele wanhu wa Isilaili wawagalileni ng'ombe muke mdung'hu yelibule chilema chochose na yang'hali kufungigwa nila <verse eid="NUM 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 19:3" />na mwizamwing'ha mkulu wa nhambiko Eleazali. Ng'ombe iyo kezagaligwa kunze ya lago na kuchinjigwa haulongozi hake. <verse eid="NUM 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 19:4" />Maabaho mkulu wa nhambiko Eleazali kezasola chiyasi cha damu na kuvabika chidole chake na kuimiza kusonhela ubanzi wa kuulongozi wa hema da Mulungu miyanza saba. <verse eid="NUM 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 19:5" />Ng'ombe wose kezasomigwa haulongozi wake, mbende yake na nyama yake na damu yake hamwe na mavi yake vose kezavisoma moto. <verse eid="NUM 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 19:6" />Maabaho mkulu wa nhambiko kezasola mbiki wa mwelezi na tambi da hisopo na sufu ndung'hu, kezaviguma muna umoto uwo. <verse eid="NUM 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 19:7" />Maabaho mkulu wa nhambiko kezafuwa mawalo yake na koga lukuli lwake kwa mazi, maabaho kodaha kwingila muna dilago mbali kezakuwa kambula mwiko mbaka ichigulogulo. <verse eid="NUM 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 19:8" />Munhu yondayamsome ng'ombe iyo, iviya kolondeka yafuwe mawalo yake na koga lukuli lwake kwa mazi, nayo iviya kezakuwa kambula mwiko mbaka ichigulogulo. <verse eid="NUM 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 19:9" />Munhu yaisafyile kezayazola maivu ya ng'ombe iyo na kuyagala hanhu hasafyigwe kunze ya lago, yezakwikigwa goya kwa ichimu cha Waisilaili wose, kuwa mazi ya kusegeza kwambula mwiko, muladi kusegeza uhasanyi. <verse eid="NUM 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 19:10" />Munhu yondayazole maivu ya ng'ombe iyo, kolondeka yafuwe viwalo vake, mbali kezakuwa kambula mwiko mbaka ichigulogulo. Mbuli ino izakuwa lagilizo da siku zose kwa wanhu wa Isilaili na nyambenyambe wondawakale hamwe nawo.<verse eid="NUM 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 19:11" />“Munhu yoyose yondayadalise mtufi wa munhu yoyose kezakwambula mwiko kwa siku saba. <verse eid="NUM 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 19:12" />Siku yetatu na yesaba, munhu iyo kezaisafya kwa mazi yaja ya kuisafya, nayo kosafyika. Mbali one yahaleka kuisafya muna isiku yetatu na yesaba, munhu iyo kezakuwa yang'hali kambula mwiko. <verse eid="NUM 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 19:13" />Munhu yoyose yondayadalise mtufi wa munhu, one haisafyile, koditenda hema da Mulungu jambule mwiko, nayo kezabaguligwa mwa wanhu wake Waisilaili. Munhu iyo kezasigala kambula mwiko kwaviya hamiziligwe mazi yaja ya kuisafya.<verse eid="NUM 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 19:14" />“Dino ni lagilizo da kuzindilila one munhu kodanganika muna dihema. Munhu yoyose yokwingila muna dihema na munhu yoyose yeli muna dihema, kezakuwa kambula mwiko kwa siku saba. <verse eid="NUM 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 19:15" />Na chila chia chili hachigubikigwe uchanyha yake, chizakuwa chambula mwiko. <verse eid="NUM 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 19:16" />Munhu yoyose yahadalisa mtufi wa munhu yoyakomigwe hebu yoyadanganike fana viimanyika kunze ya kaye, hebu yahadalisa vuha da munhu hebu leme, kezakuwa kambula mwiko kwa siku saba.<verse eid="NUM 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 19:17" />“Na kwa munhu iyo yambule mwiko wezasola maivu ya nhambiko ya uhasanyi yoisomigwe ya ng'ombe iyo, na mazi ya kuulwanda yezahanganyigwa na maivu muna ichia. <verse eid="NUM 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 19:18" />Maabaho munhu imwenga yeli hambule mwiko kezasola hisopo na kezadivabika muna yamazi yayo, maabaho kezamizila hema na via vose vili mgati yake na wanhu weli mgati. Iviya kezammizila munhu yoyadalise vuha da munhu hebu mtufi wa munhu yoyakomigwe hebu yoyadanganike ifa imanyika, hebu yoyadalise leme. <verse eid="NUM 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 19:19" />Munhu iyo kezammizila ija yambule mwiko muna isiku yetatu na yesaba. Siku yesaba kezamsafya, nayo kezafuwa mawalo yake na koga kwa mazi, ichigulogulo kezakuwa kela haulongozi wa Mulungu.<verse eid="NUM 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 19:20" />“Munhu yahambula mwiko na one haisafyile, munhu iyo kezalemigwa muna umting'hano, kwaviya kaditenda hema da Mulungu jambule mwiko. Kwaviya hamiziligwe mazi ya kuisafya, ivo kambula mwiko. <verse eid="NUM 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 19:21" />Wanhu wolondeka wazindilile lagilizo dino sambi na siku zikwiza. Munhu yomiza mazi ya kuisafya kezafuwa mawalo yake, na munhu yoyose yodalisa mazi yayo kezakuwa kambula mwiko mbaka ichigulogulo. <verse eid="NUM 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 19:22" />Chinhu chochose chondayadalise munhu yambule mwiko chizakuwa chambula mwiko, na munhu yoyose yondayachidalise chinhu icho kezakuwa kambula mwiko mbaka ichigulogulo.”<verse eid="NUM 19:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="NUM 20" />
  <para style="s">Mazi kulawa muna uluwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 17:1-7">Kulawa 17:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 20:1" />Muna umwezi wa mwanduso mting'hano wose wa Waisilaili wafika muna ichuwala cha Sini na wakala Kadeshi. Uko Miliamu kadanganika na kuwandigwa uko. <verse eid="NUM 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 20:2" />Hanhu baho hakala habule mazi kwa mting'hano wose, ivo wose waiting'hana kuwahinduka Musa na Haluni. <verse eid="NUM 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 20:3" />Waibishila na Musa, walonga, “Muhavu chihadanganike chipindi chiya ndugu zetu viwadanganike haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 20:4" />Habali muwagala mting'hano uno wa Mndewa Mulungu muna ichuwala chino muladi chidanganike, cheye na wanyama wetu? <verse eid="NUM 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 20:5" />Na habali muchilava Misili na kuchigala hanhu hano hehile? Hanhu hano habule mhule hebu nhini hebu zabibu hebu makomamanga hebu mazi ya kung'wa!”<verse eid="NUM 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 20:6" />Musa na Haluni wasegela hanhu haja hawakalile iwanhu na wahita kuna dihema da Mulungu. Waibwanha chingubingubi, baho utunhizo wa Mndewa Mulungu uwalawilila.<verse eid="NUM 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 20:7" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 20:8" />“Sola fimbo ukawaduganye wanhu, weye na sekulu wako Haluni hamwe na mting'hano. Ulongele luwe uja uli haulongozi yawo ulave mazi yake. Kwizayagala mazi yalawile muna uluwe kwa ichimu cha mting'hano, ivo wawo na wanyama wawo wodaha kung'wa.” <verse eid="NUM 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 20:9" />Musa kasola fimbo ija haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu, fana viya viyalagilizigwe.<verse eid="NUM 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 20:10" />Musa na Haluni wawaduganya wanhu wose hana uluwe. Musa kawalongela, “Tegelezeni mweye wehi! Vino chimulavileni mazi kulawa muna uluwe uno?” <verse eid="NUM 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 20:11" />Ivo Musa kenula mkono wake na kuutowa uluwe miyanza midi kwa fimbo yake. Mazi yalawa mengi. Wanhu hamwe na wanyama wawo wang'wa.<verse eid="NUM 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 20:12" />Mbali Mndewa Mulungu kawalongela Musa na Haluni, “Kwaviya hamunihuwile hebu hamuning'hile hishima haulongozi wa Waisilaili, basi kwa ichimu icho hamwizawengiza wanhu wano muna iisi yoniweng'hile.”<verse eid="NUM 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 20:13" />Yano ni mazi ya Meliba, hanhu haja Waisilaili howamulongelele Mndewa Mulungu, nayo kailagusa mwenyewo kuwa kela hagati yawo.<verse eid="NUM 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalume wa Edomu kowalemesa Waisilaili kufosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 20:14" />Musa kawatuma wasenga kulawa Kadeshi wahite kwa mfalume wa Edomu. Wakamulongele, “Ndugu zako Waisilaili wolonga, ‘Weye kuyamanya manhesa yose yochipatile. <verse eid="NUM 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 20:15" />Tati zetu viwahitile Misili, hanhu hawakalile kwa miyaka mingi. Wamisili wawagaza tati zetu na cheye iviya. <verse eid="NUM 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 20:16" />Chimulilila Mndewa Mulungu, nayo kachihulika. Kachigalila msenga wa kuulanga yoyachisegeze Misili. Sambi chahano Kadeshi, isi yoihakana na isi yako. <verse eid="NUM 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 20:17" />Chokulamba uchileke chifosele muna iisi yako. Hachizabojoga migunda yenu, hebu migunda ya mizabibu hebu hachizakung'wa mazi ya visima venu. Chizaisondelela nzila ng'hulu ya mfalume na kuhita dimwe kwa dimwe bila kuhinduka kulume hebu kumoso, mbaka vondachilawe muna iisi yako.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 20:18" />Mbali mfalume wa Edomu kamulongela, “Hamwizafosa muna iisi yangu, one muhafosa chizamulawilani na kumtowani na panga.”<verse eid="NUM 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 20:19" />Waisilaili wamulongela, “Chizafosela nzila ng'hulu, one cheye na wanyama wetu chihang'wa mazi yako chizakuliha. Chokulamba uchilekele chifose kwa magulu, hachilonda chinhu chimwenga chochose.”<verse eid="NUM 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 20:20" />Mfalume wa Edomu kawalongela, “Hamwizafosa muna iisi yangu.” Maabaho mfalume wa Edomu hamwe na wanhu wengi wahita kuitowa nawo.<verse eid="NUM 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 20:21" />Ivo mfalume wa Edomu kalema kuwalekela Waisilaili wafose muna zimhaka zake. Waisilaili wahinduka na kusondelela nzila imwenga.<verse eid="NUM 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ifa ya Haluni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 20:22" />Mting'hano wose wa Waisilaili wasegela Kadeshi na wafika kuna mulima wa Holi. <verse eid="NUM 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 20:23" />Mndewa Mulungu kawalongela Musa na Haluni kuna mulima wa Holi, kuna imhaka ya isi ya Edomu, <verse eid="NUM 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 20:24" />“Haluni kezadanganika na hezakwingila muna iisi yoniweng'hile Waisilaili, mana mweye waidi mudileka lagilizo jangu kuja Meliba. <verse eid="NUM 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 20:25" />Uwasole Haluni na Eleazali mwanage, uwagale uchanyha ya mulima wa Holi, <verse eid="NUM 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 20:26" />na umuhambule Haluni mawalo yake ya ukulu wa nhambiko na umuyawaze Eleazali mwanage. Haluni kezadanganika uko kuna mulima.” <verse eid="NUM 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 20:27" />Musa katenda fana viya Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize. Wakwela kuna mulima wa Holi haulongozi wa mting'hano wose. <verse eid="NUM 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 20:28" />Maabaho Musa kamuhambula Haluni mawalo ya ukulu wa nhambiko na kamuyawaza Eleazali. Haluni kadanganika kuja kuna inhembeti ya mulima. Maabaho Musa na Eleazali wahulumuka. <verse eid="NUM 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 20:29" />Mting'hano wose viwawonile kuwa Haluni kadanganika, kaye zose za Waisilaili wamulilila Haluni kwa siku malongo matatu.<verse eid="NUM 20:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="NUM 21" />
  <para style="s">Uhumi uko Holima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 21:1" />Mkanaani imwe mfalume wa Aladi, yoyakalile uko ubanzi wa kusi, viyahulike kuwa Waisilaili wokwiza kufosela nzila ya Asalimu, kahita kuwatowa na wamwenga kawasola. <verse eid="NUM 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 21:2" />Maabaho Waisilaili wamulahila Mndewa Mulungu, walonga, “One weye kwizawaguma wanhu wano muna imikono yetu, kweli cheye chizayananga ng'hani mabululu yawo.” <verse eid="NUM 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 21:3" />Mndewa Mulungu kadihulika dizi da Waisilaili, kawatenda wawahume Wakanaani. Waisilaili wawananga ng'hani hamwe na mabululu yawo na zina da hanhu haja hatangigwa Holima.<verse eid="NUM 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zoka da shaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 21:4" />Waisilaili wandusa mwanza kulawa mulima wa Holi, wafosela nzila yoihita bahali ya Shamu muladi waizunguluke isi ya Edomu. Mbali muna inzila wanhu wandusa kulegela. <verse eid="NUM 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 21:5" />Wanhu wamulongelelela Mulungu na Musa, walonga, “Habali muchilava muna iisi ya Misili muladi chidanganike muna ichuwala? Mana hano habule ndiya hebu mazi. Cheye chiting'hwa na ndiya ino ya chakachaka.” <verse eid="NUM 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 21:6" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kagala nyoka weli na sungu hagati ya wanhu, Waisilaili wengi walumigwa na wengi wadanganika. <verse eid="NUM 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 21:7" />Wanhu wahita kwa Musa na wamulongela, “Chitenda uhasanyi kwa kumulongelelela Mndewa Mulungu na weye iviya. Mpule Mndewa Mulungu yachisegezele nyoka wano.” Ivo Musa kawapulila wanhu.<verse eid="NUM 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 21:8" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Tenda nyoka wa shaba na umtumbike uchanyha ya mbiki, muladi chila yoyalumigwe yahamulola inyoka iyo, kezahona.” <verse eid="NUM 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 21:9" />Ivo Musa katenda nyoka wa shaba na kamtumbika uchanyha ya mbiki. Chila munhu yoyalumigwe na nyoka viyamulolile nyoka iyo wa shaba, kahona.<verse eid="NUM 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwanza wa kuhita kudikolongo da Wamoabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 21:10" />Waisilaili wagendelela na mwanza wawo na weka lago uko Obosi.<verse eid="NUM 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 21:11" />Maabaho walawa Obosi, wapanga Iye Abalimu, muna ichuwala, ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zuwa wa isi ya Moabu. <verse eid="NUM 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 21:12" />Viwasegele uko weka lago jawo muna dikolongo da Zeledi. <verse eid="NUM 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 21:13" />Kulawa uko wagendelela na umwanza na weka lago jawo ubanzi wa kasikazi wa lwanda lwa Alinoni, woukilima mazi kulawa muna iisi ya Waamoli na kufosela muna ichuwala. Lwanda ulo lukala mhaka hagati ya Wamoabu na Waamoli. <verse eid="NUM 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 21:14" />Ivo yandikigwa muna ichitabu cha ng'hondo za Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:14">“Wahebu muna iisi ya Sufa na makolongo ya Alinoni.<verse eid="NUM 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 21:15" />Na magidimilo ya makolongo yayo kugidimila bululu da Ali</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:15">na kuhita kuna imhaka ya Moabu.”<verse eid="NUM 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 21:16" />Kulawa uko Waisilaili wahita mbaka Beeli, icho ni chisima chiya Mndewa Mulungu hoyamulongele Musa, “Wating'hanize wanhu hamwe, nizaweng'ha mazi.” <verse eid="NUM 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 21:17" />Maabaho Waisilaili wemba wila uno.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:17">“Chisima weye lawa mazi! Chimbileni!<verse eid="NUM 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 21:18" />Chisima chowahimbile wakulu na walangulizi wa wanhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:18">Wakulu wa wanhu wachisikula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:18">kwa fimbo za chifalume na fimbo zawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:18">Kulawa chuwala chiya wahita Matana.”<verse eid="NUM 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 21:19" />Kulawa Matana wahita Nahalieli, na kulawa Nahalieli wahita Bamosi, <verse eid="NUM 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 21:20" />na kulawa Bamosi wahita kudibawe da Moabu, kuinhembeti ya mulima wa Pisiga, yoisonhela hasi kuchuwala.<verse eid="NUM 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sihoni na Ogu wohumigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 2:26-3:1">Kumbukumbu 2:26-3:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 21:21" />Maabaho Waisilaili wawatuma wasenga wahite kwa Sihoni mfalume wa Waamoli wakamulongele, <verse eid="NUM 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 21:22" />“Chitogolele chifose muna iisi yako. Hachizafosa mumgwazo na kwingila muna imigunda hebu muna imigunda ya mizabibu, hebu hachizakung'wa mazi ya visima venu, chizafosa dimwe kwa dimwe muna inzila ng'hulu ya mfalume mbaka vondachisegele muna iisi yako.” <verse eid="NUM 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 21:23" />Mbali Sihoni kalema Waisilaili sekewafose muna iisi yake. Kawaduganya hamwe wakalizi wake wose na kahita Yahasa kuichuwala kuwatowa Waisilaili. <verse eid="NUM 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 21:24" />Mbali Waisilaili wamkoma kwa panga na waisola isi yake, kwandusila lwanda lwa Alinoni mbaka lwanda lwa Yaboki, mbaka isi ya Waamoni, kwaviya mhaka ya Waamoni ikala yokalizigwa. <verse eid="NUM 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 21:25" />Waisilaili wayasola mabululu yose ya Waamoli, nawo wakala muna yamabululu yose ya Waamoli, hamwe na bululu da Heshiboni na vibululu vake. <verse eid="NUM 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 21:26" />Mana Heshiboni dikala bululu da Sihoni mfalume wa Waamoli, yoyaitowile na mfalume wa umwaka wa Moabu na kumuhoka isi yake yose, mbaka lwanda lwa Alinoni. <verse eid="NUM 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 21:27" />Lekamana wembaji wokwimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:27">“Izoni Heshiboni na kudizenga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:27">Bululu da Sihoni dizengigwe na kugangamizigwa.<verse eid="NUM 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 21:28" />Mana moto ulawa Heshiboni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:28">milambi ya moto ilawa kuna dibululu da Sihoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:28">udidanganiza bululu da Ali da Moabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:28">udanganiza milima yose ya lwanda lwa Alinoni<verse eid="NUM 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 21:29" />Kogaya weye Moabu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">Mudanganizigwa, mweye wanhu wa Kemoshi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">Kawalava wanage wa chilume kuwa wakimbizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">na wanage wa chike wahite kuutumwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">wahite kwa Sihoni mfalume wa Waamoli.<verse eid="NUM 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 21:30" />Mbali lelo nyelesi zawo zibanangigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:30">Nzila zose kulawa Heshiboni mbaka Diboni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:30">kulawa Nashimu mbaka Nofa, habehi na Medeba.”<verse eid="NUM 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 21:31" />Ivo Waisilaili wakala muna iisi ya Waamoli. <verse eid="NUM 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 21:32" />Musa kawatuma wanhu kudipelemba bululu da Yazeli. Wadisola hamwe na vibululu vake na wawawinga Waamoli wowakalile umo.<verse eid="NUM 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 21:33" />Maabaho Waisilaili wahinduka na wasondelela nzila yoihita Bashani. Ogu mfalume wa Bashani kasegela na wanhu wake wose kahita kuitowa na Waisilaili uko Edilei. <verse eid="NUM 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 21:34" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Sekeumdumbe, mana nizatenda mumuhume yeye na isi yake yose na wanhu wake wose. Kwizamtendela fana viya viumtendele Sihoni mfalume wa Waamoli, yoyakalile kokala Heshiboni.” <verse eid="NUM 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 21:35" />Ivo Waisilaili wamkoma Ogu na wanage na wanhu wake wose, hawamsigaze hata munhu imwe. Maabaho waisola isi yake.<verse eid="NUM 21:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="NUM 22" />
  <para style="s">Balaki komtanga Balaamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 22:1" />Maabaho Waisilaili wagendelela na umwanza na kwika lago jawo kuna dibawe da Moabu, dili kuumwambu wa Yoludani habehi na Yeliko.<verse eid="NUM 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 22:2" />Balaki mwana wa Sipoli kawona mbuli zose Waisilaili zowawatendele Waamoli. <verse eid="NUM 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 22:3" />Wamoabu wawadumba ng'hani wanhu wawo kwaviya wakala wengi. Wamoabu wawadumba ng'hani Waisilaili. <verse eid="NUM 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 22:4" />Wamoabu wawalongela walala wa Midiani, “Mting'hano uno wa wanhu wizananga chila chinhu mumgwazo yetu fana viya ng'ombe lume viyoja mgina muna imigunda.” Ivo Balaki mwana wa Sipoli yoyakalile mfalume wa Moabu lusita ulo, <verse eid="NUM 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 22:5" />katuma wasenga kwa Balaamu mwana wa Beoli, uko Pesoli habehi na lwanda lwa Efulate muna iisi ya Waamawi. Wamulongela Balaki, “Nolonda uvimanye kuwa wanhu wose wowalawile muna iisi ya Misili wenela muna iisi yose na wokala habehi na niye. <verse eid="NUM 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 22:6" />Lelo izo uwaduwile wanhu wano, kwaviya wana nguvu kufosa niye. Huwenda nizadaha kuwahuma na kuwawinga walawe muna iisi. Kwaviya nivimanya kuwa wose wouwatemela mate wotemeligwa mate na wouwaduwila woduwiligwa.”<verse eid="NUM 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 22:7" />Walala wa Moabu na walala wa Midiani wasola mayombe kumuliha mganga, wahita kwa Balaamu na wamulongela mbuli zilawile kwa Balaki. <verse eid="NUM 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 22:8" />Balaamu kawalongela, “Kaleni hano ichilo chino, niye nizamulongelani mbuli zondayanilongele Mndewa Mulungu.” Ivo walangulizi wawo wa Moabu wakala na Balaamu.<verse eid="NUM 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 22:9" />Mulungu kamwizila Balaamu na kamuuza, “Wano welihi woukalile hamwe nawo?”<verse eid="NUM 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 22:10" />Balaamu kamulongela Mulungu, “Balaki mwana wa Sipoli, mfalume wa Moabu, kanigalila usenga uno, <verse eid="NUM 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 22:11" />‘Kuna wanhu wowalawile Misili wenela muna iisi. Lelo izo uniduwilile wanhu wano, huwenda nizadaha kuitowa nawo na kuwawinga.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 22:12" />Mulungu kamulongela Balaamu, “Sekeuhite hamwe nawo na sekeuwaduwile wanhu wawo, kwaviya watemeligwa mate.”<verse eid="NUM 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 22:13" />Imitondo Balaamu kalamka na kawalongela walala wa Balaki, “Bweleni kuna iisi yenu, kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu halonda nihite hamwe na mweye.”<verse eid="NUM 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 22:14" />Ivo wakulu wa Moabu wasegela na wabwela kwa Balaki na wamulongela, “Balaamu kalema kwiza hamwe na cheye.”<verse eid="NUM 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 22:15" />Maabaho Balaki kawatuma wakulu wamwenga wengi ng'hani na wakulu kufosa waja wa ichanduso. <verse eid="NUM 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 22:16" />Wahita kwa Balaamu na wamulongela, “Balaki mwana wa Sipoli kolonga, ‘Nokulamba mbuli yoyose sekeikukimilile kwiza kumwangu. <verse eid="NUM 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 22:17" />Nizakiwng'ha vinhu vingi, na chochose chondaunipule nizakutendela. Izo uwaduwile wanhu wano.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 22:18" />Mbali Balaamu kawedika, “Hata one Balaki yahaning'ha kaye yake imemile hela na zahabu, niye sidaha kubena lagilizo da Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wangu, kwa mbuli yoyose, ng'hulu hebu ndodo. <verse eid="NUM 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 22:19" />Lelo kaleni hano ichilo chino fana viwatendile wayenu, muladi nivimanye chondayanilongele Mndewa Mulungu kaidi.”<verse eid="NUM 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 22:20" />Ichilo chiya Mndewa Mulungu kamwizila Balaamu na kamulongela, “Fana wanhu wano weza kukutanga, inuka uhite hamwe nawo, mbali chondanikulongele, niicho chondautende muhala.” <verse eid="NUM 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 22:21" />Ivo Balaamu kalamka imitondo, kamsasala chihongwe wake na kahita hamwe nawo.<verse eid="NUM 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chihongwe wa Balaamu na msenga wa kuulanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 22:22" />Mbali Mulungu kehilwa kwaviya kahita. Msenga wa kuulanga kamkimilila muna inzila. Balaamu kakala kakwela chihongwe wake yahawa hamwe na wasang'hani wake waidi. <verse eid="NUM 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 22:23" />Chihongwe viyamuwonile msenga wa kuulanga kema muna inzila kuno kamha zele dodisomoligwe muna iyala, kaileka inzila na kengila kumgwazo. Balaamu kamtowa chihongwe muladi yambweleze muna inzila.<verse eid="NUM 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 22:24" />Maabaho msenga wa kuulanga kema hana inzila sisili, hagati ya migunda ya mizabibu, iviya hana ng'huta mbili chila ubanzi. <verse eid="NUM 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 22:25" />Chihongwe viyamuwone msenga wa kuulanga, kaisung'hila kuna ing'huta na kamulumiza Balaamu umgulu. Balaamu kamtowa kaidi ichihongwe. <verse eid="NUM 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 22:26" />Maabaho msenga wa kuulanga kalongola kaidi, kema hanhu helibule nyafasi ya kufosa ukulume hebu ukumoso. <verse eid="NUM 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 22:27" />Chihongwe viyamuwonile msenga wa kuulanga, katambalala hasi. Balaamu kawona ludoko ng'hani na kamtowa kwa fimbo yake. <verse eid="NUM 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 22:28" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kaugubula mulomo wa chihongwe iyo. Chihongwe kamulongela Balaamu, “Nikutenda choni mbaka unitowe miyanza ino mitatu?”<verse eid="NUM 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 22:29" />Balaamu kamwidika, “Kwaviya kunizeha! One nihawile na panga muna umkono wangu, nihakukomile sambi baha.”<verse eid="NUM 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 22:30" />Chihongwe kamulongela Balaamu, “Vino niye siyo chihongwe wako ija ija yonikupapile siku zose mbaka diyelo? Vino niwahi kukutendela fana vino?” Balaamu kedika, “Aka.”<verse eid="NUM 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 22:31" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kayagubula meso ya Balaamu, nayo kamuwona msenga wa kuulanga kema muna inzila, kuno kamha zele dodisomoligwe muna iyala. Balaamu kaibwanha chingubingubi. <verse eid="NUM 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 22:32" />Msenga wa kuulanga kamulongela Balaamu, “Habali kumtowa chihongwe wako miyanza mitatu? Niza kukukimilila muladi sekeugendelele na mwanza uno. <verse eid="NUM 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 22:33" />Chihongwe wako kaniwona na kahita kumgwazo miyanza mitatu. One hatendile ivo, nihadahile kukukoma na kumuleka chihongwe yawe mgima.”<verse eid="NUM 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 22:34" />Balaamu kamulongela msenga wa kuulanga, “Nitenda uhasanyi, mana sivimanyile kuwa kukala kunikimilila muna inzila. Lelo one hulonda niye nigendelele na mwanza uno, basi nizabweleganya.”<verse eid="NUM 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 22:35" />Msenga wa kuulanga kamulongela Balaamu, “Hita hamwe na wanhu wano, mbali kwizalonga chiya chondanikulongele muhala.” Ivo Balaamu kahita hamwe na wanhu watumigwe na Balaki.<verse eid="NUM 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 22:36" />Balaki viyahulike kuwa Balaamu kokwiza, kahita kumuhokela kuna dibululu da Ali, bululu dikalile mumgwazo wa lwanda lwa Alinoni, muna imhaka ya Moabu. <verse eid="NUM 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 22:37" />Balaki kamulongela Balaamu, “Vino situmile wanhu kumwako muladi wakutange? Mbona hwizile? Vino niye sidaha kukuliha goya?”<verse eid="NUM 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 22:38" />“Balaamu kamulongela Balaki, ‘Lelo niza!’ Mbali nodaha kulonga chochose? Mbuli yondayanilongele Mulungu niiyo yondaniilonge.” <verse eid="NUM 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 22:39" />Maabaho Balaamu kahita hamwe na Balaki, wafika Kiliasi Husosi. <verse eid="NUM 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 22:40" />Balaki kachinja nhambiko ya ng'ombe na luti, kamgalila Balaamu na walangulizi wowakalile hamwe nayo.<verse eid="NUM 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Balaamu kowatemela mate Waisilaili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 22:41" />Igolo yake Balaki kamsola Balaamu na kakwela nayo mbaka Bamosi Baali. Kulawa uko Balaamu kawawona Waisilaili wamwenga.<verse eid="NUM 22:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="NUM 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 23:1" />Balaamu kamulongela Balaki, “Nizengele hano mapango saba, unigalile madang'ang'a ya ng'ombe malume saba na mabebelu ya ng'hondolo saba.”<verse eid="NUM 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 23:2" />Balaki katenda fana viya viyalongile Balaamu. Balaki na Balaamu walava nhambiko ya dang'ang'a da ng'ombe lume na bebelu da ng'hondolo uchanyha ya chila lupango. <verse eid="NUM 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 23:3" />Maabaho Balaamu kamulongela Balaki, “Ima hano habehi na nhambiko yako, niye nisegele. Huwenda Mndewa Mulungu kezaiting'hana na niye. Chochose chondayanilagusile nizakwiza kukulongela.” Ivo kahita yaidumwe kuna inhembeti ya mulima.<verse eid="NUM 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 23:4" />Mulungu kaiting'hana nayo, Balaamu kamulongela, “Nisasala mapango saba, na chila lupango nilava nhambiko ya dang'ang'a da ng'ombe lume na bebelu da ng'hondolo.”<verse eid="NUM 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 23:5" />Mndewa Mulungu kamwing'ha Balaamu mbuli za kulonga na kamulongela, “Bwela kwa Balaki ukamulongele mbuli zino.” <verse eid="NUM 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 23:6" />Ivo kabwela na kamfika Balaki yang'hali kema habehi ya nhambiko yake ya kutimbula, yeye hamwe na walangulizi wose wa Moabu. <verse eid="NUM 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 23:7" />Balaamu kalava ulotezi uno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">“Balaki mfalume wa Moabu kanigalila kulawa Alamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">kulawa Siliya, kulawa ulawilo wa zuwa wa milima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">Kalonga, ‘Izo uwaduwile wanhu wa Yakobo kwa ichimu changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">izo uwalonge vihile Waisilaili.’<verse eid="NUM 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 23:8" />Mbali nizamduwilaze munhu haduwiligwe na Mulungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:8">Nizawalongaze vihile wanhu waja Mndewa Mulungu hawalongile vihile?<verse eid="NUM 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 23:9" />Nowawona kulawa kuinhembeti ya maluwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:9">nomsungulilani kulawa kuinhembeti ya milima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:9">Wanhu wowokala waidumwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:9">wowoiwona kuwa hawalingile fana wanhu wamwenga.<verse eid="NUM 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 23:10" />Yelihi yodaha kuyapeta matimbwisi ya Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:10">hebu kupeta lobo ya Isilaili?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:10">Vondanidanagnike niwe fana wanhu wanogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:10">fana Waisilaili.”<verse eid="NUM 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 23:11" />Maabaho Balaki kamulongela Balaamu, “Kunitendela choni? Nikugala hano muladi uwaduwile wehi wangu, mbali weye kuwatemela mate!”<verse eid="NUM 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 23:12" />Balaamu kamwidika, “Vino silondeka kulonga mbuli ziya Mndewa Mulungu ziyazikile muna umulomo wangu?”<verse eid="NUM 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulotezi wekaidi wa Balaamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 23:13" />Maabaho Balaki kamulongela Balaamu, “Chihite hanhu hamwenga hondaudahe kuwawona. Kwizawawona wadodo mbali hwizadaha kuwawona wose. Kulawa uko, waduwile kwa ichimu changu.” <verse eid="NUM 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 23:14" />Balaki kamsola Balaamu mbaka kuna umgunda wa Sofimu, mbaka kuna inhembeti ya mulima wa Pisiga, kazenga mapango saba, kalava nhambiko ya dang'ang'a da ng'ombe lume na bebelu da ng'hondolo uchanyha ya chila lupango.<verse eid="NUM 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 23:15" />Balaamu kamulongela Balaki, “Ima hano habehi na nhambiko yako ya kutimbula, niye nihite kuumwambu nikaiting'hane na Mndewa Mulungu.”<verse eid="NUM 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 23:16" />Mndewa Mulungu kamwing'ha Balaamu mbuli za kulonga na kamulongela, “Bwela kwa Balaki ukamulongele mbuli zino.” <verse eid="NUM 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 23:17" />Ivo kabwela na kamfika Balaki yang'hali kema habehi na nhambiko yake ya kutimbula, hamwe na walangulizi wa Moabu. Balaki kamuuza Balaamu, “Mndewa Mulungu kolongaki?” <verse eid="NUM 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 23:18" />Balaamu kamwimbila, kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:18">“Lamka Balaki, utegeleze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:18">nihulike weye mwana wa Sipoli.<verse eid="NUM 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 23:19" />Mulungu siyo munhu, mbaka yalonge uvwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:19">hebu siyo mwana wa munhu, mbaka yagalule magesa yake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:19">Vino kodaha kulaganila chochose na sekeyachitende,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:19">hebu kulonga chinhu na sekeyachifikize?<verse eid="NUM 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 23:20" />Ning'higwa ndagilizi ya kutemela mate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:20">yeye kawatemela mate, niye sidaha kugalula.<verse eid="NUM 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 23:21" />Halolile wihi kwa wanhu wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:21">iviya hawonile magayo mwa Isilaili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:21">Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wawo kahamwe nawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:21">dizi da mfalume da hagati yawo.<verse eid="NUM 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 23:22" />Mulungu yoyawasolile kulawa Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:22">kawagombela na wehi wawo fana ng'ombe mbago.<verse eid="NUM 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 23:23" />Uhawi haudaha kuwahuma wanhu wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:23">hebu uganga haudaha kuwahuma Isilaili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:23">Mbuli za Yakobo na Isilaili zizalongigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:23">‘Loleni mauzauza yoyatendile Mndewa Mulungu!’<verse eid="NUM 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 23:24" />Waisilaili wenuka fana simba zike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:24">wokwima fana simba lume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:24">fana simba yeli hagona mbaka yagwile chiya chiyowinga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:24">na kung'wa damu ya chiya chiyawingile.”<verse eid="NUM 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 23:25" />Balaki kamulongela Balaamu, “Basi sekeuwaduwile, hebu sekeuwatemele mate!”<verse eid="NUM 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 23:26" />Balaamu kamwidika Balaki, “Vino sikulongele kuwa nolondeka kutenda chiyolonga Mndewa Mulungu?”<verse eid="NUM 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulotezi wetatu wa Balaamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 23:27" />Balaki kamulongela Balaamu, “Izo nikugale hanhu hamwenga. Huwenda Mndewa Mulungu kezanogelwa uniduwilile wanhu wawo kulawa uko.” <verse eid="NUM 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 23:28" />Ivo Balaki kamsola Balaamu kahita nayo kuna inhembeti ya mulima wa Peoli, hanhu baho munhu yahema kowona chuwala hasi yake. <verse eid="NUM 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 23:29" />Balaamu kamulongela Balaki, “Nizengele mapango saba hano na uning'he ng'ombe walume saba na mabebelu ya ng'hondolo saba.” <verse eid="NUM 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 23:30" />Balaki katenda fana viyalongile Balaamu, kalava ng'ombe lume na bebelu da ng'hondolo uchanyha ya chila lupango.<verse eid="NUM 23:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="NUM 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 24:1" />Basi Balaamu viyawonile kuwa imnogeza Mndewa Mulungu kuwatemela mate Waisilaili, hahitile kulotela kaidi, kalola kuchuwala. <verse eid="NUM 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 24:2" />Balaamu kenula meso yake kawona Waisilaili weka malago yawo, chila kabila hanhu hake, Muhe wa Mulungu kamwizila, <verse eid="NUM 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 24:3" />nayo kagong'onda ulotezi uno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:3">“Balaamu mwana wa Beoli kolotela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:3">ulotezi wa munhu ija yoyagubuligwe yameso,<verse eid="NUM 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 24:4" />ulotezi wa munhu yoyahulike mbuli za Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:4">yoyawonile malaguso ya Mulungu yeli na udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:4">yoibwanha chingubingubi, kagubuligwa yameso.<verse eid="NUM 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 24:5" />Mahema yako yanoga ng'hani weye Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:5">hanhu hako ha kukala hanoga weye Isilaili!<verse eid="NUM 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 24:6" />Vino vilinga fana mabawe yokilima mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:6">fana chizi hamgwazo ya lwanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:6">fana makunzamvili yoyahandile Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:6">fana mielezi hamgwazo ya mazi.<verse eid="NUM 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 24:7" />Wezakuwa na mazi mengi muna zinongo zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:7">mbeyu zawo zizahandigwa hanhu heli na mazi ya kufaya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:7">Mfalume wawo kezakuwa mkulu kufosa Agagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:7">ufalume wawo wizatunhizigwa.<verse eid="NUM 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 24:8" />Mulungu kawalava kulawa Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">kawagombela na wehi wawo fana ng'ombe mbago.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">Kezawananga wanhu wa zisi zimwenga weli wehi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">kezaibemenda mivuha yawo vihande vihande, kezawahoma kwa misale yawo.<verse eid="NUM 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 24:9" />Kaidulika, kagona fana simba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:9">kalinga fana simba zike, habule munhu yogeza kumulamsa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:9">Munhu yoyose yokutemela mate, kezatemeligwa mate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:9">munhu yoyose yokuduwila, kezaduwiligwa.”<verse eid="NUM 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 24:10" />Balaki kamuwonela ludoko Balaamu, katowa mang'huwa na kamulongela, “Nikutanga muladi uwaduwile wehi wangu, mbali kuwatemela mate miyanza mitatu. <verse eid="NUM 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 24:11" />Lelo segela! Nikala nikwikila chilagano kukwing'ha vinhu vingi, mbali Mndewa Mulungu hakudahize kupata vinhu ivo, kakwima.”<verse eid="NUM 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 24:12" />Balaamu kamwidika Balaki, “Vino siwalongele wasenga wouwatumile kumwangu <verse eid="NUM 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 24:13" />kuwa hata one uhaning'ha kaye yako imemile hela na zahabu, niye sidaha kubena lagilizo da Mndewa Mulungu kwa kutenda mbuli yoyose, inogile hebu ihile, bila kuwangilizigwa. Nilonga kuwa chondayalonge Mndewa Mulungu, niicho chondanilonge. <verse eid="NUM 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 24:14" />Sambi nobwela kwa wanhu wangu, mbali ning'hali sinasegela, leka nikulongele mbuli ziya wanhu wano zondawawatendela wanhu wako siku zikwiza.”<verse eid="NUM 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulotezi wekane wa Balaamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 24:15" />Kalotela, kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:15">“Balaamu mwana wa Beoli kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:15">Munhu ija yoyagubuligwe yameso,<verse eid="NUM 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 24:16" />ulotezi wa munhu yohulika mbuli za Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:16">na kuumanya umanyi wa yeye yeli uchanyha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:16">Munhu yoyowona malaguso ya Mulungu yeli na udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:16">yahaibwanha chingubingubi, kagubuligwa yameso.<verse eid="NUM 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 24:17" />Nomuwona, mbali siyo sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">Nomuwona, mbali heli habehi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">Nhondo izalawilila kwa welesi wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">kezalawilila mfalume mwa Waisilaili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">Kezawatowa walangulizi wa Wamoabu kwa fimbo yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">kezawadanganiza welesi wose wa Seti.<verse eid="NUM 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 24:18" />Isi ya Edomu izakuwa yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:18">isi ya Seili izakuwa yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:18">Isilaili izahuma.<verse eid="NUM 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 24:19" />Imwe kulawa muna uwelesi wa Yakobo kezatawala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:19">kezawadanganiza wondawasigale muna dibululu.”<verse eid="NUM 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 24:20" />Maabaho Balaamu kamuwona Amaleki, kalotela na kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:20">“Amaleki ni isi ili na nguvu kufosa zisi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:20">mbali kuuhelelo izadanganizigwa ng'hani.”<verse eid="NUM 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 24:21" />Maabaho kawalola Wakeni, kalotela, kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:21">“Mhongono yenu ina nguvu mweye Wakeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:21">fana chisanza uchanyha kuuluwe.<verse eid="NUM 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 24:22" />Mbali mweye Wakeni mwizadanganizigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:22">mbaka Ashulu vondayawasole mateka.”<verse eid="NUM 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 24:23" />Kaidi Balaamu kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:23">“Loo! Yelihi yondayahone, Mulungu vondayatende yano?<verse eid="NUM 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 24:24" />Ngalawa ng'hulu zizakwiza kulawa mhwani ya Kitimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:24">wezaziteka Ashulu na Ebeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:24">na wawo iviya wezadanganizigwa.”<verse eid="NUM 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 24:25" />Maabaho Balaamu kenuka na kabwela ukaye, Balaki iviya kasegela.<verse eid="NUM 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="NUM 25" />
  <para style="s">Waisilaili wolava nhambiko kwa Baali uko Peoli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 25:1" />Waisilaili viwakalile uko Shitimu, walume wandusa kutenda ugoni na wanaake wa Moabu. <verse eid="NUM 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 25:2" />Wanaake wawo wawagoneka Waisilaili kuna zinhambiko ziwatambikile milungu yawo, nawo Waisilaili waja ndiya na kuitambikila milungu iyo. <verse eid="NUM 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 25:3" />Ivo Waisilaili wailumba na imwe wa milungu yotangigwa Baali wa Peoli. Mndewa Mulungu kawawonela ludoko.<verse eid="NUM 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 25:4" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Wasole walangulizi wose wa wanhu wano, uwakome hana dizuwa haulongozi wangu, muladi ludoko lwangu lufose.”<verse eid="NUM 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 25:5" />Musa kawalongela wasemi wa Isilaili, “Mweye molondeka muwakome wanhu wowailumbile na Baali wa Peoli.”<verse eid="NUM 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 25:6" />Maabaho Muisilaili imwe kamgala mwanamke Mmidiani ukaye yake, haulongozi wa Musa na mting'hano wose, viwakalile wolila haulongozi wa hanhu ha kwingilila muna dihema da Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 25:7" />Finehasi mwana wa Eleazali, mzukulu wa mkulu wa nhambiko Haluni viyawonile ivo, kenuka na kasegela hana umting'hano. Kasola mgoha <verse eid="NUM 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 25:8" />na kamsondelela Muisilaili ija muna dihema da Mulungu. Kawahoma wose waidi kwa mgoha wake muna umunda. Tamu dihile dodikalile dowakoma Waisilaili dikomelezeka. <verse eid="NUM 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 25:9" />Mbali wanhu wowadanganike kwa tamu ijo wakala 24,000.<verse eid="NUM 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 25:10" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 25:11" />“Finehasi mwana wa Eleazali, mzukulu wa mkulu wa nhambiko Haluni, kaluhindula ludoko lwangu lulawe kwa Waisilaili, kwaviya kakala na migongo hagati yawo fana inili nayo niye, hata nileka kuwadanganiza Waisilaili kwa migongo yangu. <verse eid="NUM 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 25:12" />Ivo mulongele, ‘Notenda nayo lagano jangu da tindiwalo. <verse eid="NUM 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 25:13" />Dizakuwa kumwake na welesi wake, wezakuwa wakulu wa nhambiko siku zose kwaviya kawona migongo kwa ichimu changu niye Mulungu wake, kawatendela kuilumba Waisilaili.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 25:14" />Muisilaili ija yoyakomigwe hamwe na ija mwanamke Mmidiani katangigwa Zimili, mwana wa Salu, mulangulizi wa wanhu wake muna dikabila da Simeoni. <verse eid="NUM 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 25:15" />Mwanamke ija Mmidiani yoyakomigwe katangigwa Kozibi, mndele wa Suli, yoyakalile mulangulizi wa lukolo uko Midiani.<verse eid="NUM 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 25:16" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 25:17" />“Wagaze Wamidiani na uwakome, <verse eid="NUM 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 25:18" />kwaviya wawo wamgazani kwa uvwizi wawo, wamvwizilani kwa mbuli ya Peoli na kwa mbuli ya Kozibi, mndele wawo yoyadanganike vikulawilile tamu dihile kuja Peoli.”<verse eid="NUM 25:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="NUM 26" />
  <para style="s">Peta yekaidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 26:1" />Vidimalile tamu ijo, Mndewa Mulungu kawalongela Musa na Eleazali mwana wa mkulu wa nhambiko Haluni, <verse eid="NUM 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 26:2" />“Wapeteni Waisilaili wose na ng'holo zawo na wanhu wose weli na miyaka malongo maidi na waja wose wowodaha kuitowa kuna ing'hondo.” <verse eid="NUM 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 26:3" />Musa na mkulu wa nhambiko Eleazali walonga na wanhu kuna dibawe da Moabu habehi na lwanda lwa Yoludani uli malola na bululu da Yeliko. Wawalongela, <verse eid="NUM 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 26:4" />“Wapeteni wanhu kwandusila weli na miyaka malongo maidi na kugendelela, fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize Musa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 26:4">Wawo wakala Waisilaili wowalawile muna iisi ya Misili.<verse eid="NUM 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 26:5" />Lubeni kakala mwana wa udele wa Isilaili, welesi wa Lubeni wakala lukolo lwa Henoki na lukolo lwa Palu <verse eid="NUM 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 26:6" />na lukolo lwa Heziloni na lukolo lwa Kalimi. <verse eid="NUM 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 26:7" />Zino zikala ng'holo za Lubeni. Wanhu wose wowapetigwe wakala 43,730.<verse eid="NUM 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 26:8" />Mwana wa Palu kakala Eliabu. <verse eid="NUM 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 26:9" />Wana wa Eliabu wakala Nemueli na Dasani na Abilamu. Niiyo wawo Dasani na Abilamu wowasaguligwe na mting'hano mbali wawabiduka Musa na Haluni, wailumba na bumbila da Kola lusita viwamulekile Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 26:10" />Isi igubuka na kuwamela. Wadanganika hamwe na Kola na bumbila jake lusita moto viuwadanganize wanhu 250, dikala lamulo kwa wanhu. <verse eid="NUM 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 26:11" />Mbali lukolo lwa Kola hawadanganike.<verse eid="NUM 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 26:12" />Welesi wa Simeoni wakala lukolo lwa Nemueli na lukolo lwa Yamini na lukolo lwa Yakini <verse eid="NUM 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 26:13" />na lukolo lwa Zela na lukolo lwa Shauli. <verse eid="NUM 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 26:14" />Zino izo ng'holo za kabila da Simeoni, peta yawo wakala walume 22,200.<verse eid="NUM 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 26:15" />Welesi wa Gadi wakala lukolo lwa Sefoni na lukolo lwa Hagi na lukolo lwa Shuni <verse eid="NUM 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 26:16" />na lukolo lwa Ozini na lukolo lwa Eli <verse eid="NUM 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 26:17" />na lukolo lwa Alodi na lukolo lwa Aleli. <verse eid="NUM 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 26:18" />Zino izo ng'holo za kabila da Gadi, peta yawo wakala walume 40,500.<verse eid="NUM 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 26:19" />Welesi wa Yuda wakala Eli na Onani. Wawo wadanganikila muna iisi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="NUM 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 26:20" />Welesi wa Yuda wakala lukolo lwa Shela na lukolo lwa Pelesi na lukolo lwa Zela. <verse eid="NUM 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 26:21" />Welesi wa Pelesi wakala lukolo lwa Hesiloni na lukolo lwa Hamuli. <verse eid="NUM 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 26:22" />Zino izo ng'holo za kabila da Yuda, peta yawo wakala walume 76,500.<verse eid="NUM 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 26:23" />Welesi wa Isakali wakala lukolo lwa Tola na lukolo lwa Puva <verse eid="NUM 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 26:24" />na lukolo lwa Yashubu na lukolo lwa Shimuloni. <verse eid="NUM 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 26:25" />Zino izo ng'holo za kabila da Isakali, peta yawo wakala walume 64,300.<verse eid="NUM 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 26:26" />Welesi wa Zabuloni wakala lukolo lwa Seledi na lukolo lwa Eloni na lukolo lwa Yaleeli. <verse eid="NUM 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 26:27" />Zino izo ng'holo za kabila da Zabuloni, peta yawo wakala walume 60,500.<verse eid="NUM 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 26:28" />Wana wa Yosefu wakala Manase na Efulaimu. <verse eid="NUM 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 26:29" />Welesi wa Manase wakala lukolo lwa Makili na lukolo lwa Gileadi mwanage. <verse eid="NUM 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 26:30" />Welesi wa Gileadi wakala lukolo lwa Yezeli na lukolo lwa Heleki <verse eid="NUM 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 26:31" />na lukolo lwa Asilieli na lukolo lwa Shekemu <verse eid="NUM 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 26:32" />na lukolo lwa Shemida na lukolo lwa Hefeli. <verse eid="NUM 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 26:33" />Selofehadi mwana wa Hefeli heleke wana wa chilume mbali wana wa chike muhala. Mazina yawo yakala Mala na Nuhu na Hogila na Milika na Tiliza. <verse eid="NUM 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 26:34" />Zino izo ng'holo za kabila da Manase, peta yawo wakala walume 52,700.<verse eid="NUM 26:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 26:35" />Welesi wa Efulaimu wakala lukolo lwa Shusela na lukolo lwa Bekeli na lukolo lwa Tahani. <verse eid="NUM 26:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 26:36" />Welesi wa Shusela wakala lukolo lwa Elani. <verse eid="NUM 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 26:37" />Zino izo ng'holo za kabila da Efulaimu, peta yawo wakala walume 32,500.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 26:37">Zino ni nyelesi za Yosefu kwa kusondelela ng'holo zawo.<verse eid="NUM 26:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 26:38" />Welesi wa Benjamini wakala lukolo lwa Bela na lukolo lwa Ashibeli na lukolo lwa Ahilamu <verse eid="NUM 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 26:39" />na lukolo lwa Shufamu na lukolo lwa Hufamu. <verse eid="NUM 26:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 26:40" />Welesi wa Bela wakala lukolo lwa Alidi na lukolo lwa Naamani. <verse eid="NUM 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 26:41" />Zino ni ng'holo za kabila da Benjamini, peta yawo wakala walume 45,600.<verse eid="NUM 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 26:42" />Welesi wa Dani wakala lukolo lwa Shuhamu. <verse eid="NUM 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 26:43" />Luno ni lukolo lwa Shuhamu, peta yawo wakala walume 64,400.<verse eid="NUM 26:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 26:44" />Welesi wa Asheli wakala lukolo lwa Imina na lukolo lwa Ishivi na lukolo lwa Belia. <verse eid="NUM 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 26:45" />Welesi wa Belia wakala lukolo lwa Hebeli na lukolo lwa Malikieli. <verse eid="NUM 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 26:46" />Asheli kakala na mwana wa chike zina jake Sela. <verse eid="NUM 26:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 26:47" />Zino ni ng'holo za kabila da Asheli, peta yawo wakala walume 53,400.<verse eid="NUM 26:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 26:48" />Welesi wa Nafutali wakala lukolo lwa Yeseli na lukolo lwa Guni <verse eid="NUM 26:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 26:49" />na lukolo lwa Yaseeli na lukolo lwa Shilemu. <verse eid="NUM 26:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 26:50" />Zino ni ng'holo za kabila da Nafutali, peta yawo wakala walume 45,400.<verse eid="NUM 26:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 26:51" />Walume wose wa Isilaili wowapetigwe wakala 601,730.<verse eid="NUM 26:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 26:52" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 26:53" />“Makabila yano yezagoliligwa isi iwe uhazi wawo, kwa kusondelela peta ya mazina yawo. <verse eid="NUM 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 26:54" />Kabila kulu dizakwing'higwa hanhu hakulu na kabila dodo dizakwing'higwa hanhu hadodo. Chila kabila dizahokela uhazi wake fana viili peta ya wanhu wake. <verse eid="NUM 26:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 26:55" />Mbali isi izagoligwa kwa kutowa mhiya. Chila kabila dizakwing'higwa isi kwa viili mazina ya lukolo lwawo. <verse eid="NUM 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 26:56" />Uhazi wa chila kabila wizagoligwa kwa kutowa mhiya. Chila kabila dizapata kwa viili ukulu wake hebu udodo wake.”<verse eid="NUM 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 26:57" />Zino ni ng'holo za Walawi zozipetigwe hamwe na nyelesi zawo, lukolo lwa Gelishoni na lukolo lwa Kohasi na lukolo lwa Melali. <verse eid="NUM 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 26:58" />Iviya welesi wa Walawi wakala lukolo lwa Libini na lukolo lwa Hebuloni na lukolo lwa Mahili na lukolo lwa Mushi na lukolo lwa Kola. Kohasi kamweleka Amilamu. <verse eid="NUM 26:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 26:59" />Zina da muke wa Amilamu dikala Yokebedi, mwelesi wa Lawi, iyo yoyelekwe na Lawi kuna iisi ya Misili, nayo kamwelekela Amilamu wana waidi wa chilume, Haluni na Musa na Miliamu lumbu jawo. <verse eid="NUM 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 26:60" />Haluni kamweleka Nadabu na Abihu na Eleazali na Isamali. <verse eid="NUM 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 26:61" />Mbali Nadabu na Abihu wadanganika viwalavile moto haulondeka haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 26:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 26:62" />Walume wowapetigwe, kwandusila weli na mwezi umwe na kugendelela wakala 23,000, mana wawo hawapetigwe mwa Waisilaili kwaviya wawo haweng'higwe isi kuwa uhazi hagati yawo.<verse eid="NUM 26:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 26:63" />Wawo ni walume wowapetigwe na Musa na mkulu wa nhambiko Eleazali, viwawapetile Waisilaili muna dibawe da Moabu habehi na lwanda lwa Yoludani uli malola na bululu da Yeliko. <verse eid="NUM 26:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 26:64" />Habule hata munhu imwe yasigale mwa iwaja wapetigwe na Musa na Haluni yeli mkulu wa nhambiko muna ichuwala cha Sinai. <verse eid="NUM 26:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 26:65" />Mana Mndewa Mulungu kawalongela, “Waisilaili wano wezadanganikila muna ichuwala.” Hasigale hata imwe viweli, ila Kalebu mwana wa Yefune na Yoshua mwana wa Nuni.<verse eid="NUM 26:65" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="NUM 27" />
  <para style="s">Wandele wa Selofehadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 27:1" />Chipindi icho Mala na Nuhu na Hogila na Milika na Tiliza, wandele wa Selofehadi, wakwenhuka habehi. Nayo Selofehadi kakala mwana wa Hefeli, mwana wa Gileadi, mwana wa Makili, mwana wa Manase mwana wa Yosefu. <verse eid="NUM 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 27:2" />Wawo wema haulongozi wa Musa na haulongozi wa mkulu wa nhambiko Eleazali na haulongozi wa walangulizi wose wa mting'hano, hanhu ha kwingilila hana dihema da Mulungu. Walonga, <verse eid="NUM 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 27:3" />“Tati yetu kadanganika muichuwala, hakalile muna dibumbila da waja wowailumbile kumuhasanya Mndewa Mulungu muna dibumbila da Kola, mbali kadanganika kwa uhasanyi wake mwenyewo na heleke mwana wa chilume. <verse eid="NUM 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 27:4" />Habali zina da tati yetu disegezigwe muna ulukolo lwake kwaviya heleke mwana wa chilume? Ching'he uhazi hamwe na ndugu wa tati yetu.”<verse eid="NUM 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 27:5" />Musa kazigala mbuli zawo kwa Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 27:6" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 27:7" />“Mbuli yowolonga wandele wa Selofehadi ni kweli, weng'he uhazi hamwe na ndugu wa tati yawo, wasole uhazi wa tati yawo. <verse eid="NUM 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 27:8" />Walongele Waisilaili kuwa munhu yoyose yadanganike bila kuleka mwana wa chilume, mwanage wa chike kezakwing'higwa uhazi wake. <verse eid="NUM 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 27:9" />Na one yahawa kabule mwana wa chike, wezakwing'higwa ndugu zake wa chilume. <verse eid="NUM 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 27:10" />Na one yahawa kabule ndugu wa chilume, uhazi wake wezakwing'higwa tati zake wakulu hebu tati zake wadodo. <verse eid="NUM 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 27:11" />Na one tati yake kabule sekulu hebu mdodo, uhazi wake kezakwing'higwa ndugu yake wa habehi, nayo kezahazi fana uhazi wake. Dino dizakuwa lagilizo na ndagilizi kwa Waisilaili, fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize Musa.”<verse eid="NUM 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoshua kosaguligwa kuwalongoza Waisilaili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 31:1-8">Kumbukumbu 31:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 27:12" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Kwela kuna umulima uno wa Abalimu na uilole isi yoniweng'hile Waisilaili. <verse eid="NUM 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 27:13" />Na uhaiwona, weye iviya kwizadanganika fana viyadanganike ndugu yako Haluni, <verse eid="NUM 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 27:14" />kwaviya muleka kunitegeleza mbuli yangu kuna ichuwala cha Sini. Haja mting'hano wose howalongelele kusonhela niye kuja Meliba. Hamunitendile fana yelile haulongozi wawo viwalondile weng'higwe mazi.” Meliba ni nzasa ya mazi ili Kadeshi kuna ichuwala cha Sini.<verse eid="NUM 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 27:15" />Musa kamulongela Mndewa Mulungu, <verse eid="NUM 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 27:16" />“Weye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wili mwanduso wa ugima wose, umsagule munhu wa kuwalongoza wanhu wano, <verse eid="NUM 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 27:17" />yondayawalongolele na kuwalongoza muna zimbuli zawo zose, muladi wanhu wa Mndewa Mulungu sekewawe fana ng'hondolo welibule mdimi.”<verse eid="NUM 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 27:18" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Msole Yoshua mwana wa Nuni, munhu yeli na muhe wa Mulungu mgati yake na umwikile mkono wako. <verse eid="NUM 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 27:19" />Umwimize haulongozi ha mkulu wa nhambiko Eleazali na mting'hano wose, umwing'he sang'hano iyo. <verse eid="NUM 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 27:20" />Umtende yawe mulangulizi hamwe na weye muladi Waisilaili wose wamtegeleze. <verse eid="NUM 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 27:21" />Nayo kezakwima haulongozi wa mkulu wa nhambiko Eleazali, yeye kezamulongela voyolondeka kwa uhumizo wa Ulimu na Sumimu haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu, Eleazali kezawalongoza Yoshua na Waisilaili wose muna zimbuli zawo zose.” <verse eid="NUM 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 27:22" />Musa katenda fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize. Kamsola Yoshua na kumwimiza haulongozi wa mkulu wa nhambiko Eleazali na mting'hano wose. <verse eid="NUM 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 27:23" />Maabaho kamwikila makono kwa kumtenda yawe mulangulizi, fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 27:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="NUM 28" />
  <para style="s">Nhambiko za chila siku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 28:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 28:2" />“Walagilize Waisilaili, ‘Mweye mwizanilavila nhosa zozilondeka kwa lusita lolulondeka, ndiya za kutimbuligwa kwa moto, zili na mnung'ho unogile wa kuninogeza.’<verse eid="NUM 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 28:3" />“Walongele kuwa nhambiko zondawanilavile niye Mndewa Mulungu kwa moto zizakuwa vino, mabebelu ya ng'hondolo maidi yeli na mwaka umwe yelibule chilema, kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya kutimbula ya chila siku. <verse eid="NUM 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 28:4" />Mwanang'hondolo imwe kezalavigwa imitondo na imwenga kezalavigwa ichigulogulo nguku zikwingila, <verse eid="NUM 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 28:5" />chila imwe kezalavigwa hamwe na nhosa ya usage chilo imwe, wouhanganyigwe na lita imwe ya mavuta yanogile yahondigwe. <verse eid="NUM 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 28:6" />Nhambiko ya kutimbula ino izalavigwa chila siku, ija ilagilizigwe uko kuna umulima wa Sinai iwe mnung'ho unogile wa kunogeza, nhambiko iyolaviligwa Mndewa Mulungu kwa moto. <verse eid="NUM 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 28:7" />Nhosa ya ching'waji yondailavigwe hamwe na chila mwanang'hondolo ni lita imwe ya divai. Kwizaigida nhosa ino ya ching'waji hana ihanhu helile. <verse eid="NUM 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 28:8" />Ichigulogulo nguku zikwingila kwizamulava ija mwanang'hondolo imwenga hamwe na nhosa ya usage na hamwe na nhosa ya ching'waji fana viutendile imitondo, kwizalava nhambiko iyolaviligwa Mndewa Mulungu kwa moto, ili na mnung'ho unogile wa kumnogeza Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="NUM 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhosa za Siku ya Mhumulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 28:9" />“Muna Isiku ya Mhumulo mwizalava wanang'hondolo walume waidi weli na mwaka umwe welibule chilema na chilo mbili za usage unogile wouhanganyigwe na mavuta, hamwe na nhosa yake ya ching'waji. <verse eid="NUM 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 28:10" />Nhambiko ino ya kutimbula izalavigwa chila Siku ya Mhumulo, kufosa nhosa ija ya chila siku hamwe na nhosa yake ya ching'waji.<verse eid="NUM 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhambiko za chila mwezi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 28:11" />“Chila mwanduso wa mwezi, mwizamgalila Mndewa Mulungu nhambiko ya kutimbula. Madang'ang'a malume maidi na mabebelu ya ng'hondolo saba na wanang'hondolo walume saba weli na mwaka umwe, wose sekewawe na chilema. <verse eid="NUM 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 28:12" />Mwizalava nhosa ya usage unogile chilo nhatu wouhanganyigwe na mavuta, kwa chila ng'ombe lume, mwizalava chilo mbili za usage unogile wouhanganyigwe na mavuta, kwa chila bebelu da ng'hondolo, <verse eid="NUM 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 28:13" />na chilo imwe ya usage unogile wouhanganyigwe na mavuta, kwa chila mwanang'hondolo. Nhambiko zino za kutimbula zolavigwa kwa Mndewa Mulungu kwa moto, zili na mnung'ho unogile wa kumnogeza Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 28:14" />Ningo ya nhosa ya ching'waji yoilondeka ni lita mbili za divai kwa chila ng'ombe lume, lita imwe na nusu kwa chila bebelu da ng'hondolo na lita imwe kwa chila mwanang'hondolo. Ino iyo nhambiko ya kutimbula ya chila mwezi kwa mwaka. <verse eid="NUM 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 28:15" />Iviya mwizamulavila Mndewa Mulungu bebelu da luti kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya uhasanyi hamwe na nhambiko ija ya kutimbula ya chila siku na nhosa ya ching'waji.<verse eid="NUM 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhambiko ya Pasaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 28:16" />“Siku ya longo na nne ya mwezi wa mwanduso ni Dugila da Pasaka ya Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 28:17" />Muna isiku ya longo na tano ya mwezi uwo kwizakuwa na dugila, kwa siku saba mwizakuja magate yelibule lusu. <verse eid="NUM 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 28:18" />Muna isiku ya mwanduso kwizakuwa na mting'hano wa kutosa kwa Mulungu. Siku iyo hamwizasang'hana usang'hano wowose. <verse eid="NUM 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 28:19" />Mwizalava nhambiko ya kutimbula kwa Mndewa Mulungu kwa moto, madang'ang'a malume maidi na bebelu da ng'hondolo na wanang'hondolo walume saba weli na mwaka umwe, wose sekewawe na chilema, <verse eid="NUM 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 28:20" />hamwe na nhosa zake za usage, usage unogile wouhanganyigwe na mavuta, mwizalava chilo nhatu kwa chila ng'ombe imwe na chilo mbili kwa chila bebelu da ng'hondolo, <verse eid="NUM 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 28:21" />na chilo imwe kwa chila mwanang'hondolo mwa waja wanang'hondolo saba. <verse eid="NUM 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 28:22" />Iviya mwizalava bebelu da luti kuwa nhambiko ya uhasanyi, muladi kuwatendela kuilumba. <verse eid="NUM 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 28:23" />Mwizalava wanyama wawo, iviya nhambiko ya kutimbula ya chila siku, yoilavigwa chila imitondo. <verse eid="NUM 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 28:24" />Iviya kwa siku saba mwizalava nhambiko ya ndiya kwa Mndewa Mulungu kwa moto, ili na mnung'ho unogile wa kumnogeza Mndewa Mulungu. Ino mwizailava hamwe na nhambiko ija ya kutimbula ya chila siku na nhosa yake ya ching'waji. <verse eid="NUM 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 28:25" />Muna isiku yesaba mwizakuwa na mting'hano wa kutosa kwa Mulungu, sekemusang'hane usang'hano wowose.<verse eid="NUM 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dugila da Majuma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:15-22">Walawi 23:15-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 28:26" />“Muna isiku ya Dugila da Majuma, vondamumulavile Mndewa Mulungu mhule zenu zimugobole mwanduso, mwizatenda mting'hano wa kutosa kwa Mulungu. Sekemusang'hane usang'hano wowose. <verse eid="NUM 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 28:27" />Mwizalava nhambiko ya kutimbula ili na mnung'ho unogile wa kumnogeza Mndewa Mulungu, madang'ang'a malume maidi na bebelu da ng'hondolo na wanang'hondolo walume saba weli na mwaka umwe. <verse eid="NUM 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 28:28" />Izakuwa hamwe na nhosa zake za usage unogile wouhanganyigwe na mavuta, chilo nhatu kwa chila ng'ombe lume na chilo mbili kwa chila bebelu da ng'hondolo <verse eid="NUM 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 28:29" />na chilo imwe kwa chila mwanang'hondolo. <verse eid="NUM 28:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 28:30" />Iviya mwizalava bebelu da luti, muladi kumtendelani kuilumba. <verse eid="NUM 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 28:31" />Iviya mwizalava nhambiko iyo ya kutimbula ya chila siku hamwe na nhosa yake ya ching'waji. Wanyama wose sekewawe na chilema.<verse eid="NUM 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="NUM 29" />
  <para style="s">Dugila da Kutowa Mhalati</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:23-25">Walawi 23:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 29:1" />“Muna isiku ya mwanduso ya mwezi wa saba mwizakuwa na mting'hano wa kutosa kwa Mulungu, sekemusang'hane usang'hano. Iyo izakuwa siku yenu ya kutowa mhalati. <verse eid="NUM 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 29:2" />Mwizalava nhambiko ya kutimbula ili na mnung'ho unogile wa kumnogeza Mndewa Mulungu, dang'ang'a lume na bebelu da ng'hondolo na wanang'hondolo walume saba weli na mwaka umwe, wose sekewawe na chilema. <verse eid="NUM 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 29:3" />Iviya mwizalava nhosa yake ya usage unogile wouhanganyigwe na mavuta, chilo nhatu kwa dang'ang'a lume na chilo mbili kwa bebelu da ng'hondolo <verse eid="NUM 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 29:4" />na chilo imwe kwa chila mwanang'hondolo. <verse eid="NUM 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 29:5" />Kaidi mwizalava bebelu da luti kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya uhasanyi muladi kumtendelani kuilumba. <verse eid="NUM 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 29:6" />Mwizalava vinhu vino hamwe na nhosa ya usage ya mwezi wa sambi na nhosa yake ya mhule na nhosa zake za ching'waji fana viya voilagilizigwa. Mnung'ho wake unogile wizamnogeza Mndewa Mulungu. Iyo ni nhambiko iyolaviligwa Mndewa Mulungu kwa moto.<verse eid="NUM 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siku ya kuilumba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:26-32">Walawi 23:26-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 29:7" />“Muna isiku ya longo ya mwezi wa saba mwizakuwa na mting'hano wa kutosa kwa Mulungu, sekemuje hebu sekemusang'hane sang'hano yoyose. <verse eid="NUM 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 29:8" />Mwizamulavila Mndewa Mulungu nhambiko ya kutimbula ili na mnung'ho unogile wa kumnogeza Mndewa Mulungu, dang'ang'a lume na bebelu da ng'hondolo na wanang'hondolo saba wa mwaka umwe, wose sekewawe na chilema. <verse eid="NUM 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 29:9" />Iviya mwizalava usage unogile wouhanganyizigwe na mavuta chilo nhatu hamwe na ng'ombe lume iyo, chilo mbili hamwe na bebelu da ng'hondolo, <verse eid="NUM 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 29:10" />na chilo imwe kwa chila mwanang'hondolo. <verse eid="NUM 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 29:11" />Iviya mwizalava bebelu da luti kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya uhasanyi, na nhambiko ija ya kuilumba hamwe na nhambiko ya kutimbula ya chila siku na nhosa yake ya usage na nhosa zake za ching'waji.<verse eid="NUM 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhambiko ya Dugila da Vibanda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:33-43">Walawi 23:33-43</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:13-17">Kumbukumbu 16:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 29:12" />“Muna isiku ya longo na tano ya mwezi wesaba mwizakuwa na mting'hano wa kutosa kwa Mulungu, sekemusang'hane usang'hano, mwizamtendela dugila Mndewa Mulungu kwa siku saba. <verse eid="NUM 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 29:13" />Mwizalava nhambiko ya kutimbula kwa moto ili na mnung'ho unogile wa kumnogeza Mndewa Mulungu, madang'ang'a malume longo na matatu na mabebelu ya ng'hondolo maidi na wanang'hondolo longo na wane weli na mwaka umwe, wose sekewawe na chilema. <verse eid="NUM 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 29:14" />Hamwe na nhosa zake na usage unogile wouhanganyigwe na mavuta, chilo nhatu kwa chila dang'ang'a lume na chilo mbili kwa chila ng'hondolo <verse eid="NUM 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 29:15" />na chilo imwe kwa chila mwanang'hondolo <verse eid="NUM 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 29:16" />na bebelu da luti kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya uhasanyi, hamwe na nhambiko ya kutimbula kwa moto ya chila siku, hamwe na nhosa yake ya usage na nhosa yake ya ching'waji.<verse eid="NUM 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 29:17" />“Siku yekaidi mwizalava madang'ang'a longo na maidi na mabebelu ya ng'hondolo maidi na wanang'hondolo walume longo na wane weli na mwaka umwe welibule chilema. <verse eid="NUM 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 29:18" />Iviya mwizalava nhosa ya usage na nhosa ya ving'waji hamwe na yaja madang'ang'a malume na ng'hondolo na wanang'hondolo fana viili peta yawo, fana viya viilagilizigwe. <verse eid="NUM 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 29:19" />Iviya mwizalava bebelu da luti kuwa nhambiko ya uhasanyi, hamwe na nhambiko ija ya kutimbula kwa moto, hamwe na nhosa yake ya usage na nhosa yake ya ching'waji.<verse eid="NUM 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 29:20" />“Muna isiku yetatu mwizalava madang'ang'a malume longo na dimwe na ng'hondolo waidi na wanang'hondolo longo na wane weli na mwaka umwe, welibule chilema. <verse eid="NUM 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 29:21" />Iviya mwizalava nhosa ya usage na nhosa ya ching'waji, hamwe na madang'ang'a malume na bebelu da ng'hondolo na wanang'hondolo walume kuilinga na peta yawo, fana voilagilizigwe. <verse eid="NUM 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 29:22" />Iviya mwizalava bebelu da luti kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya uhasanyi, hamwe na nhambiko ija ya kutimbula na nhosa yake ya usage na nhosa yake ya ching'waji.<verse eid="NUM 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 29:23" />“Muna isiku yekane mwizalava madang'ang'a malume longo na mabebelu ya ng'hondolo maidi na wanang'hondolo longo na wane weli na mwaka umwe welibule chilema. <verse eid="NUM 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 29:24" />Iviya mwizalava nhosa ya usage na nhosa ya ching'waji, hamwe na madang'ang'a malume yayo na ng'hondolo na wanang'hondolo kuilinga na peta yawo, fana voilagilizigwe. <verse eid="NUM 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 29:25" />Iviya mwizalava bebelu da luti kuwa nhambiko ya uhasanyi hamwe na nhambiko ya kutimbula, hamwe na nhosa yake ya usage na nhosa yake ya ching'waji.<verse eid="NUM 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 29:26" />“Muna isiku yetano mwizalava madang'ang'a malume kenda na ng'hondolo waidi na mabebelu ya ng'hondolo longo na mane yeli na mwaka umwe, wose sekewawe na chilema. <verse eid="NUM 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 29:27" />Iviya mwizalava nhosa ya usage na nhosa ya ching'waji, hamwe na madang'ang'a malume na ng'hondolo na wanang'hondolo kuilinga na peta yawo, fana voilagilizigwe. <verse eid="NUM 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 29:28" />Iviya mwizalava bebelu da luti kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya uhasanyi, hamwe na nhambiko ya kutimbula na nhosa yake ya usage na nhosa yake ya ching'waji.<verse eid="NUM 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 29:29" />“Muna isiku yesita mwizalava madang'ang'a malume manane na ng'hondolo waidi na wanang'hondolo walume longo na wane weli na mwaka umwe, wose sekewawe na chilema. <verse eid="NUM 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 29:30" />Iviya mwizalava nhosa ya usage na nhosa ya ching'waji, hamwe na madang'ang'a malume na bebelu da ng'hondolo na wanang'hondolo walume kuilinga na peta yawo, fana voilagilizigwe. <verse eid="NUM 29:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 29:31" />Iviya mwizalava bebelu da luti kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya uhasanyi, hamwe na nhambiko ya kutimbula na nhosa yake ya usage na nhosa yake ya ching'waji.<verse eid="NUM 29:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 29:32" />“Muna isiku yesaba mwizalava madang'ang'a malume saba na mabebelu ya ng'hondolo maidi na wanang'hondolo walume longo na wane weli na mwaka umwe, wose sekewawe na chilema. <verse eid="NUM 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 29:33" />Iviya mwizalava nhosa ya usage na nhosa ya ching'waji, hamwe na madang'ang'a malume na bebelu da ng'ondolo na wanang'hondolo kuilinga na peta yawo, fana voilagilizigwe. <verse eid="NUM 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 29:34" />Iviya mwizalava bebelu da luti kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya uhasanyi, hamwe na nhambiko ya kutimbula na nhosa yake ya usage na nhosa yake ya ching'waji.<verse eid="NUM 29:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 29:35" />“Muna isiku yenane mwizakuwa na mting'hano wa kutosa kwa Mulungu, sekemutende usang'hano wowose. <verse eid="NUM 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 29:36" />Mbali mwizalava nhambiko ya kutimbula iyolaviligwa Mndewa Mulungu kwa moto ili na mnung'ho unogile wa kumnogeza Mulungu, dang'ang'a lume na bebelu da ng'hondolo na wanang'hondolo walume saba weli na mwaka umwe, wose sekewawe na chilema. <verse eid="NUM 29:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 29:37" />Iviya mwizalava nhosa ya usage na nhosa ya ching'waji, hamwe na dang'ang'a lume ijo na bebelu da ng'hondolo ijo na wanang'hondolo wawo kuilinga na peta ya wanyama, fana voilagilizigwe. <verse eid="NUM 29:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 29:38" />Iviya mwizalava bebelu da luti kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya uhasanyi, hamwe na nhambiko ya kutimbula na nhosa yake ya usage na nhosa yake ya ching'waji.<verse eid="NUM 29:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 29:39" />“Nhambiko zino mwizamulavila Mndewa Mulungu muna yamadugila yenu yapangigwe, hamwe na vilaho venu na nhambiko zenu za kulonda wenyewo, kuwa nhambiko zenu za kutimbula na nhosa zenu za usage na nhosa zenu za ching'waji na nhambiko zenu za tindiwalo.”<verse eid="NUM 29:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 29:40" />Ivo Musa kawalongela Waisilaili chila chinhu chiyalagilizigwe na Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="NUM 29:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="NUM 30" />
  <para style="s">Malagilizo kusonhela vilaho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 30:1" />Maabaho Musa kawalongela walangulizi wa makabila ya Isilaili, “Chino icho chayalagilize Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 30:2" />Munhu yahamwikila chilaho Mndewa Mulungu hebu vondayailahe muladi kuifunga yeye mwenyewo kwa chilagano, kolondeka sekeyagalule mbuli yake, kezatenda viya viyalongile kwa mulomo wake.<verse eid="NUM 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 30:3" />“Mndele yeli yang'hali kokala muna ikaye ya tati yake yahamulahila Mndewa Mulungu hebu kuifunga mwenyewo kwa chilagano, <verse eid="NUM 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 30:4" />tati yake yahahulika chilaho hebu chilagano chiya na halonga chochose, mndele ija kezafungigwa na chilaho na chilagano choyachitendile.<verse eid="NUM 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 30:5" />“Mbali one tati yake komgomesa lusita voyohulika voyokwika chilagano icho, hezafungigwa na chilaho. Mndewa Mulungu kezamulekelela kwaviya tati yake kamgomesa.<verse eid="NUM 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 30:6" />“Ihawa mndele yahasoligwa yahamala kwika chilagano hebu kaifunga kwa chilaho chake bila kugesa <verse eid="NUM 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 30:7" />na mulumake yahahulika mbuli iyo na hamgomesa, imuke kezafungigwa na chilaho chake chiyekile. <verse eid="NUM 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 30:8" />Mbali one mulumake yahamgomesa siku iyo iyahulike, baho mulume iyo kezasegeza chilagano icho cha imuke na chilaho chiya chiyailahile bila kugesa. Mndewa Mulungu kezamulekelela.<verse eid="NUM 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 30:9" />“Mbali chilaho hebu chilagano chochose chikigwe na mgane hebu muke yasigwe, kezafungigwa na chilaho chake. <verse eid="NUM 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 30:10" />One muke yasoligwe yahailaha hebu yaheka chilagano yahawa ukaye kwa mulumake, <verse eid="NUM 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 30:11" />na mulumake yahahulika mbuli iyo na hamgomese hebu kumulongela chinhu chochose, baho vilaho na vilagano vake vose vizamfunga. <verse eid="NUM 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 30:12" />Mbali one mulumake yahamgomesa viyohulika mbuli zake, muke iyo halondeka kuchifikiza chilaho chake. Mndewa Mulungu kezamulekelela muke iyo kwaviya mulumake kamgomesa kufikiza chilagano chake. <verse eid="NUM 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 30:13" />Mulumake kodaha kutogola hebu kusegeza chila chilaho hebu chilagano chochimfunga muke iyo. <verse eid="NUM 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 30:14" />Mbali one mulumake yahamnyamalila siku ija viyahulike, baho kezakuwa katogola vilaho vake vose na vilagano vake vose, mana mulumake viyahulike kanyamala. <verse eid="NUM 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 30:15" />Mbali yahazilema na kuzisegeza yahamala kuhulika, baho mulume iyo kezasola ubananzi wa muke wake.”<verse eid="NUM 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 30:16" />Zino izo ndagilizi Mndewa Mulungu zoyamulagilize Musa kusonhela mulume na muke wake, na kusonhela tata na mndele wake, mndele wake yahawa muna ikaye ya tati yake.<verse eid="NUM 30:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="NUM 31" />
  <para style="s">Waisilaili woitowa ng'hondo na Wamidiani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 31:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 31:2" />“Uwalihilizile Wamidiani kwa chiya chowawatendele Waisilaili, maabaho weye kwizadanganika.”<verse eid="NUM 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 31:3" />Ivo Musa kawalongela wanhu, “Wasasaleni walume kwa ng'hondo, wahite wakawatowe Wamidiani muladi kuwalihilizila kwa ichimu cha Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 31:4" />Kulawa chila kabila da Isilaili molondeka muwagale walume magana longo kuna ing'hondo.”<verse eid="NUM 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 31:5" />Walavigwa mwa Waisilaili maelufu, walume magana longo chila kabila, walume wowasasaligwe kuitowa kuna ing'hondo wakala 12,000. <verse eid="NUM 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 31:6" />Musa kawagala kuna ing'hondo walume magana longo chila kabila, hamwe na Finehasi mwana wa mkulu wa nhambiko Eleazali, na via va hanhu helile. Muna yamakono yake kamha mhalati za kusinhusa. <verse eid="NUM 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 31:7" />Waitowa isi ya Midiani, fana viya Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize Musa, wawakoma walume wose. <verse eid="NUM 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 31:8" />Mwa wanhu wose wowakomigwe kukala na wafalume watano, nawo ni Evi na Lekemu na Suli na Huli na Leba. Iviya wamkoma kwa panga Balaamu mwana wa Beoli.<verse eid="NUM 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 31:9" />Waisilaili wawasola mateka wanaake wa Midiani na wana wawo na ng'ombe wawo wose na ng'hondolo wawo wose na vinhu vawo vose wavisola. <verse eid="NUM 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 31:10" />Mabululu yawo yose na kaye zawo na malago yawo yose visomigwa kwa moto. <verse eid="NUM 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 31:11" />Wasola vinhu vose viwahokile na via vose viwapatile kuna ing'hondo, wanhu na wanyama. <verse eid="NUM 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 31:12" />Na wawagala wanaake na vinhu viwavihokile haulongozi wa Musa na mkulu wa nhambiko Eleazali na mting'hano wa Waisilaili, hana yamalago hana izisi zili muna dibawe da Moabu habehi na lwanda lwa Yoludani uli malola na bululu da Yeliko.<verse eid="NUM 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubwela kulawa kuna ing'hondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 31:13" />Musa na mkulu wa nhambiko Eleazali na walangulizi wose wa mting'hano, walawa kunze ya lago na wahita kuwahokela. <verse eid="NUM 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 31:14" />Musa kehilwa na walangulizi wa watowang'hondo na wakalizi wa maelufu na wakalizi wa magana wowabwelile kulawa kuna ing'hondo. <verse eid="NUM 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 31:15" />Musa kawauza, “Habali muwaleka wanaake wano wasigale wagima? <verse eid="NUM 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 31:16" />Loleni, wanaake wano wawo wayasondelele magesa ya Balaamu na kuwatendeza Waisilaili wamuhasanye Mndewa Mulungu kuja Peoli. Lekamana tamu diwezila wanhu wa Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 31:17" />Lelo wakomeni wana wose wa chilume na chila muke yoyabandamigwe na mulume, <verse eid="NUM 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 31:18" />mbali wanaake waja weli hawanaibandama na mulume, wasigale wagima kwa ichimu chenu. <verse eid="NUM 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 31:19" />Yoyose yakomile munhu hebu kudalisa mtufi wa munhu yakomigwe kolondeka yakale kunze ya lago kwa siku saba. Muna isiku yetatu na siku yesaba molondeka mwiisafye mweye wenyewo na mateka wenu. <verse eid="NUM 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 31:20" />Iviya molondeka mudisafye chila walo na chila chinhu chochitendigwe kwa mbende hebu kwa mazoya ya luti hebu kwa mbiki.”<verse eid="NUM 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 31:21" />Mkulu wa nhambiko Eleazali kawalongela walume wowabwelile kulawa kuna ing'hondo, “Yano ni malagilizo Mndewa Mulungu yoyamulagilize Musa, <verse eid="NUM 31:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 31:22" />zahabu na hela na shaba na chuma na bati na madini ya mbwewe, <verse eid="NUM 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 31:23" />na chila chinhu chochidaha kwima muumoto, mwizachifoseza muna umoto, nacho chizakuwa chela. Hamwe na yano chizasafyigwa kwa mazi ya kusafya, na chila hachidaha kwima muumoto mwizachifoseza muna yamazi. <verse eid="NUM 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 31:24" />Muna isiku yesaba mwizafuwa mawalo yenu, baho mwizakuwa mwela na modaha kwingila muna dilago.”<verse eid="NUM 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 31:25" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 31:26" />“Weye na mkulu wa nhambiko Eleazali, hamwe na walangulizi wa ng'holo za Waisilaili, peteni vinhu vovihokigwe kuna ing'hondo na wanhu na wanyama. <verse eid="NUM 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 31:27" />Goleni vinhu ivo muna yamabugulu maidi, bugulu dimwe da wowahitile kuna ing'hondo na bugulu dimwenga da mting'hano wose. <verse eid="NUM 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 31:28" />Maabaho muna dibugulu da walume walawile kuna ing'hondo, bagula mchango kwa ichimu cha Mndewa Mulungu. Chinhu chimwe kulawa muna ichila vinhu magana matano, iwe wanhu hebu ng'ombe hebu chihongwe hebu ng'hondolo hebu luti, <verse eid="NUM 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 31:29" />umwing'he mkulu wa nhambiko Eleazali kuwa mchango kwa Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 31:30" />Kulawa muna dibugulu da mting'hano wose, sola hanhu hamwe ha chila malongo matano, iwe ng'ombe hebu chihongwe hebu ng'hondolo hebu luti. Ivo kwizaweng'ha Walawi wowosang'hana muna dihema da Mulungu.” <verse eid="NUM 31:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 31:31" />Musa na mkulu wa nhambiko Eleazali watenda fana viya Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 31:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 31:32" />Vinhu viwahokile watowang'hondo kuna ing'hondo vikala ng'hondolo 675,000 <verse eid="NUM 31:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 31:33" />na ng'ombe wakala 72,000 <verse eid="NUM 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 31:34" />na vihongwe wakala 61,000 <verse eid="NUM 31:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 31:35" />na wanaake hawaibandame na walume wakala 32,000.<verse eid="NUM 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 31:36" />Nusu yake, hanhu howagoleligwe wowahitile kuna ing'hondo wakala ng'hondolo 337,500 <verse eid="NUM 31:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 31:37" />na ng'hondolo 675 walavigwa kwa ichimu cha Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 31:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 31:38" />Ng'ombe wa wakalizi wakala 36,000, mwa iwawo, ng'ombe malongo saba na waidi walavigwa kwa ichimu cha Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 31:39" />Vihongwe wakala 30,500, mwa iwawo, malongo sita na imwe wawalava kwa ichimu cha Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 31:40" />Wanhu wakala 16,000, mwa iwawo, wanhu malongo matatu na waidi wawalava kwa ichimu cha Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 31:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 31:41" />Ivo Musa kamwing'ha mkulu wa nhambiko Eleazali vinhu vovilavigwe kuwa mchango kwa Mndewa Mulungu, fana viya Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 31:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 31:42" />Nusu yoweng'higwe Waisilaili ija yoyaibagule Musa na nusu ija yoweng'higwe wakalizi wowahitile kuna ing'hondo, <verse eid="NUM 31:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 31:43" />nusu ya mting'hano wa Waisilaili ikala ng'hondolo 337,500 <verse eid="NUM 31:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 31:44" />na ng'ombe wakala 36,000 <verse eid="NUM 31:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 31:45" />na vihongwe wakala 30,500 <verse eid="NUM 31:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 31:46" />na wanhu wakala 16,000 <verse eid="NUM 31:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 31:47" />Kulawa muna inusu iyo yoweng'higwe Waisilaili, Musa kasola imwe chila muna yamalongo matano ya wanhu na wanyama, fana viyalagilizigwe na Mndewa Mulungu, kaweng'ha Walawi wowasang'hane muna dihema da Mulungu.<verse eid="NUM 31:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 31:48" />Maabaho wakulu wa mabumbila wowakalile walangulizi wa maelufu na walangulizi wa magana wahita kwa Musa <verse eid="NUM 31:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 31:49" />na wamulongela, “Cheye wasang'hani wako chiwapeta wakalizi wose wochiwalongoza, chiwona kuwa habule hata imwe yahunguke. <verse eid="NUM 31:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 31:50" />Ivo chigala vinhu kwa Mndewa Mulungu, chiyapatile chila munhu, via va zahabu na viguku na bangili na mhete za chilaguso na vipuli na usalu. Chivilava fana maliho kwa ugima wetu haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu.” <verse eid="NUM 31:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 31:51" />Musa na mkulu wa nhambiko Eleazali wahokela vinhu vose vovihambigwe kwa zahabu. <verse eid="NUM 31:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 31:52" />Zahabu yose yowamulavile Mndewa Mulungu ikala chilo magana maidi. <verse eid="NUM 31:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 31:53" />Mbali chila mkalizi kasola vinhu kwa ichimu chake mwenyewo. <verse eid="NUM 31:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 31:54" />Ivo Musa na mkulu wa nhambiko Eleazali wahokela zahabu kulawa kwa wakulu wa wakalizi na waigala muna dihema da Mulungu, muladi iwe lukumbuso lwa Waisilaili haulongozi ha Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="NUM 31:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="NUM 32" />
  <para style="s">Makabila ya ulawilo wa zuwa wa Yoludani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 3:12-22">Kumbukumbu 3:12-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 32:1" />Makabila ya Lubeni na Gadi wakala na wanyama wengi ng'hani, viwawonile kuwa isi ya Yazeli na isi ya Gileadi zofaya kwa wanyama, <verse eid="NUM 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 32:2" />wahita kwa Musa na mkulu wa nhambiko Eleazali na walangulizi wa mting'hano. Wawalongela, <verse eid="NUM 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 32:3" />“Mabululu ya Atalosi na Diboni na Yazeli na Nimula na Heshiboni na Eleale na Sebamu na Nebo na Beoni, <verse eid="NUM 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 32:4" />isi ija Mndewa Mulungu kaihuma kwa ichimu cha Waisilaili, ni isi inogile kwa wanyama, cheye china wanyama wengi ng'hani. <verse eid="NUM 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 32:5" />One muhachitogolela chomulambani muching'he isi ino iwe yetu, sekemuchilose kuumwambu wa lwanda Yoludani.”<verse eid="NUM 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 32:6" />Musa kawalongela makabila ya Gadi na Lubeni, “Vino molonda kukala hano lusita ndugu zenu Waisilaili wohita kuna ing'hondo? <verse eid="NUM 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 32:7" />Habali mowabena moyo Waisilaili sekewahite kuna iisi ija yoyaweng'hile Mndewa Mulungu? <verse eid="NUM 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 32:8" />Vino niivo viwatendile tati zenu lusita viniwatumile kulawa Kadeshi Balinea muladi wahite kuilola isi iyo. <verse eid="NUM 32:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 32:9" />Kwaviya vowahitile kuna dibawe da Eshikoli, waiwona isi, viwabwelile wawabena umoyo Waisilaili muladi sekewahite kuna iisi iyaweng'hile Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 32:10" />Siku iyo Mndewa Mulungu kapata ludoko, kailaha na kalonga, <verse eid="NUM 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 32:11" />‘Noilaha kuwa habule hata mulume imwe mwa walume waja walawile Misili, kwandusila yeli na miyaka malongo maidi na kugendelela, yondayaiwone isi iyo yoniwalahile Bulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo, kwaviya hawanitegeleze. <verse eid="NUM 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 32:12" />Habule hata imwe yondayaiwone, ila Kalebu mwana wa Yefune, Mkenizi, na Yoshua mwana wa Nuni, mana wawo wamtegeleza Mndewa Mulungu.’ <verse eid="NUM 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 32:13" />Mndewa Mulungu kawawonela ludoko Waisilaili, kawatenda wawegele mchuwala kwa miyaka malongo mane, mbaka nyelesi zose zozitendile wihi haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu, wadanganika. <verse eid="NUM 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 32:14" />Lola, mweye welesi wa wanhu weli na uhasanyi, mwinuka badala ya tati zenu muladi kumongezela Mndewa Mulungu ludoko kwa Waisilaili. <verse eid="NUM 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 32:15" />One muhalema kumsondelela, kezamulekani kaidi kuchuwala na mwizawatenda wanhu wano wose wadanganike.”<verse eid="NUM 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 32:16" />Maabaho wamkwenhukila habehi na walonga, “Chizazenga mabumba kwa ichimu cha wanyama wetu na chizazenga mabululu kwa ichimu cha wanetu. <verse eid="NUM 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 32:17" />Mbali cheye wenyewo chizasola silaha zetu chihite kuna ing'hondo hamwe na ndugu zetu Waisilaili, cheye chizakuwa kuulongozi kuna ing'hondo mbaka chiwafikize hanhu hondawakale. Chipindi icho wanetu wezakala kuna yamabululu yeli na mhongono, muladi kuikaliza na wakaya wa isi iyo. <verse eid="NUM 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 32:18" />Hachizabwela muna zikaye zetu mbaka Waisilaili wose wapate uhazi wawo. <verse eid="NUM 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 32:19" />Hachizahazi hanhu hohose hamwe nawo kuumwambu wa lwanda lwa Yoludani, kwaviya cheye chipata hanhu hetu ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zua wa Yoludani.”<verse eid="NUM 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 32:20" />Musa kawalongela, “One kweli muhatenda fana viya vimulongile, basi bahano haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu muisasale kuitowa kuna ing'hondo, <verse eid="NUM 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 32:21" />na chila mulume wa kumwenu yondayasole silaha kezaloka ulwanda lwa Yoludani kwa ulangulizi wa Mndewa Mulungu, mbaka vondayawasegeze wehi wake <verse eid="NUM 32:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 32:22" />na kuisola isi ija. Yahamala yayo modaha kubwela, kwaviya mwizakuwa mukomeleza kutenda yoyamulagilizeni Mndewa Mulungu na Waisilaili wayenu. Isi ino izakuwa yenu haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="NUM 32:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 32:23" />“Mbali one mwahapotwa kutenda ivo, mwizakuwa na uhasanyi kwa Mndewa Mulungu, muvimanye kuwa mwizatagusigwa kwa uhasanyi wenu. <verse eid="NUM 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 32:24" />Ivo wazengeleni mabululu wanenu na mabumba ya wanyama wenu, mbali tendeni fana vimwikile chilagano!”<verse eid="NUM 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 32:25" />Makabila ya Gadi na Lubeni wamulongela Musa, “Cheye wasang'hani wako chizatenda fana weye mwenevale wetu vouchilagiliza. <verse eid="NUM 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 32:26" />Wake zetu na wanetu na ng'ombe wetu na ng'hondolo wetu, wezasigala hano hana yamabululu ya Gileadi. <verse eid="NUM 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 32:27" />Mbali cheye wasang'hani wako chiisasala kuitowa kuna ing'hondo kwa ulangulizi wa Mndewa Mulungu. Chizaloka lwanda lwa Yoludani na kuitowa, fana viulongile.”<verse eid="NUM 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 32:28" />Ivo Musa kawalagiliza mkulu wa nhambiko Eleazali na Yoshua mwana wa Nuni na walangulizi wa ng'holo za makabila ya Waisilaili. <verse eid="NUM 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 32:29" />Musa kawalongela, “One makabila ya Gadi na Lubeni wahaloka lwanda lwa Yoludani hamwe na mweye kuno waisasala kwa ng'hondo kwa ulangulizi wa Mndewa Mulungu, isi ihahumigwa, basi muweng'he isi ya Gileadi iwe yawo. <verse eid="NUM 32:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 32:30" />Mbali one hawaloka lwanda lwa Yoludani na kuitowa kuna ing'hondo hamwe na mweye, wezahokela uhazi wawo muna isi ya Kanaani hamwe na mweye.”<verse eid="NUM 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 32:31" />Makabila ya Gadi na Lubeni wamwidika, “Wasang'hani wako chizatenda fana viyalongile Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 32:32" />Kwa kulangulizigwa na Mndewa Mulungu, chizaloka muna iisi ya Kanaani na kuitowa kuna ing'hondo, muladi chidahe kusola uhazi wetu uko ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zua wa Yoludani.”<verse eid="NUM 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 32:33" />Basi Musa kaweng'ha wanhu wa makabila ya Gadi na Lubeni na nusu ya kabila da Manase mwana wa Yosefu, isi yose ya mfalume Sihoni wa Waamoli, isi ya mfalume Ogu wa Bashani hamwe na mabululu na isi izunguluke mabululu yayo. <verse eid="NUM 32:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 32:34" />Kabila da Gadi wazenga mabululu ya Diboni na Atalosi na Aloeli <verse eid="NUM 32:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 32:35" />na Atilosi Shofani na Yazeli na Yogibeha <verse eid="NUM 32:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 32:36" />na Besi Nimila na Besi Halani, mabululu yeli na mhongono na vikwama va ng'hondolo. <verse eid="NUM 32:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 32:37" />Kabila da Lubeni wazenga mabululu ya Heshiboni na Eleale na Kiliasaimu <verse eid="NUM 32:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 32:38" />na Nebo na Baali Meoni na Sibima, mazina ya mabululu yayo yagalusigwa. Mabululu yowazengile wayeng'ha mazina yamwenga.<verse eid="NUM 32:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 32:39" />Welesi wa Makili mwana wa Manase wahita mbaka Gileadi, waitowa isi iyo na kuiteka na kuwawinga Waamoli wowakalile umo. <verse eid="NUM 32:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 32:40" />Ivo Musa kaweng'ha wanhu wa welesi wa Makili mwana wa Manase isi ya Gileadi, nawo wakala umo. <verse eid="NUM 32:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 32:41" />Maabaho Yaili mwana wa Manase, kahita na kuvisola vibululu vimwenga va Gileadi, kaving'ha zina, Hawosi Yaili. <verse eid="NUM 32:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 32:42" />Noba kaisola isi ya Kenasi na vibululu vake, kaitanga Noba dili zina jake mwenyewo.<verse eid="NUM 32:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="NUM 33" />
  <para style="s">Mwanza kulawa Misili mbaka Moabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 33:1" />Ino niiyo miyanza ya Waisilaili viwalawile muna iisi ya Misili kwa mabumbila yawo kwa kulangulizigwa na Musa na Haluni. <verse eid="NUM 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 33:2" />Musa kandika zina da chila hanhu howekile lago, lago mbaka lago, kwa lagilizo da Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="NUM 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 33:3" />Waisilaili wasegela muna dibululu da Lamasesi kwa ugalu ng'hani haulongozi wa Wamisili, siku ya longo na tano ya mwezi wa mwanduso, siku dimwe vidimalile Dugila da Pasaka. <verse eid="NUM 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 33:4" />Uko Wamisili wakala wowawanda wana wawo wa udele wose wa chilume woyawakomile Mndewa Mulungu na Mndewa Mulungu katagusa mbaka milungu yawo.<verse eid="NUM 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 33:5" />Waisilaili wasegela Lamesesi na weka lago jawo uko Sukosi. <verse eid="NUM 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 33:6" />Kulawa Sukosi weka lago jawo uko Esamu, mumgwazo wa chuwala. <verse eid="NUM 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 33:7" />Wasegela Esamu na wabwela Pihahilosi, ili ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zua wa Baali Sefoni, weka lago jawo kuulongozi wa Migidoli. <verse eid="NUM 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 33:8" />Wasegela Pihahilosi, wafosela hagati ya Bahali ya Shamu na kwingila muna ichuwala, wagenda siku nhatu muna ichuwala cha Esamu, weka lago jawo uko Mala. <verse eid="NUM 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 33:9" />Wasegela Mala na wahita Elimu, uko Elimu kukala na nzasa za mazi longo na mbili na mitende malongo saba, weka lago jawo uko.<verse eid="NUM 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 33:10" />Wasegela Elimu na weka lago jawo habehi na Bahali ya Shamu. <verse eid="NUM 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 33:11" />Wasegela habehi na Bahali ya Shamu na weka lago jawo kuna ichuwala cha Sini. <verse eid="NUM 33:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 33:12" />Wasegela muna ichuwala cha Sini na weka lago jawo uko Dofuka. <verse eid="NUM 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 33:13" />Wasegela Dofuka na weka lago jawo uko Alushi. <verse eid="NUM 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 33:14" />Wasegela Alushi na weka lago jawo uko Lefidimu, uko kukala kwabule mazi ya kung'wa.<verse eid="NUM 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 33:15" />Wasegela Lefidimu na weka lago jawo muna ichuwala cha Sinai. <verse eid="NUM 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 33:16" />Wasegela muna ichuwala cha Sinai na weka lago jawo uko Kibilosi Hataava. <verse eid="NUM 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 33:17" />Wasegela Kibilosi Hataava na weka lago jawo uko Haselosi.<verse eid="NUM 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 33:18" />Wasegela Haselosi na weka lago jawo uko Lisima. <verse eid="NUM 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 33:19" />Wasegela Lisima na weka lago jawo uko Limoni Pelezi, <verse eid="NUM 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 33:20" />Wasegela Limoni Pelezi na weka lago jawo uko Libina. <verse eid="NUM 33:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 33:21" />Wasegela Libina na weka lago jawo uko Lisa. <verse eid="NUM 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 33:22" />Wasegela Lisa na weka lago jawo uko Kehelasa. <verse eid="NUM 33:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 33:23" />Wasegela Kehelasa na weka lago jawo kuna mulima wa Shefeli. <verse eid="NUM 33:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 33:24" />Wasegela kuna mulima wa Shefeli na weka lago jawo uko Halada. <verse eid="NUM 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 33:25" />Wasegela Halada na weka lago jawo uko Makelosi. <verse eid="NUM 33:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 33:26" />Wasegela Makelosi na weka lago jawo uko Tahasi. <verse eid="NUM 33:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 33:27" />Wasegela Tahasi na weka lago jawo uko Tela. <verse eid="NUM 33:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 33:28" />Wasegela Tela na weka lago jawo uko Mitika. <verse eid="NUM 33:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 33:29" />Wasegela Mitika na weka lago jawo uko Hashimona. <verse eid="NUM 33:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 33:30" />Wasegela Hashimona na weka lago jawo uko Moselosi. <verse eid="NUM 33:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 33:31" />Wasegela Moselosi na weka lago jawo uko Bene Yaakani. <verse eid="NUM 33:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 33:32" />Wasegela Bene Yaakani na weka lago jawo uko Holi Hagidigadi. <verse eid="NUM 33:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 33:33" />Wasegela Holi Hagidigadi na weka lago jawo uko Yotibasa. <verse eid="NUM 33:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 33:34" />Wasegela Yotibasa na weka lago jawo uko Abilona. <verse eid="NUM 33:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 33:35" />Wasegela Abilona na weka lago jawo uko Esioni Gebeli. <verse eid="NUM 33:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 33:36" />Wasegela Esioni Gebeli na weka lago jawo uko Kadeshi, kuna ichuwala cha Sini. <verse eid="NUM 33:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 33:37" />Wasegela Kadeshi na weka lago jawo kuna mulima wa Holi, muna imhaka ya isi ya Edomu. <verse eid="NUM 33:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 33:38" />Mkulu wa nhambiko Haluni kakwela kuna mulima wa Holi kwa ndagilizi ya Mndewa Mulungu, uko kadanganika muna isiku ya mwanduso ya mwezi wetano, muna umwaka wa malongo mane, kwandusila Waisilaili viwalawile Misili. <verse eid="NUM 33:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 33:39" />Haluni viyadanganike kuna mulima wa Holi kakala na miyaka 123.<verse eid="NUM 33:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 33:40" />Mkanaani, mfalume wa Aladi yoyakalile ubanzi wa kusi wa isi ya Kanaani, kahulika kuwa Waisilaili wokwiza.<verse eid="NUM 33:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 33:41" />Waisilaili wasegela kuna umulima wa Holi na weka lago jawo uko Salimona. <verse eid="NUM 33:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 33:42" />Wasegela Salimona na weka lago jawo uko Punoni. <verse eid="NUM 33:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 33:43" />Wasegela Punoni na weka lago jawo uko Obosi. <verse eid="NUM 33:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 33:44" />Wasegela Obosi na weka lago jawo uko Iye Abalimu, muna imhaka ya Moabu. <verse eid="NUM 33:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 33:45" />Wasegela Iye Abalimu na weka lago jawo uko Diboni Gadi. <verse eid="NUM 33:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 33:46" />Wasegela Diboni Gadi na weka lago jawo uko Alimoni Dibilasaimu. <verse eid="NUM 33:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 33:47" />Wasegela Alimoni Dibilasaimu na weka lago jawo kuna imilima ya Abalimu, habehi na mulima wa Nebo. <verse eid="NUM 33:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 33:48" />Wasegela kuna imilima ya Abalimu na weka lago jawo kuna yamabawe ya Moabu habehi na lwanda lwa Yoludani uli malola na bululu da Yeliko. <verse eid="NUM 33:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 33:49" />Kuja kuna yamabawe ya Moabu weka lago jawo mumgwazo wa lwanda lwa Yoludani, kwandusila Besi Yeshimosi mbaka Abeli Shitimu.<verse eid="NUM 33:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagilizo ing'hali kwingila muna iisi ya Kanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 33:50" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa kuna dibawe da Moabu habehi na lwanda lwa Yoludani uli malola na bululu da Yeliko, <verse eid="NUM 33:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 33:51" />“Walongele Waisilaili, ‘Vondamuloke ulwanda lwa Yoludani kuhita kuna iisi ya Kanaani, <verse eid="NUM 33:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 33:52" />molondeka kuwawinga wakaya wose wa isi iyo kumwenu. Mwizazinanga nyang'hiti zawo zose za mabwe na za chuma cha kuhonda na kuhabomola chila hanhu hawo ha kutambikila. <verse eid="NUM 33:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 33:53" />Mwizaisola isi iyo iwe yenu na kukala umo, kwaviya niye nimwing'hani iwe yenu. <verse eid="NUM 33:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 33:54" />Mwizaigola isi iyo kwa mhiya kuilinga na kaye zenu, kabila kulu wapate hanhu hakulu na kabila dodo wapate hanhu hadodo. <verse eid="NUM 33:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 33:55" />Mbali one hamuwawingile wakaya wa isi iyo, waja wondawasigale wezakuwa fana mabale muna yameso yenu hebu miwa chila ubanzi na wezamgazani. <verse eid="NUM 33:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 33:56" />Maabaho nizamtendelani fana vonigesile kuwatendela wawo.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 33:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="NUM 34" />
  <para style="s">Mhaka za Kanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 34:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 34:2" />“Walagilize Waisilaili na uwalongele, ‘Vondamwingile muna iisi ya Kanaani, isi ino izakuwa uhazi wenu, mhaka za hanhu baho zizakuwa fana vino. <verse eid="NUM 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 34:3" />Ubanzi wa kusi mhaka yenu izakuwa kulawa chuwala cha Sini kufosela ubanzi wa Edomu. Izakwandusila ulawilo wa zuwa ubanzi wa kusi kuuhelelo wa Bahali ya Munyu. <verse eid="NUM 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 34:4" />Maabaho izafosela kusi kuhita ubanzi wa Akilabimu na kufosela Sini mbaka Kadeshi Balinea, ubanzi wa kusi. Kulawa uko, mhaka izafosela Hasali Adali na kufosa mbaka Azimoni. <verse eid="NUM 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 34:5" />Kulawa Azimoni mhaka izafosela kuna ichizanda cha Misili na izahelela muna Ibahali ya Meditelaniya.<verse eid="NUM 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 34:6" />“ ‘Mhaka yenu ya ubanzi wa uswilo wa zua izakuwa Bahali ya Meditelaniya.<verse eid="NUM 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 34:7" />“ ‘Mhaka yenu ya ubanzi wa kasikazi izakuwa fana vino, kulawa Bahali ya Meditelaniya, mwizatula mkuza mbaka kuna umulima wa Holi, <verse eid="NUM 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 34:8" />na kulawa mulima wa Holi mwizatula mkuza mbaka Hamasi. Maabaho mhaka izahita mbaka uko Sedadi, <verse eid="NUM 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 34:9" />na izagendelela mbaka Zifiloni na kuhelela uko Hazali Enani. Iyo izakuwa mhaka yenu ya ubanzi wa kasikazi.<verse eid="NUM 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 34:10" />“ ‘Mhaka yenu ya ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zua mwizatula mkuza kwandusila Hazali Enani mbaka Shefamu. <verse eid="NUM 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 34:11" />Mhaka izalawa Shefamu kuhita Libila, ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zua wa Aini, maabaho izagendelela na kufika ubanzi wa lamba da Galilaya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">34:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Chiebulaniya yotangigwa Kinelesi.</char></note>. <verse eid="NUM 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 34:12" />Maabaho mhaka izafosela lwanda lwa Yoludani na kulawilila kuna Ibahali ya Munyu. Iyo izakuwa isi yenu fana mhaka viili.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 34:13" />Maabaho Musa kawalagiliza Waisilaili, kalonga, “Ino niiyo isi yondamuihazi kwa kutowa mhiya, isi ija Mndewa Mulungu iyalagilize weng'higwe makabila kenda na nusu. <verse eid="NUM 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 34:14" />Kwaviya ng'holo za kabila da Lubeni na kabila da Gadi na nusu ya kabila da Manase wapata uhazi wawo kuilinga na ng'holo zawo. <verse eid="NUM 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 34:15" />Makabila yano maidi na nusu yahokela uhazi wawo kwandusila kuumwambu wa lwanda lwa Yoludani, habehi na Yeliko, ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zua.”<verse eid="NUM 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walangulizi wa makabila wondawagole isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 34:16" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 34:17" />“Mkulu wa nhambiko Eleazali na Yoshua mwana wa Nuni, niiwawo wondawawagolele wanhu isi kuwa yawo. <verse eid="NUM 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 34:18" />Sagula mulangulizi imwe kulawa chila kabila muladi wakutaze kuigola isi. <verse eid="NUM 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 34:19" />Yano ni mazina ya walume. Kulawa kabila da Yuda kakala Kalebu mwana wa Yefune.<verse eid="NUM 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 34:20" />Kulawa kabila da Simeoni kakala Shemueli mwana wa Amihudi.<verse eid="NUM 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 34:21" />Kulawa kabila da Benjamini kakala Elidadi mwana wa Kisiloni.<verse eid="NUM 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 34:22" />Kulawa kabila da Dani kakala Buki mwana wa Yogili.<verse eid="NUM 34:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 34:23" />Kulawa kabila da Manase mwana wa Yosefu kakala Hanieli mwana wa Efodi.<verse eid="NUM 34:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 34:24" />Kulawa kabila da Efulaimu mwana wa Yosefu kakala Kemueli mwana wa Shifitani.<verse eid="NUM 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 34:25" />Kulawa kabila da Zabuloni kakala Elisafani mwana wa Palinaki. <verse eid="NUM 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 34:26" />Kulawa kabila da Isakali kakala Palitieli mwana wa Azani.<verse eid="NUM 34:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 34:27" />Kulawa kabila da Asheli kakala Ahihudi mwana wa Shelomi.<verse eid="NUM 34:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 34:28" />Kulawa kabila da Nafutali kakala Pedaheli mwana wa Amihudi.”<verse eid="NUM 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 34:29" />Wano niiwawo wanhu waja Mndewa Mulungu woyawalagilize wawagolele Waisilaili uhazi muna iisi ya Kanaani.<verse eid="NUM 34:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="NUM 35" />
  <para style="s">Mabululu ya Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 35:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa kuna dibawe da Moabu habehi na lwanda lwa Yoludani uli malola na bululu da Yeliko, kamulongela, <verse eid="NUM 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 35:2" />“Walagilize Waisilaili waweng'he Walawi hanhu ha kukala kulawa muna uuhazi wawo. Na waweng'he hanhu ha kudimila wanyama wawo, habehi na yamabululu. <verse eid="NUM 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 35:3" />Mabululu yayo yezakuwa yawo, nawo wezakala umo na hanhu ha kudimila wanyama hezakuwa kwa ichimu cha ng'ombe na wanyama wawo wamwenga.<verse eid="NUM 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 35:4" />“Hanhu ha kudimila hondamuweng'he Walawi mumgwazo ya mabululu, hezawoneka chila ubanzi utali wa mita 450 kulawa kuna zimhongono za mabululu yayo. <verse eid="NUM 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 35:5" />Ivo hanhu baho ha kudimila hezakuwa mita 900 na hezakwenela chila ubanzi, bululu ijo dizakuwa hagati. Hanhu baho hezakuwa hanhu ha kudimila mumgwazo ya mabululu yawo.<verse eid="NUM 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 35:6" />“Mabululu yondamuweng'he Walawi yezakuwa sita ya kukimbilila, yondamuyeke kwa ichimu cha munhu yondayamkome miyage bila kuilunga, muladi yakimbilile uko. Iviya mwizaweng'ha mabululu yamwenga malongo mane na maidi. <verse eid="NUM 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 35:7" />Mabululu yose yondamuweng'he Walawi ni malongo mane na manane, hamwe na hanhu ha kudimila. <verse eid="NUM 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 35:8" />Peta ya mabululu yondamuweng'he Walawi muna uhazi wa Waisilaili izasondelela ukulu wa kabila, kabila kulu dizalava mabululu mengi na kabila dodo dizalava mabululu madodo.”<verse eid="NUM 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mabululu ya kukimbilila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 19:1-13">Kumbukumbu 19:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 20:1-9">Yoshua 20:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 35:9" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 35:10" />“Walongele Waisilaili, ‘Vondamuloke lwanda lwa Yoludani na kwingila muna iisi ya Kanaani, <verse eid="NUM 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 35:11" />Saguleni mabululu yondayawe mabululu yenu ya kukimbilil. Munhu yahamkoma miyage bila ya kuilunga kodaha kukimbilila uko. <verse eid="NUM 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 35:12" />Mabululu yayo yezakuwa hanhu ha tindiwalo, muladi mkomaji sekeyakomigwe na munhu yolihiliza ing'hali hanahumizigwa hana iwanhu wose. <verse eid="NUM 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 35:13" />Mwizasagula mabululu yano sita, nayo yezakuwa mabululu yenu ya kukimbilila. <verse eid="NUM 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 35:14" />Mwizaweng'ha mabululu matatu kuumwambu wa lwanda lwa Yoludani, mwizaweng'ha mabululu matatu muna iisi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="NUM 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 35:15" />Mabululu yano yezakuwa ya kukimbilila kwa ichimu cha Waisilaili na nyambenyambe wokala hamwe nawo kwa lusita ludodo. Munhu yoyose yahamkoma miyage bila kuilunga, kodaha kukimbilila uko.<verse eid="NUM 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 35:16" />“ ‘Mbali one munhu yahamtowa miyage na chuma na kadanganika, munhu iyo ni mkomaji na kolondeka yakomigwe. <verse eid="NUM 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 35:17" />Munhu yoyose yahamtowa miyage na dibwe, yahadanganika, munhu iyo ni mkomaji na kolondeka yakomigwe. <verse eid="NUM 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 35:18" />One munhu yahamtowa miyage na lugodi loludaha kumtenda yadanganike, kadanganika, munhu iyo ni mkomaji na kolondeka yakomigwe. <verse eid="NUM 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 35:19" />Ndugu wa habehi wa munhu yoyakomigwe kezalihiliza. Yahamting'hana imkomaji, kezamkoma. <verse eid="NUM 35:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 35:20" />One munhu komwihila miyage, maabaho komsung'ha hebu komwasila chinhu kwa kumsepa, <verse eid="NUM 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 35:21" />hebu kwa kumtowa ng'honde na kudanganika, baho munhu iyo yamkomile miyage ni mkomaji na kolondeka yakomigwe. Ndugu wa habehi wa munhu yoyakomigwe kolondeka kulihiliza vondayaiting'hane nayo.<verse eid="NUM 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 35:22" />“ ‘Mbali one munhu kamsung'ha kwa kumsinhusa bila kumwihila hebu kamwasila chinhu bila kuilunga, <verse eid="NUM 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 35:23" />hebu munhu yahamwasila dibwe dodidaha kumtenda munhu yadanganike na kumkoma, ingawa hakalile mwihi wake hebu halondile kumulumiza, <verse eid="NUM 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 35:24" />baho wakaya wa bululu ijo wezahumiza hagati ya munhu yakomile na ndugu wa habehi yoyakalile wa kulihiliza kwa munhu ija yoyakomigwe kwa vodili lagilizo. <verse eid="NUM 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 35:25" />Wakaya wa bululu wezamkaliza munhu yakomile muladi sekeyakomigwe na ndugu wa munhu yoyakomigwe. Wezambweleza kuna dibululu da kukimbilila koyakimbilile. Kezakala uko mbaka vondayadanganike mkulu wa nhambiko digogogo yoyabobodigwe mavuta yelile. <verse eid="NUM 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 35:26" />Mbali one munhu yakomile yahalawa kunze ya bululu diyakimbilile lusita luja, <verse eid="NUM 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 35:27" />maabaho one ndugu wa habehi wa munhu yoyakomigwe yahamfika kunze ya mhaka ya bululu ijo da kukimbilila na kumkoma, iyo hezakuwa na ubananzi wa kukoma. <verse eid="NUM 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 35:28" />Kwaviya munhu yakomile kolondeka yakale mgati ya dibululu da kukimbilila mbaka mkulu wa nhambiko digogogo vondayadanganike, ihamala ifa ya mkulu wa nhambiko digogogo, kodaha kubwela ukaye.<verse eid="NUM 35:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 35:29" />“ ‘Malagilizo yano na ndagilizi vizazindililigwa muna uwelesi wenu, hanhu hohose hamukala.<verse eid="NUM 35:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 35:30" />“ ‘Munhu yoyose yomkoma munhu kezatagusigwa ifa kwa usindila wa wanhu waidi hebu kufosa baho. Munhu yoyose hadaha kutagusigwa ifa kwa usindila wa munhu imwe. <verse eid="NUM 35:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 35:31" />Sekemuhokele maliho yoyose kwa kugombela ugima wa mkomaji yeli na ubananzi wa kukoma, munhu iyo kolondeka yakomigwe. <verse eid="NUM 35:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 35:32" />Sekemuhokele maliho yoyose kulawa kwa munhu yoyakimbilile muna dibululu da kukimbilila muladi kumulekela yabwele ukaye yake yang'hali mkulu wa nhambiko digogogo hanadanganika. <verse eid="NUM 35:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 35:33" />One mwahatenda ivo, mwizaitenda isi yomukala yambule mwiko. Ukomaji wizaitenda isi iyo yambule mwiko, habule nhambiko yoidaha kuisafya isi iyakomigwe munhu, mbali kwa kumkoma mkomaji iyo. <verse eid="NUM 35:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 35:34" />Sekemuitende isi yomukala yambule mwiko, isi yonikala niye, kwaviya niye Mndewa Mulungu nokala hagati yenu Waisilaili.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 35:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="NUM 36" />
  <para style="s">Uhazi wa wanaake wowasoligwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 36:1" />Walangulizi wa lukolo lwa Gileadi mwana wa Makili, mwana wa Manase mwana wa Yosefu, wakwenhuka habehi na kulonga haulongozi wa Musa na walangulizi wamwenga wa Waisilaili. <verse eid="NUM 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 36:2" />Wamulongela, “Mndewa Mulungu kamulagiliza mwenevale wangu uweng'he Waisilaili uhazi wawo wa isi kwa kutowa mhiya, iviya kalagilizigwa na Mndewa Mulungu yaweng'he wandele wa Selofehadi ndugu yetu uhazi wa tati yawo. <verse eid="NUM 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 36:3" />Mbali one wahasoligwa na wanhu wa makabila yamwenga ya Isilaili, uhazi wawo wizalawa kumwetu na kuhita kwa wanhu wa kabila diwosoligwa, ivo uhazi wetu wizahunguka. <verse eid="NUM 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 36:4" />Mwaka wa kukomboligwa wa Waisilaili vondaufike, uhazi wawo wizakongezigwa muna dikabila dowosoliligwa, ivo kabila jetu hadizapata uhazi uwo.”<verse eid="NUM 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 36:5" />Musa kawalagiliza Waisilaili fana Mndewa Mulungu viyalongile, “Wanhu wa kabila da Yosefu walonga ukweli. <verse eid="NUM 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 36:6" />Vino niivo viyolagiliza Mndewa Mulungu kusonhela wandele wa Selofehadi, ‘Wodaha kusoligwa na mulume yoyose iwomulonda, mbali wasoligwe muna dikabila jawo. <verse eid="NUM 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 36:7" />Habule uhazi wa Isilaili wondaulawe kulawa kabila dimwenga, chila Muisilaili kezakwamha uhazi wa kabila jake. <verse eid="NUM 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 36:8" />Mndele yoyose yeli na uhazi wa isi muna dikabila da Isilaili, kolondeka yasoligwe na munhu wa kabila jake, muladi chila Muisilaili yasole uhazi wa tati zake. <verse eid="NUM 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 36:9" />Ivo hakwizakuwa na uhazi wowose wondauhamizigwe kulawa kabila dimwe kuhita kabila dimwenga, mana chila kabila da Isilaili dizakwamha uhazi wake.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 36:10" />Wandele wa Selofehadi watenda fana viya Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize Musa. <verse eid="NUM 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 36:11" />Mala na Tiliza na Hogila na Milika na Nuhu, wandele wa Selofehadi, wasoligwa na wana wa ndugu za tati yawo. <verse eid="NUM 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 36:12" />Wasoligwa muna dikabila da Manase mwana wa Yosefu na uhazi wawo usigala muna dikabila da tati yawo.<verse eid="NUM 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 36:13" />Zino ni ndagilizi na malagilizo Mndewa Mulungu yoyaweng'hile Waisilaili kufosela Musa muna dibawe da Moabu habehi na lwanda lwa Yoludani uli malola na bululu da Yeliko.<verse eid="NUM 36:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 36" />
</usx>